<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GEN" style="id">Vidunda Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Mwaluko</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mwaluko</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mwaluko</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mwal</para>
  <para style="mt1">Mwaluko</para>
  <para style="imt">Chilongole</para>
  <para style="ip">Ulonzi wa chikatali ulinguhola itagwa lya chitabu achi, Mwaluko, na changwaluka na ulonzi, “Aho mwaluko.” Ahyo achi ndo chitabu cha mwaluko cha Ilagano lya Katali. Chitabu achi changutulajila vinhu vyeng'ha kovilumbigwe, na vila Nguluwi navyoyaluche kilumba na wanhu. Wasomile zuwa lino wana majesa menji galivinji kwa chiwalo cha munhu ama wanhu nawandiche chitabu cha Mwaluko na ndo mhela wachi chitabu achi hochandichigwe. Wabaho walingijesa kota chitabu achi nachikungajizwa kulawa kuli vyandichigwe vilivinji vya katali, ako Babiloni, kuli mhela wa kaline ya kahano mbaka kaline ya sita, mhela Yesu loyang'hali pondigwa. Wanji wangikundiza kota Musa nakandika chitabu cha Mwaluko na kahi vitabu vinji viwele ndo Kulawa na Walawi na Hisabu na Chikumbuchilo hali mhela wa 1,300 ama 1,400 Yesu loyang'hali kupondigwa.</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha mwaluko chimema mbuli ziwele zinojile ng'hatu zilinguwatanza Wakilistu kuvizela honhu hanji heng'ha ha Bibiliya, ziwe ndo za Ilagano lya Katali ama Ilagano Linyale. Chitabu cha Mwaluko, changutulajila vila gehile vyogenjile muisi na vila wanhu weng'ha vyowalinguganigwa kuloholigwa na Mlohozi. Chitabu achi kahi, changuwika hazelu Nguluwi vyoyalingiwika goya kuwalohola wanhu. Ali lyoweza kwenela kwa uloli wa mwaluko woulagule kumuwala Yesu (Mwaluko 3:15) na ilagano lya Nguluwi kwa Abulahamu kwa kuzitambichiza isi zeng'ha ziwele amu muisi (Mwaluko 12:3).</para>
  <para style="iot">Gali mgati</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Nguluwi nakalumba isi na kahi nakawalumba Adamu na Hawa kota vyoilingusimilwa kuli sula ya 1 na sula ya 2.</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Sula ya 3 mbaka ya 5 yanguwasimila Adamu na Hawa na gehile ga hewo na lulelo lwao.</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Sula ya 6 mbaka ya 9, yangusima mbuli ya Nuhu na yila nhonya ya mazi tendema.</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Kulawila aho, chitabu cha Mwaluko changusima chila chilawile kuli mhela wa Nuhu mbaka mhela wa Abulahamu na mbuli za ilingo wa Babiloni kahi, kuli sula ya 10 na 11.</para>
  <para style="io1">5. Sula ya 12 mbaka ya 50 zangumuwala Abulahamu na ivyazi lyake na mwaluko wa isi ya Isilaeli.</para>
  <para style="io2">a. Ukomu wa Abulahamu na mchewake Sala gangusimigwa kulawa sula ya 12 mbaka sula ya 25.</para>
  <para style="io2">b. Mbuli ya ukomu wa Isaka na mchewake Lebeka gangusimigwa kulawa kuli sula ya 21 mbaka 28 na kubagama kwa heye kwangusimigwa kuli sula ya 35.</para>
  <para style="io2">c. Mbuli ya ukomu wa Yakobo na wanage na vyowalawile Kanaani kuza Misili gangusimigwa kuli sula ya 25 mbaka 50.</para>
  <para style="io2">d. Sula ya 37 mbaka 50 imema mbuli za Yusufu, mwana yaganigwe na Yakobo, na vila vyoyezile kuditigwa kuwa chilongozi mkulu wa Misili.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GEN 1"/>
  <para style="s">Kulumbigwa kwa isi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 1:1"/>Aho mwaluko, Nguluwi nakalumba kilanga na isi. <verse eid="GEN 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 1:2"/>Isi nayali kota kugunuche na nayalihela chinhu. Jiza nayali igubiche mazi menji, na Muhe wa Nguluwi nayali yekale yenele mchanya mwa mazi menji.<verse eid="GEN 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 1:3"/>Na Nguluwi nakalonga, “Kuwe kubunguzuche,” baho kubunguzuka. <verse eid="GEN 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 1:4"/>Nguluwi nakona kubunguzuka kunoga. Hamba Nguluwi kalekaniza kubunguzuka na jiza. <verse eid="GEN 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 1:5"/>Nguluwi nakaluchema lumuli “Nemisi” na jiza nakaichema “Nechilo.” Iwa matinazo na iwa mitondo, zuwa lya mwaluko.<verse eid="GEN 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 1:6"/>Nguluwi nakalonga, “Hawe honhu hagati ha mazi, ugawanuse mazi banzi mbili.” <verse eid="GEN 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 1:7"/>Nguluwi nakadita honhu aho, kalekaniza mazi gawele kuchanya na mazi gawele hasi, iwa hihyo. <verse eid="GEN 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 1:8"/>Nguluwi nakahachema “Ulanga.” Iwa matinazo na iwa mitondo, zuwa lya keli.<verse eid="GEN 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 1:9"/>Nguluwi nakalonga, “Mazi gawele hasi ha ulanga, gawe honhu hamwe, isi ili kigongo ilawile.” Iwa hihyo. <verse eid="GEN 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 1:10"/>Nguluwi nakahachema honhu aho kigongo “Isi” na nhing'hano ya mazi kahachema “Bahali”. Nakona kuta inoga.<verse eid="GEN 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 1:11"/>Hamba Nguluwi nakalonga, “Isi nayote mizuchila, mizuchila jilingulela nyhule na migodi jilingulela mafuza gawele na nyhule, nyhule zilingulela mizuchila ja nhanzi yiyo.” Iwa hihyo. <verse eid="GEN 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 1:12"/>Lelo isi yota mizuchila jilingulela nyhule za chila nhanzi na migodi jilingulela mafuza gawele na nyhule za chila nhanzi, Nguluwi nakona kota inoga. <verse eid="GEN 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 1:13"/>Iwa matinazo, iwa mitondo, zuwa lya kadatu.<verse eid="GEN 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 1:14"/>Nguluwi nakalonga, “Mimwemwesa jiwe kilanga, jilekanize nemisi na nechilo, jilajile mihela ja mnvina na zuwa na miyaka, <verse eid="GEN 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 1:15"/>na lumwemwese kilanga na kuimwemwesela isi.” Iwa hihyo. <verse eid="GEN 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 1:16"/>Lelo Nguluwi nakadita mimwemwesa mili mikulu, ula ukulu ulangaze nemisi, na ula udodo ulangaze nechilo, nakadita na nhondwe kahi. <verse eid="GEN 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 1:17"/>Nguluwi nakawika mimwemwesa jiwele kilanga jimwemwesele isi, <verse eid="GEN 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 1:18"/>iwe ilangaza nemisi na nechilo, na kulekaniza lumuli na jiza. Nguluwi nakona kota inoga. <verse eid="GEN 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 1:19"/>Iwa matinazo, iwa mitondo, zuwa lya kane.<verse eid="GEN 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 1:20"/>Nguluwi nakalonga, “Mazi nagalavye vilundo vya vilumbigwe viwele na ukomu, na kilanga kumemezwe videje vilinguguluka kuulanga.” <verse eid="GEN 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 1:21"/>Lelo Nguluwi nakalumba migongolo ming'hangala ja bahali, chila chilumbigwe cha mli bahali na nhanzi zawo. Nakalumba chila videje na nhanzi zawo. Nguluwi nakona kota inoga. <verse eid="GEN 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 1:22"/>Nguluwi nakavitambichiza, nakalonga, “Mlele miyonjeze, mmemeze mazi ga bahali, navyo videje vyonjezeche kuli isi.” <verse eid="GEN 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 1:23"/>Iwa matinazo, iwa mitondo, zuwa lya kahano.<verse eid="GEN 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 1:24"/>Kahi Nguluwi nakalonga, “Isi nailavye vilumbigwe vyeng'ha viwele vikomu, vyakudimigwa hakaye, vilingutambala, na vilingikala kisolo chila chilumbigwe kwa nhanzi zawo.” Iwa hihyo. <verse eid="GEN 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 1:25"/>Lelo Nguluwi nakalumba nhanzi zeng'ha za migongolo ja kisolo na ja kufujigwa na vilingutambala. Nguluwi nakona kota inoga.<verse eid="GEN 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 1:26"/>Hamba Nguluwi nakalonga, “Tumdite munhu kwa kiwhana na hetwe, yalongoze somba mli bahali na videje vya kilanga na migongolo ja kufujigwa hakaye hali isi yeng'ha na vilumbigwe vyeng'ha vilingutambala.” <verse eid="GEN 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 1:27"/>Lelo Nguluwi nakalumba munhu kwa kiwhana na heye, ena, kwa kiwhana na heye Nguluwi nakamlumba. Nakawalumba mlume na mdala. <verse eid="GEN 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 1:28"/>Nguluwi nakawatambichiza na kuwalonjela, “Muwe na wana mwonjezeche na mkaimemeze isi yeng'ha na kuilongoza, mlongoze somba ziwele mbahali na videje kuli ulanga na chila chilumbigwe chikomu chilingujenda muisi.”<verse eid="GEN 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 1:29"/>Hamba Nguluwi nakalonga, “Mlole ndanguwapa chila izuchila muisi lilingulela nyhule, na chila igodi lilingulela mafuza gawele na nyhule, mafuza gake na nyhule zake zowa chilyo cha hemwe. <verse eid="GEN 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 1:30"/>Na ajo migongolo jeng'ha na videje vyeng'ha viwele kuli ulanga na vilumbigwe vilingutambala, ena chila chilumbigwe chiwele na ukomu, chilyo chawo chowa mahamba geng'ha ga mizuchila.” Iwa hihyo. <verse eid="GEN 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 1:31"/>Nguluwi nakona chila chinhu choyaditile kota ndo chinoga ng'hatu. Iwa matinazo, iwa mitondo, zuwa lya sita.<verse eid="GEN 1:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GEN 2"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 2:1"/>Ahyo ndo kilanga kweng'ha na isi lovigongomanyigwe hamwe na vinhu vyeng'ha viwele mgati. <verse eid="GEN 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 2:2"/>Zuwa lya saba Nguluwi nakasinda mijito ja heye joyaditile, zuwa alyo lya saba Nguluwi nakesela kwa jila mijito jeng'ha joyakolile. <verse eid="GEN 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 2:3"/>Nguluwi nakalitambichiza zuwa lya saba na kulidita liwe lyelile, kwa vila zuwa alyo Nguluwi nakesela kwa jila mijito ja heye jeng'ha ja kulumba. <verse eid="GEN 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 2:4"/>Ahyo ndo vyoiwele kilanga na isi yeng'ha lovilumbigwe.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="GEN 2:4">Kamgunda ka Edeni</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 2:4">Mhela wula Mkulu Nguluwi loyazilumbile isi na kilanga, <verse eid="GEN 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 2:5"/>kwali kuduhu mizuchila kuli isi ne migodi hajizuchile kwa vila Mkulu Nguluwi nahaitowele nhonya isi, na hakuwele munhu wa kulima. <verse eid="GEN 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 2:6"/>Na baho mazi nagalawa hasi gainweza isi yeng'ha. <verse eid="GEN 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 2:7"/>Lelo Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlumba mlume kwa misanga, kamputila kumenyhelo lweselo lwa ukomu, na ayo mlume nakawa chilumbigwe chiwele na ukomu.<verse eid="GEN 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 2:8"/>Hamba Mkulu Nguluwi nakalumba kamgunda ako Edeni, nzingo ya kolilawilaga isanya na mumo nakumuwika mlume yamlumbile. <verse eid="GEN 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 2:9"/>Mkulu Nguluwi kazoteza kuli misanga chila nhanzi ya migodi jinojile jilingulela mafuza ganojile kwa chilyo. Hagati ha kamgunda nakanyala mgodi wa ukomu na mgodi wa uwanzi wa ganojile na gehile.<verse eid="GEN 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 2:10"/>Kwali na lwanda ako Edeni luwele lubohoka mazi na kukanweza ako kamgunda, kulawila ako lwanda alo nalugawanuka kuwa nzanda zine. <verse eid="GEN 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 2:11"/>Itagwa lya lwanda lwa mwaluko lyali Pishoni, alo lwanguzunguluta honhu heng'ha ha Havila kuwele na zahabu. <verse eid="GEN 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 2:12"/>Zahabu ya honhu aho inoga ng'hatu. Ako kahi hana unhunyhililo ulinguchemigwa bedola na maganga ga sendi nyinji galingupulika galinguchemigwa shohamu. <verse eid="GEN 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 2:13"/>Itagwa lya lwanda lwa keli ndo Gihoni, alo lwanguzunguluta honhu heng'ha ha Kushi. <verse eid="GEN 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 2:14"/>Itagwa lya lwanda lwa kadatu ndo Tigili, nalo lwangubohochela nzingo ya kolilawilaga isanya honhu heng'ha ha Ashulu, na itagwa lya lwanda lwa kane ndo Eyufulate.<verse eid="GEN 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 2:15"/>Lelo Mkulu Nguluwi nakamhola ayo mlume, kamuwika kuli kala kamgunda ka Edeni, yalime na kulolela. <verse eid="GEN 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 2:16"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlajiza ayo mlume, “Hegwe koweza kulya mafuza goneche kuli kamgunda, <verse eid="GEN 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 2:17"/>ila mafuza ga mgodi wa uwanzi wa ganojile na gehile, uleche kulya. Mina loulya mafuza ga mgodi awo, ndangukomya, zuwa alyo hegwe kobagama.”<verse eid="GEN 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 2:18"/>Hamba Mkulu Nguluwi nakalonga, “Hainojile ayu mlume yapone yaliyeka. Ndomditila mtanzi yatanganiche.” <verse eid="GEN 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 2:19"/>Lelo kulawila kuli misanga, Mkulu Nguluwi nakalumba chila igongolo na videje vya kilanga, hamba kamigalila ayo mlume yalole kowachemela matagwa gachi na matagwa yawapele ndo gawa matagwa gawo. <verse eid="GEN 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 2:20"/>Lelo ayo mlume nakajipa matagwa migongolo jeng'ha jila ja kufujigwa na ja kisolo na videje vya kilanga. Ila hakuwele na mtanzi yatanganiche kwa Adamu.<verse eid="GEN 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 2:21"/>Lelo Mkulu Nguluwi nakamdita ayo mlume yebatigwe na usinjizi lukami. Loyawele muusinjizi nakahola lubavu lwake lumwe na kuhagubika honhu hala kwa iwunde. <verse eid="GEN 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 2:22"/>Na alo lubavu Mkulu Nguluwi yaluholile kulawa kwa yula mlume, kaudita kuwa mdala, kamigala kwa ayo mlume. <verse eid="GEN 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 2:23"/>Ndo hala yula mlume yalonjile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 2:23">“Ena! Ayu ndo izeje kulawa mizeje jangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 2:23">Na iwunde kulawila miwunde ja heni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 2:23">Ayu kochemigwa, ‘Mdala,’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 2:23">kwa vila kalavigwa kuli mlume.”<verse eid="GEN 2:23"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 2:24"/>Ndo mina mlume kangumlekaga mhaza na mayake, na kilumba hamwe na mdala wa heye, na hewo weli wowa lukuli lumwe.<verse eid="GEN 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 2:25"/>Ayo mlume na mdala wa heye weng'ha wali mwazi, ila nahawawene soni.<verse eid="GEN 2:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GEN 3"/>
  <para style="s">Kuhinduka kwa Adamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 3:1"/>Izoka lyali isugu kusinda migongolo jeng'ha ja kisolo jilumbigwe na Mkulu Nguluwi. Lelo izoka nalimlonjela ayo mdala, “Hambi Nguluwi nakalonga yokomya, mleche kulya mafuza ga mgodi woneche kuli kamgunda?” <verse eid="GEN 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 3:2"/>Mdala nakalidichila alyo izoka, “Toweza kulya mafuza ga mgodi woneche kuli kamgunda, <verse eid="GEN 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 3:3"/>ila Nguluwi nakalonga, ‘Mleche kulya mafuza ga mgodi uwele hagati ha kamgunda, kahi mleche kuudoliza, leka mleche kubagama.’ ” <verse eid="GEN 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 3:4"/>Izoka nalimlonjela mdala, “Ndangukomya hambagama hebu. <verse eid="GEN 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 3:5"/>Nguluwi nakalonga ahyo kwa vila nakavizela kota wone mulye mafuza ga mgodi awo mogubulilwa meho, na hemwe mowa kota Nguluwi, movizela ganojile na gehile.”<verse eid="GEN 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 3:6"/>Lelo mdala loyawene kota mgodi awo unoga kwa chilyo, wangunojeza hameho, na kota unoga kwa kuwa na luhala, kabawa ifuza lya igodi, nakalya. Nakamha mlume wa heye na heye, kahi kalya. <verse eid="GEN 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 3:7"/>Baho du meho gawo nagagubuligwa, wavizela kota wamwazi, ahyo nawehonela mahamba ga igodi lya ikuyu, weditila salule ya kuvala mchuno.<verse eid="GEN 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 3:8"/>Matinazo, mhela wa kwesela mlubehelo, ayo mlume na mdala wa heye wahulika Mkulu Nguluwi yojenda mli kamgunda, na hewo wevisa hagati ha migodi jiwele mumo, leka Mkulu Nguluwi yaleche kuwona. <verse eid="GEN 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 3:9"/>Ila Mkulu Nguluwi nakamchema ayo mlume, “Kwa kohi?” <verse eid="GEN 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 3:10"/>Na heye nakamwidichila, “Nyhulika kujendajenda kwa hegwe kuli kamgunda, nandumba na kivisa kwa vila nandali mwazi.” <verse eid="GEN 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 3:11"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nakamuuza, “Yali kohi yakulonjele kota kwa mwazi? Ndaze, kulya ifuza lya mgodi wondikulonjele uleche kulya?” <verse eid="GEN 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 3:12"/>Ayo mlume nakamwidichila, “Mdala youmhele yekale hamwe na heni ndo yamhele ifuza lya mgodi awo, na heni ndiya.”<verse eid="GEN 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 3:13"/>Aho Mkulu Nguluwi nakamuuza ayo mdala, “Kudita choni hegwe?” Mdala nakamwidichila, “Izoka nalimbada, na heni ndiya.”<verse eid="GEN 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kugaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 3:14"/>Hamba Mkulu Nguluwi nakalilonjela izoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:14">“Kwa vila nakudita ahyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:14">nakupanjilwa kusinda migongolo jeng'ha ja kufujigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:14">na migongolo jeng'ha ja kisolo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:14">Kwa lida kotambala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:14">na kulya nhimbwisi mazuwa gose ga ukomu wa hegwe.<verse eid="GEN 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 3:15"/>Ndowika ung'honyo hagati ha hegwe na ayo mdala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:15">hagati ha lulelo lwako na lulelo lwake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:15">heye kochitowa chitwi cha hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:15">na hegwe kochitowa chisigino cha heye.”<verse eid="GEN 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 3:16"/>Hamba nakamlonjela mdala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:16">“Ndokonjezela usungu wa kuponda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:16">kwa usungu koponda wana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:16">kowa na maya na mlume wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:16">ila heye kowa na ludali lwa kukulongoza.”<verse eid="GEN 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 3:17"/>Hamba nakamlonjela Adamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:17">“Kwa vila hegwe nakumhulichiza mdala wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:17">nakulya mafuza ga mgodi wondiwalajize mleche kulya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:17">ahyo, kwa wihe wa hegwe isi ipanjilwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:17">Kwa kitunya kochipalila chilyo cha hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:17">mazuwa gose ga ukomu wa hegwe.<verse eid="GEN 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 3:18"/>Isi yokulelela miwa na migugu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:18">na hegwe yokugana kulya mizuchila.<verse eid="GEN 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 3:19"/>Kwa chituguti kopala chilyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:19">mbaka louhiluka kuli misanga koulawile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:19">mina hegwe kwa misanga, na kuli misanga kohiluka.”<verse eid="GEN 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 3:20"/>Adamu nakamchemela mdala wa heye itagwa, “Hawa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:20 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Hawa </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kwa Chiebulaniya ndo ukomu wa wanhu.</char></note>,” kwa vila nayali mamo wa wanhu weng'ha. <verse eid="GEN 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 3:21"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nakawagongomanyila Adamu na mdala wa heye ivalo lya igozi, kawavaliza.<verse eid="GEN 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Adamu na Hawa wanguwinjigwa kuli kamgunda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 3:22"/>Hamba Mkulu Nguluwi nakalonga, “Sambi munhu kawa kota yumwe wa hetwe, kavizela ganojile na gehile. Igana kumlemeza kulya alila ifuza lya mgodi wa ukomu, kwa vila wone yalye, kochikala mazuwa gose.” <verse eid="GEN 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 3:23"/>Lelo Mkulu Nguluwi nakamuwinga Adamu kunze mwa kamgunda ka Edeni, leka yakalime mmisanga moyalawile. <verse eid="GEN 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 3:24"/>Nakamuwinga kunze, na kuwawika wamizi wahilisi nzingo kolilawilaga isanya kuli kamgunda ka Edeni na sengo ya chiluli ilinguhinduka ako na ako, nakwamila nzila ilingulutila kuli mgodi wa ukomu.<verse eid="GEN 3:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GEN 4"/>
  <para style="s">Kaini na Abeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 4:1"/>Adamu nakawasa na mdala wa heye, na heye nakawa na himila, nakamponda Kaini. Hawa nakalonga, “Ndimponda mwana msongolo kwa utanzi wa Mkulu Nguluwi.” <verse eid="GEN 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 4:2"/>Hamba nakamponda mkulugwe Abeli nayawele mdima ming'holo na Kaini nayali mlimi. <verse eid="GEN 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 4:3"/>Mhela udo hela, Kaini nakamlavila Mkulu Nguluwi nhambiko ya mbena ya kumgunda, <verse eid="GEN 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 4:4"/>na heye Abeli nakamlavila Mkulu Nguluwi nhambiko ya lulelo lwa mwaluko lwa ming'holo na vihande vya mafuta. Mkulu Nguluwi nakanojezwa na Abeli na nhambiko ya heye, <verse eid="GEN 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 4:5"/>ila nahanojezwe na Kaini na nhambiko ya heye. Lelo Kaini nakazudila ng'hatu na kumeho kwa heye nakwali kukwisimbale. <verse eid="GEN 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 4:6"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlonjela Kaini, “Lekachoni kwanguzudila, na lekachoni kumeho kwa hegwe kukwisimbala? <verse eid="GEN 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 4:7"/>Ndaze, wone udite ganojile hukundigwa hebu? Na wone huditile ganojile, lelo gehile gangusunjilila hali lwizi, wangukugana kukulongoza, ila kwanguganigwa kuusumya.”<verse eid="GEN 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 4:8"/>Hamba Kaini nakamlonjela Abeli mng'holoze, “Tuche honhu kutali na mgunda.” Lelo lowali kumgunda Kaini nakamvada Abeli mng'holoze na kumkopola. <verse eid="GEN 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 4:9"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nakamuuza Kaini, “Mng'holozo Abeli kakohi?” Kaini nakamwidichila, “Heni sivizelele. Ndaze, heni nda mwamizi wa mng'holozangu?” <verse eid="GEN 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 4:10"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nakalonga, “Nakudita choni? Danda ya mng'holozo ya kota luzi lulingundilila kulawa kuli misanga. <verse eid="GEN 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 4:11"/>Lelo hegwe nakupanjilwa na kuwinjigwa mchanya mwa misanga jiwele ngubochela danda ya mng'holozo youmkopole. <verse eid="GEN 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 4:12"/>Wone ulime misanga hajikugalila kahi mbena ng'oo. Kowa munhu wa kulubaluba, yalihela honhu hatanganiche ha kikala.”<verse eid="GEN 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 4:13"/>Kaini nakamlonjela Mkulu Nguluwi, “Utaguso wa heni wowa ukulu ng'hatu, siweza kwimilila hebu. <verse eid="GEN 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 4:14"/>Ulole, lehano kumbinga kuli misanga jiwele na mboto na kutali na meho ga hegwe. Lelo ndowa munhu wa kulubaluba, yalihela honhu hatanganiche ha kikala muisi, na yoneche yombona kong'hopola.” <verse eid="GEN 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 4:15"/>Ila Mkulu Nguluwi nakamwidichila, “Hebu! Yokukopola hegwe Kaini, kohilulilwa mala saba.” Lelo Mkulu Nguluwi nakamuwika Kaini ulajilo wa kumdita munhu yoneche yomona yaleche kumkopola. <verse eid="GEN 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 4:16"/>Hamba Kaini nakoka kumwando kwa Mkulu Nguluwi, kawa yochikala kuli isi ya Nodi nzingo ya kolilawilaga isanya mwa kamgunda ka Edeni.<verse eid="GEN 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lulelo lwa Kaini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 4:17"/>Kaini nakawasa na mdala wa heye, na heye kawa na himila, nakamponda Enoki. Kaini nakazenga muji nakauchema Enoki itagwa lya mwana wa heye. <verse eid="GEN 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 4:18"/>Enoki nakawa mhaza wa Iladi, na heye Iladi nakawa mhaza wa Mehuyaeli, na Mehuyaeli nakawa mhaza wa Mesushaeli, na heye Mesushaeli nakawa mhaza wa Lameki. <verse eid="GEN 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 4:19"/>Lameki nakahola wadala weli, yumwenga nakachemigwa Ada, na yunji Sila. <verse eid="GEN 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 4:20"/>Ada nakamponda Yabali yawele mhaza wa wadimi walingikala mli mihema. <verse eid="GEN 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 4:21"/>Mng'holoze nayali Yubali, ayo nayali mhaza wa hewo wawele towa ching'weleng'wele na mluli. <verse eid="GEN 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 4:22"/>Sila na heye nakamponda Tubali-kaini, yawele mponzi wa vinhu vyeng'ha vya shaba na chuma. Lumbulye Tubali-kaini nakachemigwa Naama.<verse eid="GEN 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 4:23"/>Lameki nakawalonjela wadala wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 4:23">“Ada na Sila mhulichize lizi lya heni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 4:23">Mhulichize gondilonga hemwe wadala wa Lameki.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 4:23">Heni nandimkopola munhu kwa chiwalo cha kung'wanyula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 4:23">ena, nandimkopola msongolo kwa kundumiza.<verse eid="GEN 4:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 4:24"/>Wone Kaini kohilusilwa mala saba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 4:24">ndangukomya Lameki kohilusilwa mala makumi saba na saba.”<verse eid="GEN 4:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Seti na Enoshi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 4:25"/>Adamu nakawasa kahi na Hawa mdala wa heye, na heye nakaponda mwana mlume, kamchema Seti. Yolonga, “Nguluwi kengalila mwana honhu ha Abeli yakopoligwe na Kaini.” <verse eid="GEN 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 4:26"/>Seti na heye nakamponda mwana mlume, nakamchema Enoshi. Aho ndo wanhu waluche kumlanda Mkulu kwa itagwa lya Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="GEN 4:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GEN 5"/>
  <para style="s">Lulelo lwa Adamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 5:1"/>Ayi ndo mbuli ya lulelo lwa Adamu. Mhela Nguluwi loyamlumbile munhu, nakamlumba kwa kiwhana na heye. <verse eid="GEN 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 5:2"/>Nakawalumba mlume na mdala, hamba nakawatambichiza na kuwapa itagwa “Munhu.”<verse eid="GEN 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 5:3"/>Adamu loyali na miyaka miya imwe na makumi gadatu, nakawa na mwana msongolo yewhanile na heye, nakamchema Seti. <verse eid="GEN 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 5:4"/>Kulawila aho, Adamu nakekala miyaka miya nane, na kuwa na wana wanji walume na wadala. <verse eid="GEN 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 5:5"/>Adamu nakabagama loyawele na miyaka miya tisa na makumi gadatu.<verse eid="GEN 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 5:6"/>Mhela Seti loyawele na miyaka miya imwe na jihano, nakawa mhaza wa Enoshi. <verse eid="GEN 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 5:7"/>Loyampatile Enoshi, Seti nakekala miyaka miya nane na saba, na kuponda wana wanji walume na wadala. <verse eid="GEN 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 5:8"/>Seti nakabagama loyawele na miyaka miya tisa na kumi na mili.<verse eid="GEN 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 5:9"/>Mhela Enoshi loyali na miyaka makumi tisa, nakawa mhaza wa Kenani. <verse eid="GEN 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 5:10"/>Loyampondile Kenani, Enoshi nakekala miyaka miya nane na kumi na jihano, na kuwa wana wanji walume na wadala. <verse eid="GEN 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 5:11"/>Enoshi nakabagama loyali na miyaka miya tisa na jihano.<verse eid="GEN 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 5:12"/>Mhela Kenani loyali na miyaka makumi saba, nakampata Mahalaleli. <verse eid="GEN 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 5:13"/>Loyampondile Mahalaleli, Kenani nakekala miyaka miya nane na makumi gane, nakawa wana wanji walume na wadala. <verse eid="GEN 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 5:14"/>Kenani nakabagama loyali na miyaka miya tisa na kumi.<verse eid="GEN 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 5:15"/>Mhela Mahalaleli loyawele na miyaka makumi sita na jihano, nakawa mhaza wa Yaledi. <verse eid="GEN 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 5:16"/>Loyampondile Yaledi, Mahalaleli nakekala miyaka miya nane na makumi gadatu, nakawa wana wanji walume na wadala. <verse eid="GEN 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 5:17"/>Mahalaleli nakabagama loyawele na miyaka miya nane makumi tisa na jihano.<verse eid="GEN 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 5:18"/>Mhela Yaledi loyawele na miyaka miya imwe na makumi sita na mili, nakawa mhaza wa Enoki. <verse eid="GEN 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 5:19"/>Loyampondile Enoki, Yaledi nakekala miyaka miya nane, nakawa wana wanji walume na wadala. <verse eid="GEN 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 5:20"/>Yaledi nakabagama loyawele na miyaka miya tisa na makumi sita na mili.<verse eid="GEN 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 5:21"/>Mhela Enoki loyali na miyaka makumi sita na jihano, nakawa mhaza wa Metusela. <verse eid="GEN 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 5:22"/>Enoki na Nguluwi wali weganile. Loyampondile Metusela, Enoki nakekala miyaka miya jidatu nakawa na wana walume na wadala. <verse eid="GEN 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 5:23"/>Enoki nakekala miyaka jidatu na makumi sita na jihano. <verse eid="GEN 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 5:24"/>Enoki nayali weganile na Nguluwi, nakaheluka hela, ndo mina Nguluwi nakamhola.<verse eid="GEN 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 5:25"/>Mhela Metusela loyawele na miyaka miya imwe na makumi nane na saba, nakawa mhaza wa Lameki. <verse eid="GEN 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 5:26"/>Loyampondile Lameki, Metusela nakekala miyaka miya saba na makumi nane na mili, nakawa na wana wanji walume na wadala. <verse eid="GEN 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 5:27"/>Metusela nakabagama loyawele na miyaka miya tisa na makumi sita na tisa.<verse eid="GEN 5:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 5:28"/>Mhela Lameki loyawele na miyaka miya imwe na makumi nane na mili, nakampata mwana msongolo. <verse eid="GEN 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 5:29"/>Nakamchema mwana ayo Nuhu, yolonga, “Mwana ayu ndo yotuhembuliza kwa mijito jing'hang'hale yotulingukola kwa moko ga hetwe kuli isi yaipanjile Mkulu Nguluwi.” <verse eid="GEN 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 5:30"/>Loyampatile Nuhu, Lameki nakekala miyaka miya jihano na makumi tisa na jihano, nakawa na wana wanji walume na wadala. <verse eid="GEN 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 5:31"/>Lameki nakabagama loyawele na miyaka miya saba na makumi saba na saba.<verse eid="GEN 5:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 5:32"/>Nuhu loyafichile miyaka miya jihano, nakawa mhaza wa Shemu na Hamu na Yafeti.<verse eid="GEN 5:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GEN 6"/>
  <para style="s">Wihe wa Munhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 6:1"/>Wanhu lowaluche konjezeka muisi na kuponda wahinza, <verse eid="GEN 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 6:2"/>wahilisi wa Nguluwi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Wahilisi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kwa Chiebulaniya chilonga kota nawali wana wasongolo wa Nguluwi.</char></note> nawawona awo wahinza wa wanhu ndo wenolije ng'hatu, wawahola wala wawaganile na kuwa wadala wawo. <verse eid="GEN 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 6:3"/>Aho Mkulu Nguluwi nakalonga, “Muhe wa heni hauchikala mgati mwa munhu mazuwa gose, mina heye ndo wa kubagama hela. Lelo hochikala lukami miyaka miya imwe na makumi meli.” <verse eid="GEN 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 6:4"/>Mhela awo na kuli mazuwa ago nakwali na minhu muisi jiwele ndo lulelo lwa wahilisi wa Nguluwi na wahinza wa wanhu. Awo ndo wanhu wawele na mong'ho na lutogo aho katali, nawachemigwa Wanefili.<verse eid="GEN 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 6:5"/>Mkulu Nguluwi loyawene winji wa wihe wa wanhu muisi, na kota chila choyochijesa mnhumbula mwa heye mhela weng'ha ndo wihe yeka mhela weng'ha, <verse eid="GEN 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 6:6"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nakawa na masinzo ng'hatu kwa kumlumba munhu muisi. Mkulu Nguluwi nakejesa ng'hatu mnhumbula ya heye, <verse eid="GEN 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 6:7"/>ahyo Mkulu Nguluwi nakalonga, “Ndomwajiliza munhu yondimlumbile muisi, ndokwajiliza migongolo na vilumbigwe vilingutambala na videje vya kilanga. Ndina masinzo ng'hatu kwa vila nandiwalumba muisi.” <verse eid="GEN 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 6:8"/>Ila Nuhu nakaganigwa na Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="GEN 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nuhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 6:9"/>Ayi ndo mbuli ya Nuhu yawele yanojile yaliyeka na ndo yawele hela nongwa mhela wa heye. Nayali weganile na Nguluwi. <verse eid="GEN 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 6:10"/>Nuhu nayali na wana wadatu wasongolo, Shemu na Hamu na Yafeti. <verse eid="GEN 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 6:11"/>Nguluwi nakayona isi kota yiha ng'hatu na kumema wihe na kitowa. <verse eid="GEN 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 6:12"/>Ena, Nguluwi nakayona isi yiha ng'hatu, kwa vila chila munhu nakawinza nzila ya heye yihile.<verse eid="GEN 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 6:13"/>Nguluwi nakamlonjela Nuhu, “Nyamula kuwabagamiza wanhu weng'ha kwa vila waimemeza isi kitowa. Ena, ndowabagamiza ng'hatu hamwe na isi. <verse eid="GEN 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 6:14"/>Lelo widitile safina kwa mbao zinojile za mgofu. Ugawanule vihengo mgati na ubakalize lusila kwa mgati na kunze. <verse eid="GEN 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 6:15"/>Koidita iwe kota hino, utali wa mita miya imwe na makumi gadatu na zidatu na ugazi wa mita makumi meli na mbili na mita kumi na zidatu kuluta kuchanya. <verse eid="GEN 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 6:16"/>Safina ayo iwe na vinduwiko vidatu. Hagati mwa safina ayo kuwe na chiswiswili cha fudi sentimita makumi gane na zine kwa nzingo za hafungo mwa chinduwiko acho na lwizi hafungo. <verse eid="GEN 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 6:17"/>Ndochigala nhonya yobohoka na kubagamiza vinhu vyeng'ha viwele vikomu muisi. Chila chilumbigwe chiwele na muhe muisi chobagama. <verse eid="GEN 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 6:18"/>Ila ndowika ilagano na hegwe. Kokwinjila mli safina, hegwe hamwe na mdala wa hegwe na wanago na wadala wawo. <verse eid="GEN 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 6:19"/>Nagwe kokwinjiza mli safina chila chilumbigwe vili chilume na chidala, leka viwe vikomu hamwe na hegwe.<verse eid="GEN 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 6:20"/>“Wokuya kwa hegwe chila nhanzi ya videje vya kilanga, chila igongolo na chila nhanzi ya chilumbigwe chilingutambala, vili vili, leka kuviwika viwe vikomu. <verse eid="GEN 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 6:21"/>Kahi uhole vilyo vyeng'ha vilinguligwa, uwiche kwa mbuli ya chilyo cha hemwe na vilumbigwe avyo.” <verse eid="GEN 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 6:22"/>Nuhu nakadita geng'ha kota Nguluwi vyoyalajize.<verse eid="GEN 6:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="GEN 7"/>
  <para style="s">Mazi behewa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 7:1"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlonjela Nuhu, “Winjile mgati mwa safina hegwe hamwe na ivyazi lyako lyeng'ha, mina kwa wanhu weng'ha walingikala mhela awu wa hegwe, ndikona hegwe uliyeka utanganiche heni. <verse eid="GEN 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 7:2"/>Uhole hamwe na hegwe migongolo jeng'ha johajikokomoche na jikokomoche, ilume na idala, saba saba, ila migongolo johambe jiliche, uhole mili ilume na idala. <verse eid="GEN 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 7:3"/>Vivila uhole videje vya kilanga chilume na chidala, saba saba, leka kuzileka nhanzi zawo ziwe na ukomu muisi. <verse eid="GEN 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 7:4"/>Logopuluta mazuwa saba, ndowatowela nhonya mazuwa makumi gane nemisi na nechilo, na chila chilumbigwe ndichilumbile muisi chobagama.” <verse eid="GEN 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 7:5"/>Nuhu nakadita geng'ha kota Mkulu Nguluwi vyoyalajize.<verse eid="GEN 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 7:6"/>Nuhu nayali na miyaka miya sita mhela nhonya loitowile na mazi kumema muisi. <verse eid="GEN 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 7:7"/>Nuhu na mdala wa heye na wanage na wadala wawo nawenjila mgati mwa safina leka kuibilima nhonya imemeze mazi. <verse eid="GEN 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 7:8"/>Migongolo jilingulika na migongolo hajilingulika na videje na vilumbigwe vyeng'ha vilingutambala, <verse eid="GEN 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 7:9"/>vili vili, idala na ilume, navinjila mgati mwa safina hamwe na Nuhu kota Nguluwi vyoyalajize. <verse eid="GEN 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 7:10"/>Logapulute mazuwa saba, mazi ga nhonya nagaluka kuigubika isi.<verse eid="GEN 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 7:11"/>Nuhu loyawele na miyaka miya sita, logali mazuwa ga kumi na saba ga mwezi wa keli, zuwa alyo nzasa zeng'ha za mazi gawele nyang'ha za hasi nazilavya mazi, na mazi kulawa kilanga nagabohoka. <verse eid="GEN 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 7:12"/>Nhonya naitowa hasi mazuwa makumi gane nemisi na nechilo. <verse eid="GEN 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 7:13"/>Zuwa lilyo nhonya loyaluche kutowa, Nuhu na mdala wa heye na wanage, Shemu na Hamu na Yafeti, hamwe na wadala wawo, nawenjila mgati mwa safina. <verse eid="GEN 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 7:14"/>Nawenjila hewo weng'ha hamwe na migongolo ja kisolo nhanzi zeng'ha na nhanzi zeng'ha za migongolo ja haluga na nhanzi zeng'ha za migongolo jilingutambala na videje chila nhanzi na nhanzi zeng'ha za vilumbigwe viwele na mabawa. <verse eid="GEN 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 7:15"/>Vili vili vya chila nhanzi ya vilumbigwe vikomu navinjila mgati mwa safina hamwe na Nuhu. <verse eid="GEN 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 7:16"/>Chila nhanzi nawenjila ilume na idala kota Nguluwi vyoyamlajize Nuhu. Hamba Mkulu Nguluwi nakahinda lwizi lwa safina kumbele kwa Nuhu.<verse eid="GEN 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 7:17"/>Nhonya naitowa mazuwa makumi gane. Mazi nagonjezeka na kwinula safina, nayelela mchanya mwa isi. <verse eid="GEN 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 7:18"/>Mazi nagalutilila konjezeka muisi na safina nayelela mchanya mwake. <verse eid="GEN 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 7:19"/>Mazi ago gawa menji ng'hatu mchanya muisi, gavigubika vidunda vyeng'ha viling'wemang'wema muisi. <verse eid="GEN 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 7:20"/>Nagamema mbaka kuvigubika vidunda chasi cha fudi kumi na zihano. <verse eid="GEN 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 7:21"/>Vilumbigwe vyeng'ha navibagama, videje na migongolo ja kudimigwa na migongolo ja kisolo na vilumbigwe vyeng'ha muisi vilingujenda mchilundo na wanhu weng'ha, <verse eid="GEN 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 7:22"/>ena, chila chilumbigwe chiwele na muhe muisi nachibagama. <verse eid="GEN 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 7:23"/>Nguluwi nakachibagamiza chila chilumbigwe muisi, wanhu na migongolo na vilumbigwe vilingutambala na videje vya kilanga. Vyeng'ha navibagamizwa muisi. Nuhu yaliyeka ndo nayaponile hamwe na wala nawawele mgati mwa safina. <verse eid="GEN 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 7:24"/>Mazi ago nagekala muisi kwa mazuwa miya imwe na makumi gahano.<verse eid="GEN 7:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="GEN 8"/>
  <para style="s">Kuduma kwa nhonya ya mazi tendema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 8:1"/>Hamba Nguluwi nakamkumbuka Nuhu na migongolo jeng'ha ja kisolo na jifujigwe haluga jiwele hamwe na heye mgati mwa safina. Lelo Nguluwi nakegala mbeho mchanya mwa isi, mazi nagaluka kuswina. <verse eid="GEN 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 8:2"/>Nzasa za mazi gawele nyang'ha na mazi kulawa kilanga nagadinyigwa. Nhonya naidinyigwa, <verse eid="GEN 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 8:3"/>mazi nagalutilila kuswina mhole mhole muisi. Mazuwa miya na makumi gahano logakolile, mazi nagaswina lukami. <verse eid="GEN 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 8:4"/>Zuwa lya kumi na saba, mwezi wa saba, safina naima mchanya mwa vidunda vya Alalati. <verse eid="GEN 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 8:5"/>Mazi nagalutilila kuswina mhole mhole, na zuwa ya mwaluko ya mwezi wa kumi, vinhembenhembe vya vidunda navyaluka koneka.<verse eid="GEN 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 8:6"/>Mazuwa makumi gane logakwete, Nuhu nakachumula itubuli lyoyawichile kuli yila safina, <verse eid="GEN 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 8:7"/>nakalilavya ibondwa kunze, ila naliguluka aku na kula mbaka mazi logakalile muisi. <verse eid="GEN 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 8:8"/>Hamba Nuhu nakailavya ng'hunda leka ilole kota mazi gaswina mchanya mwa isi. <verse eid="GEN 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 8:9"/>Ila kwa vila mazi nagang'hali gagubiche isi yeng'ha, ayo ng'hunda haiwene honhu ha kudulika, naihiluka kwa Nuhu kuli safina. Nuhu nakagolola moko, kaibata na kuihilusa mgati mwa safina. <verse eid="GEN 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 8:10"/>Nuhu nakabeteza mazuwa ganji saba, hamba nakailavya kahi ayo ng'hunda kunze mwa safina. <verse eid="GEN 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 8:11"/>Ng'hunda ayo naimhiluchila Nuhu matinazo iwele na iputi lidodi lya mzeituni mumlomo mwake. Kwa chiwalo acho Nuhu nakavizela kota mazi gali gaswinile muisi. <verse eid="GEN 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 8:12"/>Hamba nakabeteza mazuwa ganji saba, nakailavya kahi ayila ng'hunda zuwa ali, ng'hunda nahaihiluche ng'oo.<verse eid="GEN 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 8:13"/>Nuhu loyawele na miyaka miya sita na umwe, zuwa lya mwaluko mwezi wa mwaluko, mazi nagakala muisi. Nuhu nakagubula chigubiko cha safina na loyalolile, nakona kota isi naikala. <verse eid="GEN 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 8:14"/>Zuwa lya makumi meli na saba ga mwezi wa keli, isi naikala ng'hatu.<verse eid="GEN 8:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 8:15"/>Aho Nguluwi nakamlonjela Nuhu, <verse eid="GEN 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 8:16"/>“Ulawe kuli safina, hegwe hamwe na mdala wa hegwe na wanago na wadala wawo. <verse eid="GEN 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 8:17"/>Ulavye kahi vilumbigwe vyeng'ha viwele na muhe vya chila nhanzi viwele hamwe na hegwe, videje na migongolo na chila chilumbigwe chilingutambala, vikalele kwa winji muisi, wonjezeche na kwenela honhu heng'ha muisi.” <verse eid="GEN 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 8:18"/>Lelo Nuhu nakalawa kuli safina hamwe na wanage na mdala wa heye hamwe na wadala wa wanage. <verse eid="GEN 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 8:19"/>Migongolo jeng'ha na vilumbigwe vyeng'ha vilingutambala na videje vyeng'ha, nawalawa kuli safina kwa nhanzi zawo.<verse eid="GEN 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nuhu kangumlavila nhambiko Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 8:20"/>Nuhu nakamzenjela Mkulu Nguluwi honhu ha kulavila nhambiko, nakahola yumwe kwa chila nhanzi ya migongolo johajikokomoche na chideje chohachikokomoche, nakumlavila Nguluwi nhambiko za kulakazwa hala. <verse eid="GEN 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 8:21"/>Kunhunyhilila goya kwa nhambiko ayo na kumnojeza Mkulu Nguluwi, na heye nakalonga mnhumbula mwake, “Siwila kahi kuipanjila isi kwa mbuli ya wanhu, ndivizela kota majesa ga heye ndo wihe kulawila udodo. Na sivibagamiza kahi vilumbigwe vyeng'ha kota vyonditile.<verse eid="GEN 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 8:22"/>“Kota vyoichikala isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 8:22">mihela ja kunyala na mbena,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 8:22">na ja mbeho na ivuche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 8:22">na luhela na chipalangule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 8:22">na nechilo na nemisi, hagomala.”<verse eid="GEN 8:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="GEN 9"/>
  <para style="s">Nguluwi kanguwika ilagano na Nuhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 9:1"/>Nguluwi nakamtambichiza Nuhu na wanage, yowalonjela, “Mkalele, mwonjezeche, mkaimemeze isi yeng'ha. <verse eid="GEN 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 9:2"/>Migongolo jeng'ha na videje vyeng'ha vya kilanga na vilumbigwe vyeng'ha vilingutambala muisi na somba zeng'ha za kuli bahali zowa na woga na zowadumba hemwe. Weng'ha wawichigwa hali ludali lwa hemwe. <verse eid="GEN 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 9:3"/>Migongolo jeng'ha jiwele na muhe jowa ndiya ya hemwe, ndanguwapani kota vila londiwapele mizuchila jititime ja nyhule za ndiya ya hemwe. <verse eid="GEN 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 9:4"/>Ila mleche kulya miwunde jiwele na danda, kwa vila ukomu wamumo mli danda. <verse eid="GEN 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 9:5"/>Danda ya ukomu wa hemwe ndoitagusa, kwa chila igongolo na wanhu. Yomkopola miyage, ndoutagusa ukomu wa heye.<verse eid="GEN 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 9:6"/>“Yalingubohola danda ya munhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:6">danda ya heye yoboholigwa na munhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:6">mina kwa kiwhana na Nguluwi, munhu nakalumbigwa.<verse eid="GEN 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 9:7"/>Namwe mponde na mkonjezeche, mponde kwa winji, mkonjezeche muisi.”<verse eid="GEN 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ipinde lya nhonya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 9:8"/>Hamba Nguluwi nakamlonjela Nuhu na mwanage, <verse eid="GEN 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 9:9"/>“Ndanguwika ilagano lyangu namwe na lulelo lwenu, <verse eid="GEN 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 9:10"/>na vilumbigwe vyeng'ha viwele vikomu na videje na migongolo ja kudima haluga na ja kisolo, weng'ha walawile mli safina hamwe na hemwe. <verse eid="GEN 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 9:11"/>Ndangwaluchiza ilagano lyangu na hemwe, kuta vilumbigwe vyeng'ha vikomu havibagamizwa ng'oo kwa nhonya, na hailawila kahi nhonya kota ila ya kuiwifya isi.” <verse eid="GEN 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 9:12"/>Kahi Nguluwi nakalonga, “Achi ndo chilajilo cha ilagano londidita kwa heni na hemwe na chila chilumbigwe chikomu chiwele hamwe na hemwe kwa lulelo lweng'ha lulinguya, <verse eid="GEN 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 9:13"/>ndanguwika upinde wa heni kuli ng'hungugu kilanga. Nawo wowa ulajilo wa ilagano lya heni na isi. <verse eid="GEN 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 9:14"/>Hala hondiigubika isi kwa ng'hungugu, na awo upinde wa nhonya howokoneka kuli ng'hungugu, <verse eid="GEN 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 9:15"/>ndokumbuchila ilagano lyangu na hemwe na vilumbigwe vyeng'ha viwele vikomu. Mazi hagomema ng'oo na kuvibagamiza vilumbigwe vyeng'ha viwele vikomu. <verse eid="GEN 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 9:16"/>Awo upinde houlawila kung'ungugu, ndowona na kukumbuchila ilagano alyo lya mazuwa gose kwa heni na vilumbigwe vyeng'ha viwele vikomu muisi.” <verse eid="GEN 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 9:17"/>Nguluwi nakamlonjela Nuhu, “Awu ulajilo wa ilagano lonyhaluchize na vilumbigwe vyeng'ha viwele vikomu muisi.”<verse eid="GEN 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nuhu na wanage</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 9:18"/>Wana wa Nuhu walawile mli safina nawali Shemu na Hamu na Yafeti. Hamu nayali mhaza wa Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 9:19"/>Awo ndo wana wadatu wa Nuhu, na kulawa kwa hewo wanhu nawenela isi yeng'ha.<verse eid="GEN 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 9:20"/>Nuhu yawele mlimi, nayali yaluche kuwa mlimi wa mgunda wa zabibu. <verse eid="GEN 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 9:21"/>Nakanwa divai kulawa kuli zabibu zoyalimile, nakagala, hamba nakawasa mwazi mli chibumuli cha heye. <verse eid="GEN 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 9:22"/>Hamu, mhaza wa Kanaani, nakawona umwazi wa mhaza wa heye, nakalawa kunze na kuwalonjela wang'holoze weli. <verse eid="GEN 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 9:23"/>Ila Shemu na Yafeti nawahola nguwo, watandazula mmayega mwawo, nawaluta chimbelembele na kuugubika umwazi wa mhaza wa hewo. Nawalola kufungo, nahawauwene umwazi wa mhaza wa hewo. <verse eid="GEN 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 9:24"/>Nuhu loyalilimche na kuvizela choyaditilwe na mwanage mdodo, <verse eid="GEN 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 9:25"/>nakalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:25">“Kanaani yapanjilwe!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:25">Kowa chitumagwa wa vitumagwa kwa wang'holoze.”<verse eid="GEN 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 9:26"/>Kahi nakalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:26">“Shemu nayatambichizwe na Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa Shemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:26">Kanaani nayawe chitumagwa wa heye.<verse eid="GEN 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 9:27"/>Nguluwi nayamtambichize Yafeti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:27">yekale kuli chibumuli cha Shemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:27">Kanaani nayawe mpogozi wa heye.”<verse eid="GEN 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 9:28"/>Loimalile nhonya ya mazi tendema, Nuhu nakekala miyaka miya zidatu na makumi gahano, <verse eid="GEN 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 9:29"/>hamba Nuhu nakabagama loyawele na miyaka miya tisa na makumi gahano.<verse eid="GEN 9:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="GEN 10"/>
  <para style="s">Lulelo lwa Nuhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 10:1"/>Ayi ndo mbuli ya lulelo lwa Nuhu, Shemu na Hamu na Yafeti. Awa wadatu nawali na wana loimalile nhonya ya mazi tendema.<verse eid="GEN 10:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 10:2"/>Wana walume wa Yafeti nawali Gomeli na Magogu na Madai na Yavani na Tubali na Mesheki na Tilasi. <verse eid="GEN 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 10:3"/>Wana wa Gomeli nawali Ashikenasi na Lifazi na Togoma. <verse eid="GEN 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 10:4"/>Wana wa Yavani nawali Elisha na Talishishi na Kitimu na Dodanimu. <verse eid="GEN 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 10:5"/>Awa ndo wanhu wa mwaluko ng'hatu wenele honhu ha mwhani, chila wanhu kwa isi za hewo na kwa ulonzi wawo na kwa lukolo lwawo na kwa nhanzi za hewo.<verse eid="GEN 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 10:6"/>Wana wa Hamu nawali Kushi na Misili na Puti na Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 10:7"/>Wana walume wa Kushi nawali Seba na Havila na Sabuta na Lahama na Sabuteka. Wana walume wa Lahama nawali Sheba na Dedani. <verse eid="GEN 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 10:8"/>Kushi nayali mhaza wa Nimulodi yawele na mong'ho wa mwaluko muisi yeng'ha. <verse eid="GEN 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 10:9"/>Nayali mpelembi yawele na mong'ho hamwando ha Mkulu Nguluwi, ndo mina kwali na ulonzi ulingulonga, “Nayakudite uwe kota Nimulodi mpelembi yawele na mong'ho hamwando ha Mkulu Nguluwi.” <verse eid="GEN 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 10:10"/>Miji ja mwaluko ja undewa wa heye, najali Babiloni na Eleki na Akadi na Kalinehi, kuli isi ya Shinali. <verse eid="GEN 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 10:11"/>Kulawila ako, Nimulodi nakaluta Ashulu, nakazenga miji ja Ninawi na Lehoboti-ili na Kala na <verse eid="GEN 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 10:12"/>Leseni uwele hagati ha Ninawi na muji ukulu wa Kala.<verse eid="GEN 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 10:13"/>Misili nayali sekulu wa Waludi na Waanamu na Walehabi na Wanafutuhi <verse eid="GEN 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 10:14"/>na Wapatilusi na Wakasiluhimu, wawele mwaluko wa Wafilisti na Wakafutoli.<verse eid="GEN 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 10:15"/>Kanaani nayali sekulu wa Sidoni, mlelwa wa heye wa mwaluko, na Heti <verse eid="GEN 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 10:16"/>na kahi sekulu wa hewo Wayebusi na Waamoli na Wagiligashi <verse eid="GEN 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 10:17"/>na Wahivi na Waaliki na Waasini <verse eid="GEN 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 10:18"/>na Waaluvadi na Wasemali na Wahamati. Hamba wanhu wa nhanzi zinjizinji za Kanaani nawasambaluka, <verse eid="GEN 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 10:19"/>ahyo na honhu ha isi ya hewo nayali kulawila Sidoni kulutila kusini mbaka Gelali mbaka Gasa, na kulutila kolilawilaga isanya mbaka Sodoma na Gomola na Adima na Seboimu mbaka Lasha. <verse eid="GEN 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 10:20"/>Awo ndo walelwa wa Hamu kota lukolo lwa hewo na ulonzi wa hewo na isi za hewo na wanhu wa isi za hewo.<verse eid="GEN 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 10:21"/>Shemu, mkulugwe Yafeti, nayali mwana wa Ebeli. <verse eid="GEN 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 10:22"/>Wana wa Shemu nawali Elamu na Ashulu na Alufakisadi na Ludi na Alamu. <verse eid="GEN 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 10:23"/>Wana walume wa Alamu nawali Usi na Huli na Gaseli na Mashi. <verse eid="GEN 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 10:24"/>Alufakisadi nakampata Shela, Shela nakampata Ebeli. <verse eid="GEN 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 10:25"/>Ebeli nayali na wana weli, wa mwaluko nakamchema Pelegi kwa vila mhela awo wanhu wa isi nawasambaluka, na wa keli nakamchema Yokitani. <verse eid="GEN 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 10:26"/>Yokitani nayali mhaza wa Alimodadi na Shelefu na Hasalimaweti na Yela <verse eid="GEN 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 10:27"/>na Hadolamu na Usali na Dikila <verse eid="GEN 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 10:28"/>na Obali na Abimaeli na Sheba <verse eid="GEN 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 10:29"/>na Ofili na Havila na Yobabu. Awo weng'ha nawali wana wa Yokitani. <verse eid="GEN 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 10:30"/>Isi nawekale nayenela kulawila Mesha kwa nzila ya Sefali kuli isi ya vidunda mwa kolilawilaga isanya. <verse eid="GEN 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 10:31"/>Awo ndo walelwa wa Shemu na wanhu wa isi za hewo na ulonzi wa hewo na kuli isi za hewo na undewa wa hewo.<verse eid="GEN 10:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 10:32"/>Ayi ndo mbuli ya lukolo lwa wana wa Nuhu, kwa ivyazi lya hewo na ulonzi wa hewo. Kulawa kwa wanhu awo nawenela kuli nhanzi zeng'ha loimalile nhonya ya mazi tendema.<verse eid="GEN 10:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="GEN 11"/>
  <para style="s">Ilingo lya Babeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 11:1"/>Mwaluko wanhu weng'ha muisi nawali na ulonzi umwe, nawali wolonga luzi lulula. <verse eid="GEN 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 11:2"/>Lelo naiwa wanhu lowenule majendo kulawila kolilawilaga isanya, nawafika kuli isi ya chiwala ako Shinali, nawekala. <verse eid="GEN 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 11:3"/>Hamba nawelonjelela, “Lelo, natudite matufali, tugasome goya na chiluli.” Nawali na matufali honhu ha maganga na lami honhu ha ilongo. <verse eid="GEN 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 11:4"/>Nawalonga, “Twizenjele muji na ilingo chinduwiko chake chofika mbaka kilanga leka tupegwe itagwa na kutogoligwa, tuleche kusambaluka isi yeng'ha.”<verse eid="GEN 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 11:5"/>Ndo baho Mkulu Nguluwi nakedulika hasi kulola honhu hao na ilingo lowazenjile wanhu wa isi. <verse eid="GEN 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 11:6"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nakalonga, “Mlole wanhu wano wa isi imwe na weng'ha wana ulonzi umwe, awu ndo mwaluko hela wa gala gowodita. Lyoneche lowogana kudita, woweza kudita. <verse eid="GEN 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 11:7"/>Lelo natwiduliche hasi na kuubananga ulonzi wa hewo, leka walemwele kuvizela chowolonga hewo kwa hewo.” <verse eid="GEN 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 11:8"/>Ahyo, Mkulu Nguluwi nakawasambalula honhu heng'ha muisi, na hewo nawaleka kuuzenga ula muji. <verse eid="GEN 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 11:9"/>Muji awo nauchemigwa Babeli, kwa vila ako ndo Mkulu Nguluwi koyatigule ulonzi wa hewo wa isi yeng'ha na kulawa ako nakawasambalula wanhu chila honhu muisi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Babeli </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ulonzi Babeli kwa Chiebulaniya ndo kutigulanga.</char></note><verse eid="GEN 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lulelo lwa Shemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 11:10"/>Ayi ndo mbuli ya lulelo lwa Shemu. Miyaka mili kulawa ila nhonya ya mazi tendema, Shemu naloyali na miyaka miya imwe, nakamponda Alufakisadi. <verse eid="GEN 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 11:11"/>Loyampondile Alufakisadi, Shemu nakekala miyaka miya jihano, na kuponda wana wanji walume na wadala.<verse eid="GEN 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 11:12"/>Alufakisadi naloyawele na miyaka makumi gadatu na jihano, nakamponda Shela. <verse eid="GEN 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 11:13"/>Loyampondile Shela, Alufakisadi nakekala miyaka miya zine na zidatu, na kuponda wana wanji walume na wadala.<verse eid="GEN 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 11:14"/>Shela naloyawele na miyaka makumi gadatu, nakamponda Ebeli. <verse eid="GEN 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 11:15"/>Loyampondile Ebeli, Shela nakekala miyaka miya zine na zidatu, na kuponda wana wanji walume na wadala.<verse eid="GEN 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 11:16"/>Ebeli naloyawele na miyaka makumi gadatu na gane, nakamponda Pelegi. <verse eid="GEN 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 11:17"/>Loyampondile Pelegi, Ebeli nakekala miyaka miya zine na makumi gadatu, na kuponda wana wanji walume na wadala.<verse eid="GEN 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 11:18"/>Pelegi naloyawele na miyaka makumi gadatu, nakamponda Leu. <verse eid="GEN 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 11:19"/>Naloyampondile Leu, Pelegi nakekala miyaka miya mbili na tisa, na kuponda wana wanji walume na wadala.<verse eid="GEN 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 11:20"/>Leu naloyawele na miyaka makumi gadatu na meli, nakamponda Selugi. <verse eid="GEN 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 11:21"/>Naloyampondile Selugi, Leu nakekala miyaka miya mbili na saba, na kuponda wana wanji walume na wadala.<verse eid="GEN 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 11:22"/>Selugi naloyawele na miyaka makumi gadatu, nakamponda Naholi. <verse eid="GEN 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 11:23"/>Naloyampondile Naholi, Selugi nakekala miyaka miya mbili na kuponda wana wanji walume na wadala.<verse eid="GEN 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 11:24"/>Naholi naloyawele na miyaka makumi meli na tisa, nakamponda Tela. <verse eid="GEN 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 11:25"/>Naloyampondile Tela, Naholi nakekala miyaka miya imwe na kumi na tisa, na kuponda wana wanji walume na wadala.<verse eid="GEN 11:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 11:26"/>Tela naloyawele na miyaka makumi saba, nakamponda Abulamu na Naholi na Halani.<verse eid="GEN 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lulelo lwa Tela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 11:27"/>Ayi ndo mbuli ya lulelo lwa Tela, mhaza wa hewo Abulamu, Naholi na Halani. Halani nayali mhaza wa Loti. <verse eid="GEN 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 11:28"/>Ayo Halani nakabagama hali mhaza wa heye Tela, loyali yochikala ako Chalideya nakoyapondigwe Uli. <verse eid="GEN 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 11:29"/>Abulamu na Naholi nawahesa. Mdala wa Abulamu nakachemigwa Salai. Mdala wa Naholi nakachemigwa Milika, mhinza wa Halani nayawele kahi mhaza wa Isika. <verse eid="GEN 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 11:30"/>Salai nahapondile mwana kwa vila nayali mhende.<verse eid="GEN 11:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 11:31"/>Tela nakamhola Abulamu mwanage na Loti mzukulu wa heye, nayawele mwana wa Halani, na Salai mchewake Abulamu, nawoka weng'ha hamwe kulawa Uli, muji wa Wakalidayo, kuluta kuli isi ya Kanaani. Ila lowafichile Halani, nawekala. <verse eid="GEN 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 11:32"/>Tela nakabagama ako Halani naloyawele na miyaka miya mbili na jihano.<verse eid="GEN 11:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="GEN 12"/>
  <para style="s">Nguluwi kangumchema Abulamu yaileche isi ya heye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 12:1"/>Lelo Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlonjela Abulamu, “Uche kuli isi ya hegwe, uwaleche wang'holozo na ng'handa ya mhaza wa hegwe, ulute kuli isi yondikulajila.<verse eid="GEN 12:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 12:2"/>“Ndokudita hegwe uwe nhanzi iwele na ukulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 12:2">ndokutambichiza na kulikwiniza itagwa lyako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 12:2">leka nagwe uwe utambichizo kwa wanji.<verse eid="GEN 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 12:3"/>Yokutambichiza, ndomtambichiza, yokupanjila, ndompanjila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 12:3">Kwa kukolela hegwe, ndozitambichiza nhanzi za isi zeng'ha.”<verse eid="GEN 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 12:4"/>Lelo Abulamu nakoka kota Mkulu Nguluwi vyonayamlajize, na Loti nakaluta hamwe na heye. Abulamu nayali na miyaka makumi saba na jihano loyalawile Halani. <verse eid="GEN 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 12:5"/>Abulamu nakamhola mdala wa heye Salai, na Loti mwana wa mng'holoze, hamwe na lufufu lwao lweng'ha na wanhu weng'ha nawawaholile ako Halani, nawoka kuluta isi ya Kanaani. Nalowenjile isi ya Kanaani, <verse eid="GEN 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 12:6"/>Abulamu nakakola hagati ha isi mbaka Shekemu, honhu Helile hawele na igodi likulu lya Mole. Mhela awo, Wakanaani nawali ndo wenyeng'haye wa isi ayo. <verse eid="GEN 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 12:7"/>Ndo Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlawila Abulamu, nakamlonjela, “Lulelo lwako ndowapa isi ayi.” Lelo Abulamu nakazenga honhu ha kulavila nhambiko kwa mbuli ya Mkulu Nguluwi yamlawile. <verse eid="GEN 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 12:8"/>Hamba Abulamu nakoka, nakalutila kuli isi ya vidunda kolilawilaga isanya mwa Beteli, nakazenga chibumuli hagati mwa muji wa Beteli nzingo ya kolizinjilaga isanya, na muji wa Ayi nzingo ya kolilawilaga isanya. Aho kahi nakamzenjela Mkulu Nguluwi honhu ha kulavila nhambiko na kumlanda kwa itagwa lyake. <verse eid="GEN 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 12:9"/>Hamba Abulamu nakalutilila na majendo ubanzi wa Negebu.<verse eid="GEN 12:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Abulamu kuli isi ya Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 12:10"/>Mhela awo, nzala nailawila muisi. Nayali nzala ya maduga, ahyo Abulamu naimgana kuluta Misili na kikala ako kwa mhela uchefu. <verse eid="GEN 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 12:11"/>Loyawele behi na Misili, Abulamu nakamlonjela Salai mchewake, “Ndivizela kota hegwe kwa mdala ulinguwakwega wanhu kwa vila kunoga lukami. <verse eid="GEN 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 12:12"/>Wamisili lowokona wolonga, ‘Ayu ndo mchewake,’ hamba wong'hopola ila hegwe wokuleka mkomu. <verse eid="GEN 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 12:13"/>Lelo walonjele kota hegwe kwa lumbu wa heni leka mbuli zindutile goya, wandeche ndiwe mkomu kwa mbuli ya hegwe.” <verse eid="GEN 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 12:14"/>Lelo Abulamu loyafichile muisi ya Misili, wenyeng'haye wa ako nawamona Salai kota ndo mdala yanojile lukami. <verse eid="GEN 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 12:15"/>Wakulu wa chitala wa Falao lowamuwene Salai, nawamtogola kwa Falao. Lelo Salai nakahilikwa haluga ha Falao. <verse eid="GEN 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 12:16"/>Lelo, kwa mbuli ya heye, Falao nakamuwika Abulamu, nakabochela ming'holo na misenga na idogowi ilume na vitumagwa walume na wadala na idogowi idala na ngamiya.<verse eid="GEN 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 12:17"/>Ila Mkulu Nguluwi nakamgaza Falao na wanhu weng'ha wawele mng'handa ya heye kwa kuwadita wawe na matamwa makulu kwa mbuli ya Salai, mchewake Abulamu. <verse eid="GEN 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 12:18"/>Falao nakamchema Abulamu, nakamuuza, “Ndo chinhu chachi achi chounditile? Lekachoni nahundonjele kota Salai ka mchewako? <verse eid="GEN 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 12:19"/>Lekachoni nakulonga ka lumbu wa hegwe mbaka nandimhola yawe mchewangu? Lelo mchewako ndo ayo, umhole ulute.” <verse eid="GEN 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 12:20"/>Hamba Falao nakawalajiza wanhu wa heye, na hewo wamleche Abulamu yalute mnzila yawele na mchewake na lufufu lwake lweng'ha.<verse eid="GEN 12:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="GEN 13"/>
  <para style="s">Abulamu na Loti wangibagula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 13:1"/>Abulamu nakahiluka kulawila Misili, nakenjila nzingo ya Negebu nayali na mchewake na lufufu lwa heye lweng'ha hamwe na Loti. <verse eid="GEN 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 13:2"/>Mhela awo, Abulamu nayali na lufufu ng'hatu. Nayali na migongolo minji na sendi na zahabu. <verse eid="GEN 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 13:3"/>Nakalutilila na majendo kulawila honhu ha Negebu mbaka Beteli. Nakafika honhu naloyali yawichile kambi ya chibumuli aho mwaluko, hagati ha Beteli na Ayi, <verse eid="GEN 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 13:4"/>na nayali yazenjile honhu ha kulavila nhambiko. Aho Abulamu nakamlanda Mkulu Nguluwi kwa itagwa lyake.<verse eid="GEN 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 13:5"/>Kahi, Loti nayawele yelongoze na Abulamu, nayali na ming'holo na misenga na mihema. <verse eid="GEN 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 13:6"/>Nawali na migongolo minji lukami, mbaka isi ila nailemwela kuwahega Abulamu na Loti kikala hamwe. <verse eid="GEN 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 13:7"/>Lelo nakulawila kilewa kwa wadimi wa Abulamu na wadimi wa Loti. Mhela awo, Wakanaani na Wapelisi ndo nawali wochikala mli isi ayo.<verse eid="GEN 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 13:8"/>Lelo Abulamu nakamlonjela Loti, “Kowa hela nongwa hali hetwe na kuleche kulawila kilewa kwa wadimi wa hegwe na wadimi wa heni, kwa vila hetwe twa ivyazi limwe. <verse eid="GEN 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 13:9"/>Ulole isi ayi yeng'ha kumwando kwa hegwe. Na tibagule. Wone ulute kumoso, heni ndoluta kudilo, houluta kudilo, heni ndoluta kumoso.”<verse eid="GEN 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 13:10"/>Loti nakenula meho ga heye, nakalyona ibindi lya lwanda lwa Yolodani, nakalyona kuta lina mazi ga kuhega chila honhu, kota kamgunda ka Mkulu Nguluwi na kota isi ya Misili nzingo ya Soali. Ayi nayali Mkulu Nguluwi naloyawele yang'hali kuibagamiza miji ja Sodoma na Gomola. <verse eid="GEN 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 13:11"/>Lelo Loti nakehagulila ibindi lya lwanda lwa Yolodani, nakalutilila kolilawilaga isanya, na hino ndo nawebagule. <verse eid="GEN 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 13:12"/>Abulamu nakapona muisi ya Kanaani na Loti nakekala hagati ha miji jiwele mibindi, nakaluta kikala behi na Sodoma. <verse eid="GEN 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 13:13"/>Wanhu wa Sodoma nawali wehile na wadita gehile wakulu kwa Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="GEN 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Abulamu kangulajilwa isi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 13:14"/>Loti loyebagule na Abulamu, Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlonjela Abulamu, “Winule meho ga hegwe kulawila aho houli ulole nzingo zeng'ha, kasikazini na kusini na kolilawilaga isanya na kolizinjilaga isanya. <verse eid="GEN 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 13:15"/>Isi ayi yeng'ha youlinguyona ndokupa hegwe na walelwa wa hegwe iwe ya hemwe mazuwa gose. <verse eid="GEN 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 13:16"/>Walelwa wa hegwe ndowadita wawe wenji kota vila sangalaza za isi hazilinguwazigwa na walelwa wa hegwe hawoweza kuwazigwa. <verse eid="GEN 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 13:17"/>Lelo winuche uijendele isi ayi kwa ugazi na utali, kwa vila ndokupa hegwe.” <verse eid="GEN 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 13:18"/>Baho, Abulamu nakang'umbula ihema, nakaluta kikala habehi na igodi likulu lya Mamle kula Hebuloni, ako nakamzenjela Mkulu Nguluwi honhu ha kulavila nhambiko.<verse eid="GEN 13:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="GEN 14"/>
  <para style="s">Abulamu kangumlohola Loti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 14:1"/>Mhela awo, mndewa Amlafeli wa Shinali na mndewa Alioko wa Elasali na mndewa Kedolilaomeli wa Elamu na mndewa Tidali wa Goiimu, <verse eid="GEN 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 14:2"/>nawetowa ngondo na Bela mndewa wa Sodoma na Bilisha mndewa wa Gomola na Shinabu mndewa wa Adima na Shemebeli mndewa wa Seboimu na mndewa wa Bela itagwa linji Soali. <verse eid="GEN 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 14:3"/>Wandewa awo wahano nawawakungajiza hamwe wamizi wa hewo kuli ibindi lya Sidimu, liwele ndo Bahali ya Mwino. <verse eid="GEN 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 14:4"/>Mhela wa miyaka kumi na mili nawali womhulichiza mndewa Kedolilaomeli, ila louwele mwaka wa kumi na midatu, nawamhinduka. <verse eid="GEN 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 14:5"/>Loufichile mwaka wa kumi na jine, mndewa Kedolilaomeli na wala wandewa wayage nawoya kuwatowa wanhu wa Lefaimu ako Ashitaloti-kalinaimu na Wasusimu ako Hamu na Waemi ako Shawe-kiliataimu <verse eid="GEN 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 14:6"/>na Waholi ako kuli isi ya vidunda vya Seili, nawawawinga mbaka Elipalani, mu mbaka mwa kuchiwala. <verse eid="GEN 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 14:7"/>Hamba nawahiluka kumbele mbaka Enimishipati, ilinguchemigwa Kadeshi, na nawaitowa isi yeng'ha ya Waamaleki na kuwasumya Waamoli nawekale Hasasoni-tamali.<verse eid="GEN 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 14:8"/>Ndo mndewa wa Sodoma na mndewa wa Gomola na mndewa wa Adima na mndewa wa Seboimu na mndewa wa Bela, itagwa linji Soali, nawenjila kuli ngondo kuli ibindi lya Sidimu kitowa <verse eid="GEN 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 14:9"/>na Kedolilaomeli mndewa wa Elamu na Tidali mndewa wa Goiimu na Amlafeli mndewa wa Shinali na Alioko mndewa wa Elasali, wandewa wane wochitowa na wandewa wahano. <verse eid="GEN 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 14:10"/>Ibindi lya Sidimu nalyali limemile minila ja lami, lelo wandewa wa Sodoma na Gomola nalowawele woibilima ngondo, nawatumbuchila mumo, ila wanji nawabilimila kuli isi ya vidunda. <verse eid="GEN 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 14:11"/>Lelo wala wasumile, nawahola lufufu lweng'ha lwa Sodoma na Gomola na vilyo vyeng'ha na kuka. <verse eid="GEN 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 14:12"/>Nawamibata Loti, mwana wa mng'holoze Abulamu nayawele yochikala Sodoma, hamwe na lufufu lwake, na kuka.<verse eid="GEN 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 14:13"/>Munhu yumwe yesukule na kubilima, nakaluta kumlonjela yula Muebulaniya Abulamu nayawele yochikala behi na miyaloni ya Mwamoli Mamle. Mamle nayali mng'holoze Eshikoli na Aneli. Weng'ha nawali wawichile ilagano na Abulamu. <verse eid="GEN 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 14:14"/>Abulamu loyahuliche kota mpwage kaholigwa kuli upogozi, nakawachema hamwe wamizi wa heye walanguswe kitowa ngondo na wazidahe miya zidatu na kumi na nane nawapondigwe mng'handa mwake, na kuwawinza wala wang'honyo mbaka Dani. <verse eid="GEN 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 14:15"/>Ako nakawagawanula wamizi kuli vilundo. Nechilo nakawatowa wang'honyo wa heye, nakawasumya na kuwawinga mbaka Hoba, kasikazini mwa Damasiko. <verse eid="GEN 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 14:16"/>Lelo Abulamu nakahiluka na lufufu lweng'ha naluholigwe na wang'honyo, na kumgombola Loti mpwage na lufufu lwake, hamwe na wadala na wanhu wanji waholigwe kuli upogozi.<verse eid="GEN 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Melikisedeki kangumtambichiza Abulamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 14:17"/>Abulamu loyahiluche nayamtowile Kedolilaomeli na wayage, mndewa wa Sodoma nakalawa kuluta kumbochela kuli ibindi lya Shawe, naliwele nguchemigwa ibindi lya mndewa. <verse eid="GEN 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 14:18"/>Na heye Melikisedeki, mndewa wa Salemu, nayawele mtambika wa Nguluwi yawele kuchanya, nakegala ibumunda na divai, <verse eid="GEN 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 14:19"/>nakamtambichiza Abulamu yolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 14:19">“Abulamu nayatambichizwe na Nguluwi Yawele kuchanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 14:19">yalumbile kilanga na isi.<verse eid="GEN 14:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 14:20"/>Nayatogoligwe Nguluwi Yawele kuchanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 14:20">nayawawichile wang'honyo wa hegwe mmoko mwako.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="GEN 14:20">Na heye Abulamu nakamha Melikisedeki ndolendole ya heye honhu hamwe ha kumi ha lufufu lwake naloyawele nalo.<verse eid="GEN 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 14:21"/>Lelo mndewa wa Sodoma, nakamlonjela Abulamu, “Mumhe heni awo wanhu, ila wiholele lufufu lweng'ha gwegwe baho.” <verse eid="GEN 14:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 14:22"/>Ila Abulamu nakamlonjela mndewa wa Sodoma, “Ndangilaha kwa Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi Yawele kuchanya, yalumbile kilanga na isi, <verse eid="GEN 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 14:23"/>kota sihola ne uzi ama ng'weso ya makwamba, na choneche cha hegwe, uleche kuya kidaya na kulonga kota ndimdita Abulamu yawe na lufufu. <verse eid="GEN 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 14:24"/>Lelo sihola choneche leka vila vinhu wasongolo wa heni navyowadile na chasi cha wala nawawele hamwe na heni, Aneli na Eshikoli na Mamle nawawele waganigwe kupegwa.”<verse eid="GEN 14:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="GEN 15"/>
  <para style="s">Ilagano lya Nguluwi na Abulamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 15:1"/>Lozipulute mbuli azo, ulonzi wa Mkulu Nguluwi naumuyila Abulamu aku yolota, “Abulamu, uleche kudumba. Heni nda ngwamo ya hegwe. Heni nda hamwe na hegwe na acho chinhu chikulu ng'hatu kwa hegwe!” <verse eid="GEN 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 15:2"/>Ila Abulamu nakalonga, “Gwaa Mkulu Nguluwi, konipa choni hanga ndilutilila kikala ne mwana, na mhalizi wa heni ndo Elieseli wa Damasiko?” <verse eid="GEN 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 15:3"/>Abulamu nakalonga, “Ulole, humhele mwana, chitumagwa yapondigwe mng'handa ya heni ndo kowa mhalizi wa heni.”<verse eid="GEN 15:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 15:4"/>Ndo baho Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlonjela, “Ayu howa mhalizi wa hegwe. Mwanago wa kuponda gwegwe ndo kowa mhalizi wa hegwe.” <verse eid="GEN 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 15:5"/>Aho Mkulu Nguluwi nakamigala Abulamu kunze na kumlonjela, “Ulole kilanga. Usiwaze nhondwe, wone koweza kuziwaza. Ahyo ndo vyoiwa lulelo lwa hegwe louwa lwinji.” <verse eid="GEN 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 15:6"/>Abulamu nakamtogola Mkulu Nguluwi, na kwa chiwalo acho Mkulu Nguluwi nakamtawiza Abulamu kota katanganika.<verse eid="GEN 15:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 15:7"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlonjela Abulamu, “Heni ndo Mkulu Nguluwi ndikugale hegwe kulawila Uli, muji wa Wakalidayo, leka ndikupe isi ayi uihalile.” <verse eid="GEN 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 15:8"/>Ila Abulamu nakamlonjela, “Gwaa Mkulu Nguluwi, ndovizela ndaze kota ndoihalila isi ayi?” <verse eid="GEN 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 15:9"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlonjela, “Ndigalile isenga ilogota idala liwele na miyaka jidatu, mhene ndala iwele na miyaka jidatu, ing'holo ilume liwele na miyaka jidatu, na ng'hunda na ibofu lya ng'hunda.” <verse eid="GEN 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 15:10"/>Abulamu nakamigalila ajo jeng'ha, nakajidumula chila igongolo vihande vili, na kuviwika goya banzi mbili kudilo na kumoso, vichilola, ila videje nahavidumule vihande vili. <verse eid="GEN 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 15:11"/>Na ndapo lowaiwinzile vihande vila Abulamu nakawa yowawinga.<verse eid="GEN 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 15:12"/>Isanya loluwele luzibila, Abulamu nakebatika na usinjizi lukami, kudumba na jiza totolo navimgubika. <verse eid="GEN 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 15:13"/>Aho Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlonjela Abulamu, “Uvizele ng'hatu kota walelwa wa hegwe wochikala kota wajenzi kuli isi yohaiwele ya hewo, wowa wapogozi na wogazigwa kwa mhela wa miyaka miya zine. <verse eid="GEN 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 15:14"/>Lelo ndowatagusa wanhu wa nhanzi ya isi ilinguwadita wapogozi, na hamba wala wawele muupogozi wolawa wawele na lufufu lwinji. <verse eid="GEN 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 15:15"/>Ila hegwe kobagama goya ng'hatu houchikala kwa mhela wa kuhega. <verse eid="GEN 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 15:16"/>Walelwa wa hegwe wohiluka aha kuli lulelo lwa kane, kwa vila wihe wa Waamoli hauwele wa kuhega kutagusigwa.”<verse eid="GEN 15:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 15:17"/>Loifichile matinazo kwali na jiza, Nguluwi nakalajiza chiya chilingufung'ha iyosi na chiluli chilingwaka navyoneka vikola hagati ha vila viwunde. <verse eid="GEN 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 15:18"/>Mkulu Nguluwi kadita ilagano na Abulamu aku yolonga, “Walelwa wa hegwe ndanguwapa isi ayi, kulawila lwanda lwa Naili lwa Misili mbaka lula lwanda lukulu lwa Eyufulate, <verse eid="GEN 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 15:19"/>ndo ila iwele isi ya Wakeni na Wakenisi na Wakadimoni <verse eid="GEN 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 15:20"/>na Wahiti na Wapelisi na Walefayi <verse eid="GEN 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 15:21"/>na Waamoli na Wakanaani na Wagiligashi na Wayebusi.”<verse eid="GEN 15:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="GEN 16"/>
  <para style="s">Salai na Hagali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 16:1"/>Lelo Salai, mdala wa Abulamu, nayang'hali kumpondela mwana wa heye. Ila nayali na chitumagwa mdala nayali yochemigwa Hagali, kulawa Misili. <verse eid="GEN 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 16:2"/>Lelo Salai nakamlonjela Abulamu, “Kuvizela kota Mkulu Nguluwi hamhele lulelo lwa kuponda wana. Umhole Hagali chitumagwa wa heni mdala, hanji ndopata wana kwa kukolela heye.” Abulamu nakakunda ulonzi wa Salai.<verse eid="GEN 16:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 16:3"/>Hamba, Salai nakampa Abulamu Hagali, chitumagwa wa heye mdala yalawile Misili yawe mchewake. Aga nagalawila Abulamu nayekalile Kanaani kwa mhela wa miyaka kumi. <verse eid="GEN 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 16:4"/>Abulamu nakamhola Hagali, na heye Hagali nakawa na himila. Ila baho du loyawene kahola himila, Hagali nakaluka kumbeza mkulu wake Salai. <verse eid="GEN 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 16:5"/>Salai nakamlonjela Abulamu, “Hegwe yokuwala kwa wihe wondilinguditigwa! Heni nandikupa chitumagwa wa heni mdala, ila loyaholile himila du, heni ndiwa siwele munhu hameho hake. Mkulu Nguluwi nayataguse mbuli ya hegwe na heni!” <verse eid="GEN 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 16:6"/>Ila Abulamu nakamlonjela Salai, “Chitumagwa wa hegwe mdala ka hasi ha ludali lwako, mditile kota louvigana.” Lelo Salai nakamgaza Hagali mbaka nakanyeleduka.<verse eid="GEN 16:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ishimaeli kangupondigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 16:7"/>Mhilisi wa Mkulu Nguluwi nakamfika Hagali hawele na nzasa ya mazi kuchiwala, nzasa iwele mnzila kulutila Shuli. <verse eid="GEN 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 16:8"/>Mhilisi nakamuuza, “Hagali, chitumagwa mdala wa Salai, kwangulawa kohi na kwanguza kohi?” Hagali nakamwidichila, “Ndangumbilima Salai mkulu wa heni.” <verse eid="GEN 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 16:9"/>Yula mhilisi wa Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlonjela Hagali, “Hiluche kwa mkulu wa hegwe Salai na umhulichize heye.” <verse eid="GEN 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 16:10"/>Kwa ago geng'ha, mhilisi wa Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlonjela Hagali, “Ndokonjezela lulelo lwako mbaka walemwele kuwazigwa kwa winji wa hewo.” <verse eid="GEN 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 16:11"/>Hamba ayo mhilisi wa Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlonjela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 16:11">“Hegwe kuna himila na koponda mwana mlume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 16:11">komchema itagwa lyake Ishimaeli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ishimaeli </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kwa Chiebulaniya ndo kota Nguluwi kanguhulika.</char></note>,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 16:11">mina Mkulu Nguluwi nakalola kugaya kwa hegwe.<verse eid="GEN 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 16:12"/>Ishimaeli kochikala kota idogowi lya kisolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 16:12">kowa mng'honyo wa chila munhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 16:12">na chila munhu kowa yamwihilwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 16:12">Kochikala yawele mwihe wa ivyazi lyake.”<verse eid="GEN 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 16:13"/>Lelo Hagali nakampa itagwa Mkulu Nguluwi loyasimile na heye ako, “Hegwe ndo Nguluwi yalingumbona heni” Kwa vila nakejesa, “Ndangukomya aha ndimona heye yalingumbona heni.” <verse eid="GEN 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 16:14"/>Ndo mina lila izimbo lyanguchemigwa Beeli-lahai-loi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:14 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Beeli-lahai-loi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mina ndo izimbo lya yula yawele mkomu na yalingumbona heni.</char></note>. Izimbo ali lya hagati ha Kadeshi na Beledi.<verse eid="GEN 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 16:15"/>Hagali nakampondela Abulamu mwana mlume. Abulamu nakamchema mwana ayo Ishimaeli. <verse eid="GEN 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 16:16"/>Abulamu nayali na miyaka makumi nane na sita, mhela Hagali naloyampondile Ishimaeli.<verse eid="GEN 16:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="GEN 17"/>
  <para style="s">Ilagano na ikumbi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 17:1"/>Mhela Abulamu naloyawele na miyaka makumi tisa na tisa, Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlawila, na kumlonjela, “Heni nda Nguluwi yawele na mong'ho. Uwinze ulongozi wa heni na kikala goya ulihela nongwa. <verse eid="GEN 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 17:2"/>Leka mbiche ilagano lya heni na hegwe na kukonjezela ng'hatu lulelo lwako.” <verse eid="GEN 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 17:3"/>Aho Abulamu nakafugama. Na heye Nguluwi nakamlonjela, <verse eid="GEN 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 17:4"/>“Ndanguwika ilagano ali na hegwe. Kowa mhaza wa nhanzi nyinji. <verse eid="GEN 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 17:5"/>Kulawila sambi, huchemigwa kahi Abulamu, ila kochemigwa Abulahamu, mina ndikudita uwe mhaza wa nhanzi nyinji. <verse eid="GEN 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 17:6"/>Ndokudita uwe na wana wenji ng'hatu, kwa hegwe ndolavya nhanzi nyinji na wandewa wolawa kwa heye. <verse eid="GEN 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 17:7"/>Ndolibatilila ilagano lya heni na hegwe, lulelo lwa hegwe na lulelo lwawo lweng'ha mazuwa gose ne kuduma, kahi ndowa Nguluwi wa hegwe na Nguluwi wa lulelo lwako mazuwa gose. <verse eid="GEN 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 17:8"/>Ndokupa hegwe na lulelo lwako isi ayi youlingikala kota mjenzi, mina isi yeng'ha ya Kanaani iwe ya hemwe mazuwa gose, na heni ndowa Nguluwi wa hewo.”<verse eid="GEN 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 17:9"/>Hamba Nguluwi nakamlonjela Abulahamu, “Kwa banzi ya hegwe, hegwe kolibatilila ilagano lya heni, hegwe na lulelo lwako lweng'ha na lulelo lwao lweng'ha. <verse eid="GEN 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 17:10"/>Ali ndo ilagano loulibatilila kuli heni na hegwe na lulelo lwako, chila mlume hali hemwe imgana yenjile ikumbi. <verse eid="GEN 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 17:11"/>Mokwinjila ikumbi, na ayi ndo yowa ulajilo wa ilagano lya heni na hemwe. <verse eid="GEN 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 17:12"/>Chila mwana mlume wa mazuwa nane hali hemwe imgana yenjile ikumbi. Chila mlume kuli lulelo lwenu, yawe munhu yapondigwe mng'handa mwenu ama yaguligwe kwa sendi za hemwe kulawa kwa mjenzi yohawele lulelo lwenu. <verse eid="GEN 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 17:13"/>Ena, chila yumwe wa hewo yapondigwe kuli ng'handa ya hegwe na yaguligwe kwa sendi za hegwe ndangukomya, imgana yenjile ikumbi. Acho ndo chilajilo cha ilagano lyangu kuli ng'huli za hemwe, ilagano lya mazuwa gose ne kuduma. <verse eid="GEN 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 17:14"/>Mlume yoneche yohenjile ikumbi kobaguligwa na wanhu wa heye, kwa vila nakabena ilagano lya heni.”<verse eid="GEN 17:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Abulahamu kangulonjelwa mbuli ya kupegwa mwana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 17:15"/>Hamba Nguluwi nakamlonjela Abulahamu, “Nakuwala mdala wa hegwe, humchema kahi itagwa lyake Salai, ila itagwa lyake lyowa Sala. <verse eid="GEN 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 17:16"/>Ndomtambichiza, na heye kokupondela mwana mlume. Ena ndomtambichiza Sala, na heye kowa mamo wa nhanzi nyinji na wandewa wa isi wolawa kwa heye.” <verse eid="GEN 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 17:17"/>Aho Abulahamu nakafugama, nakaseka mnhumbula mwa heye yochijesa, “Hambi, yokomya ng'hatu mwana kupondigwa na ng'hongoloka wa miyaka miya? Na ndaze, Sala yawele na miyaka makumi tisa, koweza kuponda mwana?” <verse eid="GEN 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 17:18"/>Lelo Abulahamu nakamlonjela Nguluwi, “Na uwe ukundile ilagano alyo na uwe uliwichile kwa Ishimaeli.” <verse eid="GEN 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 17:19"/>Nguluwi nakamwidichila, “Hebu, ila mdala wa hegwe Sala kokupondela mwana mlume, nagwe komchema Isaka. Ndoliwika goya ilagano lyangu kwa heye na walelwa wa heye, naliwe ilagano lya mazuwa gose.<verse eid="GEN 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 17:20"/>“Na mbuli ya Ishimaeli, nyhulika kulanda kwa hegwe. Ndomtambichiza, na kowa na wana wenji na kumonjezela ng'hatu. Ishimaeli kowa mhaza wa wandewa kumi na weli, na heni ndomdita yawe mhaza wa nhanzi ng'hulu. <verse eid="GEN 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 17:21"/>Ila ilagano lyangu lyotawizwa kwa Isaka yawele kokupondela Sala mwaka ukuya mhela kota awu.” <verse eid="GEN 17:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 17:22"/>Lelo Nguluwi loyasindile kulonga, nakamleka Abulahamu, nakaheluka kilanga.<verse eid="GEN 17:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 17:23"/>Aho, Abulahamu nakamwinjiza ikumbi mwanage Ishimaeli, na kuwenjiza ikumbi walume weng'ha nawapondigwe mng'handa mwake na waguligwe kwa sendi za heye, nakawenjiza ikumbi weng'ha zuwa lilila kota Nguluwi navyoyamlajize. <verse eid="GEN 17:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 17:24"/>Abulahamu nayali na miyaka makumi tisa na tisa naloyenjizwe ikumbi. <verse eid="GEN 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 17:25"/>Na Ishimaeli mwanage nayali na miyaka kumi na midatu naloyenjizwe ikumbi. <verse eid="GEN 17:25"/><verse number="26-27" style="v" sid="GEN 17:26-27"/>Abulahamu na mwanage Ishimaeli, hamwe na walume weng'ha wa ng'handa ya heye na wanhu weng'ha nawapondigwe mng'handa mwake na wala waguligwe kwa sendi za heye nawenjizwa ikumbi zuwa lilila.<verse eid="GEN 17:26-27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="GEN 18"/>
  <para style="s">Nguluwi kangutawiza ilagano lya heye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 18:1"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlawila Abulahamu hali miyaloni ja Mamle. Abulahamu nayali yekale hali lwizi lwa chibumuli cha heye mhela wa ivuche lya nemisi, <verse eid="GEN 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 18:2"/>na loyenule meho ga heye, nakawona wanhu wadatu wemile kutali hado na heye. Baho loyawawene, nakalawa yobilima kuluta kuwabochela. Loyafichile kenamiza mbaka hasi, <verse eid="GEN 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 18:3"/>na kulonga, “Wakulu, wone mlingungana ndanguwalanda mleche kukola hondili chitumagwa wa hemwe. <verse eid="GEN 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 18:4"/>Mochigalilwa mazi mado leka muhovuje magulu na kwesela hali migodi mlubehelo. <verse eid="GEN 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 18:5"/>Mhela homukwesela, ndowa nditeleka ndiya, mulye, leka muwe na mong'ho wa kulutilila na majendo, mina muya kwa heni chitumagwa wa hemwe.” Na hewo nawalonga, “Goya, udite kota vyoulonjile.”<verse eid="GEN 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 18:6"/>Abulahamu nakahiluka himahima kuli chibumuli nakamlonjela Sala, “Uwiche goya himahima vijemo vidatu vya utimbo unojile, utimbe, na usome mibumunda.” <verse eid="GEN 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 18:7"/>Hamba Abulahamu nakalawa himahima nakuluta kuli misenga, nakahagula ilogota limwe linenehe goya, nakamha chitumagwa yumwe yeyohaje kulidumula na kuliteleka. <verse eid="GEN 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 18:8"/>Kahi Abulahamu nakahola mtindi na matombo na ajila miwunde ja ibuguma jiwele jisomigwe goya, na kuwawichila wajenzi awo chilyo, na heye nakema behi na hewo kuwaditila nalowali wolya hasi ha igodi.<verse eid="GEN 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 18:9"/>Awala wajenzi nawamuuza, “Mdala wa hegwe Sala kakohi?” Abulahamu nakawedichila, “Kamchibumuli.” <verse eid="GEN 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 18:10"/>Yumwe wa hewo nakalonga, “Ndangukomya ndokuhiluchila mhela kota awu mwaka ukuya, na mdala wa hegwe Sala kowa na mwana mlume.” Sala nayali yohulichiza kuli lwizi lwa ihema naluwele kumbele kwa heye. <verse eid="GEN 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 18:11"/>Abulahamu na Sala nawali walalile, na heye Sala mbuli zila za wadala nazali zidumile katali. <verse eid="GEN 18:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 18:12"/>Lelo Sala nakaseka mgati mwa nhumbula yolonga, “Heni ndala, na mkulu wa heni Abulahamu hihyo. Ndaze, londiwa ndalile hino, ndoweza kusangalala na kuwa na wana?” <verse eid="GEN 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 18:13"/>Aho Mkulu Nguluwi nakamuuza Abulahamu, “Lekachoni Sala nakaseka na kiwuza vyoiwa yawe na mwana vyoyawele yalalile? <verse eid="GEN 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 18:14"/>Ndaze, hana mbuli yoneche haiditikwa kwa Mkulu Nguluwi? Ndokuhiluchila mhela uwichigwe, mhela kota awu mwaka ukuya, na Sala kowa na mwana mlume.” <verse eid="GEN 18:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 18:15"/>Ila Sala, nayawele yodumba, nakabela yolonga, “Sisechile!” Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlonjela, “Hebu, kuseka nakuseka.”<verse eid="GEN 18:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Abulahamu kanguwalandila wanhu wa Sodoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 18:16"/>Hamba wala wanhu nawoka, nawaulola muji wa Sodoma, na heye Abulahamu nakawasindichiza. <verse eid="GEN 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 18:17"/>Lelo Mkulu Nguluwi nakejesa, “Ndaze, ndimvise Abulahamu mbuli ilibehi kuidita? <verse eid="GEN 18:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 18:18"/>Heye Abulahamu kowa mhaza wa wanhu wa nhanzi ng'hulu na kwa heye nhanzi za isi zeng'ha zotambichizwa. <verse eid="GEN 18:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 18:19"/>Ndimhagula heye leka yawalajize walelwa wa heye kibatilila nzila ya Mkulu Nguluwi, wawe watanganiche na kutagusa goya, ahyo Mkulu Nguluwi komigalila Abulahamu kota navyoyalagane.”<verse eid="GEN 18:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 18:20"/>Lelo Mkulu Nguluwi nakalonga, “Hana kung'ung'utilwa lukami kwa muji wa Sodoma na Gomola na gehile ga hewo makulu ng'hatu. <verse eid="GEN 18:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 18:21"/>Lelo ndodulika kuluta ako ndikelolele nene kota kukomya nawadita kota vila chililo vyochimbuyile. Ndangugana kuvizela.”<verse eid="GEN 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 18:22"/>Kulawa baho, wala wanhu nawebatilila nzila ya kuluta Sodoma, ila Abulahamu nayang'hali yemile hali Mkulu Nguluwi. <verse eid="GEN 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 18:23"/>Lelo Abulahamu nakamhejelela Mkulu Nguluwi, na kumuuza, “Ndaze, kwangukomya kowakopola wanhu wanojile hamwe na wehile? <verse eid="GEN 18:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 18:24"/>Hanji wamumo wanhu wanojile makumi gahano amo mli muji. Ndaze, koubagamiza muji weng'ha huuleka hebu kwa wala makumi gahano wanojile wawele amo? <verse eid="GEN 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 18:25"/>Ndangijesa kota hudita ahyo hebu. Kuwakopola wanhu wanojile hamwe na wehile, wanojile kuditilwa kota wehile. Hebu! Mtagusa wa isi yeng'ha holeka kutagusa gawele goya.” <verse eid="GEN 18:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 18:26"/>Mkulu Nguluwi, nakamlonjela, “Hondiwafika wanhu wanojile makumi gahano kula Sodoma, ena ndouleka muji weng'ha uwe goya kwa mbuli ya hewo.”<verse eid="GEN 18:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 18:27"/>Abulahamu nakalonga, “Njeza kowa na nhunmbula ikangele ya kulongasa na Mkulu, hanga heni siwele chinhu, nda kota misanga na mivu hela. <verse eid="GEN 18:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 18:28"/>Hanji wabaho wanhu wanojile makumi gane na wahano kwa wala makumi gahano. Ndaze, koubagamiza muji weng'ha kwa vila wapuka wanhu wahano?” Mkulu Nguluwi nakamwidichila, “Siubagamiza muji wone kowa na wanhu wanojile makumi gane na wahano.”<verse eid="GEN 18:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 18:29"/>Abulahamu nakonjezela kulonga, “Hanji wanhu makumi gane wawele amo.” Nguluwi nakamwidichila, “Kwa mbuli ya wanhu wanojile makumi gane, sidita ahyo.”<verse eid="GEN 18:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 18:30"/>Abulahamu nakonjezela kulonga, “Mkulu, ndangulanda uleche kunzudila, na heni ndolonga kahi. Hanji wowabaho wanhu wanojile makumi gadatu.” Mkulu Nguluwi nakamwidichila, “Sidita ahyo hondiwafika awo wanhu makumi gadatu.”<verse eid="GEN 18:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 18:31"/>Abulahamu nakalonga, “Nanjeza kulonga na Mkulu kwa nhumbula ikangale. Hanji wowa baho wanhu wanojile makumi meli.” Nguluwi nakamwidichila, “Kwa mbuli ya awo wanhu makumi meli wanojile, siubagamiza hebu.”<verse eid="GEN 18:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 18:32"/>Hamba Abulahamu nakalonga, “Mkulu, ndangulanda uleche kunzudila, ila ndolonga kahi kamwe hela. Ndaze, wone wawe wanhu wanojile kumi, yowa ndaze?” Mkulu Nguluwi nakamwidichila, “Kwa mbuli ya awo wanojile kumi, siubagamiza muji awo.”<verse eid="GEN 18:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 18:33"/>Mkulu Nguluwi loyasindile kulonga na Abulahamu, nakoka, na heye Abulahamu nakahiluka kaye.<verse eid="GEN 18:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="GEN 19"/>
  <para style="s">Wihe wa Sodoma na Gomola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 19:1"/>Wala wahilisi weli nawafika muji wa Sodoma matinazo. Loti nayawele yekalise hali lwizi lwa muji wa Sodoma, loyawawene nakenuka kuwabochela, nakenamiza mbaka hasi <verse eid="GEN 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 19:2"/>na kulonga, “Wakulu wa heni, muye hakaye hangu heni chitumagwa wa hemwe. Moweza kuhovuga magulu na kuwasa kwa heni nechilo ya lehano. Lufuku ng'hanu hananya moweza kulutilila na majendo ga hemwe.” Ila hewo nawalonga, “Hebu, hetwe towasa honhu hawele hagati ha muji.” <verse eid="GEN 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 19:3"/>Loti nakawadedeza lukami, hamba nawamkundila, nawagaluka na kwinjila mng'handa mwake. Loti nakawawichila chilyo, nakapanila mibumunda johajiwichigwe usaso, nawalya.<verse eid="GEN 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 19:4"/>Ila nalowang'hali kuwasa nechilo, walume weng'ha wa muji wa Sodoma na wasongolo na wasekulu, nawaizunguluta ng'handa ya Loti. <verse eid="GEN 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 19:5"/>Nawamchema Loti na kumuuza, “Wakohi wala walume wezile kwa hegwe? Walavye kunze. Twangugana kuwasa nawo.”<verse eid="GEN 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 19:6"/>Loti nakalawa kunze, nakapajila lwizi kumbele kwa heye, <verse eid="GEN 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 19:7"/>nakawalonjela, “Wang'holozangu, ndanguwadedeza mleche kudita wihe awo. <verse eid="GEN 19:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 19:8"/>Mlole, ndanawo wahinza weli wang'hali wasa na mlume. Mng'hundize ndiwape awo wahinza muwadite kota vyomgana. Ila mleche kuwaditila chinhu choneche chila walume awa kwa vila awa ndo wajenzi wawele hali wamizi wa heni.”<verse eid="GEN 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 19:9"/>Ila hewo nawalonga, “Hejela! Hegwe nakuya hano kota mjenzi na sambi kwangidita mtagusa. Lelo tokudita vibi kusinda awo wajenzi wa hegwe.” Aho nawamkundujiza Loti kumbele behi na kuubegula lwizi lwa heye. <verse eid="GEN 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 19:10"/>Ila wala wajenzi nawagolola moko gawo, nawamkwega Loti mng'handa na kupajila lwizi. <verse eid="GEN 19:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 19:11"/>Hamba wawatowa kwa lumwemwesa lung'ang'ale kumeho na walemwela kulola walume weng'ha nawawele hali lwizi, wakulu kwa wadodo, mbaka nawapala kohi hawele na lwizi nahawauwene.<verse eid="GEN 19:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Loti kangulawa Sodoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 19:12"/>Wala wanhu weli nawamlonjela Loti, “Ndaze, kwanaye munhu yunji ahano, hanji wakasano ama wasongolo ama wahinza wa hegwe ama wanhu wanji wa ivyazi lyako walingikala hano, walavye honhu aha himahima, <verse eid="GEN 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 19:13"/>kwa vila twahabehi kuubagamiza muji awu, mina chililo nachimfichile Mkulu Nguluwi kulawa kwa wanhu wa muji awu ndo kukulu ng'hatu, leka heye katulajiza tuye kuwabagamiza.”<verse eid="GEN 19:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 19:14"/>Lelo Loti nakawalutila wakasano wa heye, nakawalonjela, “Himahima! Mlawe honhu aha, mina Mkulu Nguluwi koubagamiza muji awu.” Ila hewo nawamona kota munhu msechezi hela.<verse eid="GEN 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 19:15"/>Lufuku, wahilisi nawamhimiliza Loti wolonga, “Ulilimche, muhole mdala wa hegwe na awa wahinza wa hegwe weli mleche kubagama mhela muji awo hougazigwa.” <verse eid="GEN 19:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 19:16"/>Loti nakawa yogogoma. Ila kwa vila Mkulu Nguluwi vyoyamonele isungu Loti, wala wahilisi nawamibata heye na mdala wa heye na wahinza wa heye weli, na kumlavya kunze ha muji ula. <verse eid="GEN 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 19:17"/>Nalowawalavile kunze ha muji, mhilisi yumwe nakawalonjela, “Mbilime kwa kuulohola ukomu wa hemwe. Mleche kulola kumbele ama kwima mibindi. Mbilimile kuchidunda, mleche kubagamizwa.”<verse eid="GEN 19:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 19:18"/>Loti nakawalonjela, “Hebu, wakulu wa heni! <verse eid="GEN 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 19:19"/>Ndangukomya kota heni chitumagwa wa hemwe ndina igano lya kwimilila hameho henu, na hemwe miwonela isungu ng'hatu kwa kuulohola ukomu wa heni, ila kuchidunda kwa kutali lukami. Ibagamizo ali lyofika nding'hali fika ako, nani ndobagama. <verse eid="GEN 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 19:20"/>Mlole, kula kuna muji mdodo uwele behi ndoweza kubilimila ako. Lelo mng'hundize mbilimile ako. Ula ndo muji mdodo hela, na ako ndowa mkomu.”<verse eid="GEN 19:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 19:21"/>Na heye nakamwidichila, “Goya, ndikukundiza kulanda kwa hegwe. Siubagamiza muji wouchemile. <verse eid="GEN 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 19:22"/>Udite himahima. Ubilimile ako, na heni siweza kudita chinhu choneche mbaka houfika ako.” Lelo muji awo nauchemigwa Soali, ulinguzeleka kota udodo.<verse eid="GEN 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kubagamizwa kwa Sodoma na Gomola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 19:23"/>Isanya nalyali lilawile mhela Loti loyafichile hali muji wa Soali. <verse eid="GEN 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 19:24"/>Ndo Mkulu Nguluwi nakalagaza hasi chiluli ching'ang'ale cha chikwatilo kulawa kilanga kwa muji wa Sodoma na Gomola, <verse eid="GEN 19:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 19:25"/>nakajibagamiza miji ajo na ibindi lyeng'ha na wanhu weng'ha na mizuchila jeng'ha kuli misanga. <verse eid="GEN 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 19:26"/>Ila mdala wa Loti nayawele kumbele kwa Loti, nakalola kumbele, nakagaluka ibiwi lya mwino.<verse eid="GEN 19:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 19:27"/>Loiwele lufuku, Abulahamu nakaluta honhu hoyawele yemile kumwando kwa Mkulu Nguluwi. <verse eid="GEN 19:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 19:28"/>Loyali aho, nakalola hasi nzingo za Sodoma na Gomola na honhu heng'ha ha ibindi, kwa kona iyosi likwina, iyosi kota itanuli ling'hangala. <verse eid="GEN 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 19:29"/>Nguluwi loyajibagamize miji ja kibindi koyawele yochikala Loti, nakamkumbuka Abulahamu kwa kumlavya Loti kuli miji ajo, leka Loti yaleche kubagama hamwe na hewo.<verse eid="GEN 19:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mwaluko wa Wamoabu na Waamoli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 19:30"/>Loti nakadumba kikala kuli muji wa Soali, lelo nakoka muji awo, heye hamwe na wahinza wa heye weli, nawaluta kikala mipalika kuchidunda. <verse eid="GEN 19:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 19:31"/>Nalowawele ako, mhinza mkulu nakamlonjela lumbulye, “Mhaza wa hetwe nakalala, na kuduhu mlume muisi wa kuwasa na hetwe kota vyoilinguganigwa kuli chihendo. <verse eid="GEN 19:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 19:32"/>Lelo tumgalize mhaza kwa divai, leka tuwase na heye na kukangaza lulelo kwa kuponda wana na heye.” <verse eid="GEN 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 19:33"/>Nechilo ayo nawamgaliza mhaza wa hewo kwa divai, na yula mhinza mkulu nakaluta kuwasa na heye. Ila mhaza wa heye nahavizelele mhela mhinza wa heye loyawasile na heye na loyochile.<verse eid="GEN 19:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 19:34"/>Mitondo, yula mhinza wa mwaluko nakamlonjela yula mdodo, “Haucha nechilo heni nambasa na mhaza, lehano kahi tumgalize na divai, hamba hegwe uwase na heye, leka hetwe twesa tukangaze lulelo kwa kuponda wana kwa mhaza wa hetwe.” <verse eid="GEN 19:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 19:35"/>Lelo nechilo ayo kahi nawamgaliza mhaza wa hewo kwa divai, hamba yula mhinza nakaluta kuwasa naye. Ila mhaza wa heye nahavizelele mhela mhinza wa heye hoyawasile na heye, na loyochile. <verse eid="GEN 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 19:36"/>Lelo wahinza weng'ha weli wa Loti nawawa na himila kwa kuwasa na mhaza wa hewo. <verse eid="GEN 19:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 19:37"/>Yula mhinza wa mwaluko nakaponda mwana mlume, nakamchema Moabu. Ayo ndo mhaza wa Wamoabu mbaka lehano. <verse eid="GEN 19:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 19:38"/>Yula mhinza mdodo kahi nakaponda mwana mlume, nakamchema Beni-ami<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:38 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Beni-ami </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kwa Chiebulaniya ndo mwana wa wanhu wa heni.</char></note>. Ayo ndo mhaza wa Waamoni mbaka lehano.<verse eid="GEN 19:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="GEN 20"/>
  <para style="s">Abulahamu na Abimeleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 20:1"/>Kulawila Mamle, Abulahamu nakenula majendo kulutila Negebu, nakadita luga lwake hagati ha Kadeshi na Shuli, hamba nakaluta kikala ako Gelali kwa mhela uchefu. <verse eid="GEN 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 20:2"/>Loyawele ako, Abulahamu nakalonga kota mchewake Sala ka lumbulye. Lelo mndewa Abimeleki wa Gelali nakamhesa Sala. <verse eid="GEN 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 20:3"/>Ila Nguluwi nakamuyila Abimeleki nechilo loyali yolota, nakamlonjela, “Hegwe kobagama kwa mbuli ya mdala youmholile, kwa vila kana mlume wake.”<verse eid="GEN 20:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 20:4"/>Abimeleki nayang'hali wasa na Sala, nakedichila, “Mkulu, kowakopola wanhu wohawawele na nongwa? <verse eid="GEN 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 20:5"/>Heye Abulahamu ndo yalonjile kota ayu mdala ka lumbulye. Kahi na heye Sala nakalonga kota Abulahamu kalumbu wa heye. Heni ndita vyonditile kwa nhumbula igoloche ndahela nongwa.” <verse eid="GEN 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 20:6"/>Nguluwi nakamlonjela koyali yolota, “Goya. Ndivizela kota kudita ahyo kwa nhumbula igoloche, na heni ndo ndikulemeze kudita gehile ago, ndo mina sikukundiza umdolize ayo mdala. <verse eid="GEN 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 20:7"/>Lelo umhiluse ayo mdala kwa mlume wa heye. Abulahamu ndo mloli wa heni, na heye kokulandila nagwe kowa mkomu. Ila wone humhiluse, uvizele ng'hatu kota hegwe kobagama hamwe na wanhu wa hegwe weng'ha.”<verse eid="GEN 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 20:8"/>Abimeleki nakalilimka lufuku, nakawachema vitumagwa wa heye weng'ha na kuwalonjela mbuli nazoyaziwene koyali yolota, na hewo nawadumba ng'hatu. <verse eid="GEN 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 20:9"/>Baho, Abimeleki nakamchema Abulahamu, na kumuuza, “Nakutuditila choni? Lekachoni nakunyambuza heni kudita gehile na sambi Nguluwi kangugana kungaza heni na undewa wa heni? Kunditila mbuli zohaziganigwa kuditigwa.” <verse eid="GEN 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 20:10"/>Abimeleki nakalutilila kumuuza Abulahamu, “Chinhu chachi chikuditile kudita hino?”<verse eid="GEN 20:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 20:11"/>Abulahamu nakamwidichila, “Nandita hino kwa vila nandijesa kota kuduhu munhu ne yumwe yalingumdumba Nguluwi honhu hano, na kota mwahang'hopole leka mumhole mchewangu. <verse eid="GEN 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 20:12"/>Kuleka kwa ago, ndangukomya, heye ka lumbulyangu, mhaza wa heye na mhaza wa heni ndo yumwe, ila hatihanzile mamo, ndo mina kawa mchewangu. <verse eid="GEN 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 20:13"/>Mhela Nguluwi loyanditile ndiileche ng'handa ya mhaza wa heni na kuluta kuujenzi, nandimlonjela mchewangu, ‘Honeche hotuluta, dedede ulajile igano kwa heni kwa kulonga kota heni nda lumbulyo.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 20:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 20:14"/>Abimeleki nakamhilusila Abulahamu mchewake Sala, nakamha na ming'holo na misenga na vitumagwa walume na wadala. <verse eid="GEN 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 20:15"/>Abimeleki nakamlonjela Abulahamu, “Ulole, isi ayi yeng'ha ya heni. Lelo uhagule heng'ha hala uhaganile, wikale.” <verse eid="GEN 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 20:16"/>Hamba nakamlonjela Sala, “Ulole, heni ndimha mng'holozo migwala maelufu menji leka kuwalajila wawele hamwe na hegwe kota kwahela nongwa, nakutawizwa kota kwahela nongwa” <verse eid="GEN 20:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 20:17"/>Hamba Abulahamu nakamlanda Nguluwi, na heye kamlohola Abimeleki na mchewake na vitumagwa wa heye mdala, mbaka nawaweza kuponda kahi wana. <verse eid="GEN 20:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 20:18"/>Aho mwaluko Mkulu Nguluwi nayali yawalemeze wadala weng'ha wa ng'handa ya Abimeleki kuponda wana kwa mbuli ya Sala mchewake Abulahamu.<verse eid="GEN 20:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="GEN 21"/>
  <para style="s">Kupondigwa kwa Isaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 21:1"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nakamkumbuka Sala, nakamditila kota vyoyelahile. <verse eid="GEN 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 21:2"/>Abulahamu naloyali yalalile, Sala nakahola himila, nakampondela mwana msongolo, mhela wuwula Nguluwi woyalonjile. <verse eid="GEN 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 21:3"/>Abulahamu nakamchema ayo mwana yampondile Sala itagwa lyake, Isaka. <verse eid="GEN 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 21:4"/>Isaka loyafichile mazuwa nane, Abulahamu nakamwinjiza ikumbi kota Nguluwi vyoyalajize. <verse eid="GEN 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 21:5"/>Abulahamu nayali na miyaka miya imwe, mhela mwanage Isaka naloyapondigwe. <verse eid="GEN 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 21:6"/>Na heye Sala nakalonga, “Nguluwi kangalila lusele, yoneche yohulika mbuli azi, koseka hamwe na heni.” <verse eid="GEN 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 21:7"/>Hamba nakonjezela, “Yalikohi nayahamlonjele Abulahamu kota heni Sala ndokonyeza wana? Na ndimpondela mwana msongolo kuli ulalilo wa heye.”<verse eid="GEN 21:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hagali kanguwinjigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 21:8"/>Isaka nakalutilila kukula, na zuwa loyalechile kong'ha, Abulahamu nakadita mnvina ng'hulu.<verse eid="GEN 21:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 21:9"/>Hamba Sala nakamona Ishimaeli, mwana wa Abulahamu yapondigwe na Hagali Mmisili, yoseka. <verse eid="GEN 21:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 21:10"/>Sala nakamlonjela Abulahamu, “Umuwinje chitumagwa ayo mdala hamwe na mwanage. Kwa vila hohalila hamwe na mwana wa heni Isaka.” <verse eid="GEN 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 21:11"/>Mbuli ayi naimigalila masinzo lukami Abulahamu kwa vila Ishimaeli na heye nayali mwanage. <verse eid="GEN 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 21:12"/>Ila Nguluwi nakamlonjela Abulahamu, “Uleche kisinza kwa mbuli ya mwana ayu, na ayo chitumagwa wa hegwe mdala. Lyoneche loyokulonjela Sala, udite, ndangukomya walelwa wa hegwe wondikulahile wolawa kwa Isaka. <verse eid="GEN 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 21:13"/>Na mbuli ya ayo mwana wa chitumagwa wa hegwe mdala ndomdita yawe mhaza wa nhanzi ng'hulu kwa vila heye naye ka mwana wa hegwe.”<verse eid="GEN 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 21:14"/>Ahyo lufuku, Abulahamu nakahola chilyo na kajilo ka mazi, nakamha Hagali na kumdwika mmayega, na kumuwinga hamwe na mwanage. Hagali nakoka, kawa yojendajenda mchihulo Beeli-sheba.<verse eid="GEN 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 21:15"/>Nayali mazi nalogamalile mli kala kajilo, Hagali nakamuwasiliza mwanage hasi migodi. <verse eid="GEN 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 21:16"/>Heye nakaluta hafungo, kekala utali wa kota magulu miya imwe hino, yolonga mnhumbula mwa heye, “Inoga ndeche kumona mwanangu yobagama.” Naloyawele yekalise aho nakaluka kulila.<verse eid="GEN 21:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 21:17"/>Nguluwi nakamhulika mwana ayo yolila, na mhilisi wa Nguluwi nakamchema Hagali kulawila kilanga, na kumlonjela, “Kuna nongwa yachi Hagali? Uleche kudumba, Nguluwi nakahulika lizi ya mwana ako kouwele. <verse eid="GEN 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 21:18"/>Wime na umwinule mwana mibate goya mmoko mwa hegwe, mina ndomdita yawe mhaza wa nhanzi ng'hulu.” <verse eid="GEN 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 21:19"/>Nguluwi nakamgubula Hagali meho, na heye nakalyona izimbo lya mazi. Nakaluta kamemeza mazi mkajilo, na kumnweza mwanage. <verse eid="GEN 21:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 21:20"/>Nguluwi kawa hamwe na ayo mwana, na heye nakalutilila kukula. Nakekala kuchihulo nakawa mlasa msale. <verse eid="GEN 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 21:21"/>Nayali yochikala kuli chihulo cha Palani, na mayake nakamhesela mdala kulawa isi ya Misili.<verse eid="GEN 21:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ilagano lya Abulahamu na Abimeleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 21:22"/>Mhela awo, Abimeleki hamwe na Fikoli, mkulu wa wamizi wa heye, nakamlutila Abulahamu na kumlonjela, “Nguluwi kahamwe na hegwe kwa chila chinhu choulingudita. <verse eid="GEN 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 21:23"/>Lelo ndilahile kwa itagwa lya Nguluwi kota hunditila uhadi heni ama wana wa heni ama walelwa wa heni. Kota heni vyombele nojile kwa hegwe, hihyo nagwe uwe na igano lya kwimilila kwa heni na kwa isi ino youlingikala.” <verse eid="GEN 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 21:24"/>Abulahamu nakalonga, “Ndangilaha.”<verse eid="GEN 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 21:25"/>Mhela awo Abulahamu nayali yomng'ung'utila Abimeleki mbuli ya izimbo lya mazi vitumagwa wa Abimeleki lowali wambochile. <verse eid="GEN 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 21:26"/>Abimeleki nakamlonjela, “Heni sivizelele yalikohi yaditile hino, mbaka lehano hegwe hundonjele, na heni nasinahulika mbuli azi mbaka lehano.” <verse eid="GEN 21:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 21:27"/>Abulahamu nakahola ing'holo na isenga nakamha Abimeleki nawo weli nawadita ilagano hewo kwa hewo. <verse eid="GEN 21:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 21:28"/>Abulahamu nakabagula ming'holo myana midala saba. <verse eid="GEN 21:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 21:29"/>Abimeleki nakamuuza Abulahamu, “Lekachoni kwangubagula ajo ming'holo myana midala saba?”<verse eid="GEN 21:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 21:30"/>Abulahamu nakamwidichila, “Aji ming'holo myana midala saba ndangukupa kwa moko wa heni baha kota ulolezi kota heni ndo mbawile izimbo alino.” <verse eid="GEN 21:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 21:31"/>Lelo izimbo alyo nalichemigwa Beeli-sheba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:31 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Beeli-sheba </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kwa Chiebulaniya changuzeleka kota, Izimbo lya Kilaha. </char></note>, mina weng'ha weli nawawika ilagano kwa kilaha honhu aho.<verse eid="GEN 21:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 21:32"/>Ahyo nawadita ilagano ako Beeli-sheba. Abimeleki na Fikoli, mkulu wa wamizi wa heye, nakoka na kuhiluka kuli isi ya Wafilisti. <verse eid="GEN 21:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 21:33"/>Abulahamu nakanyala igodi lilinguchemigwa tamalisiki ako Beeli-sheba, nakalanda kwa itagwa lya Mkulu Nguluwi wa mazuwa gose. <verse eid="GEN 21:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 21:34"/>Abulahamu nakekala isi ya Wafilisti mihela minji.<verse eid="GEN 21:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="GEN 22"/>
  <para style="s">Abulahamu kangumlavya Isaka nhambiko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 22:1"/>Loupulute mhela udo hela, Nguluwi nakamjeza Abulahamu. Nguluwi nakamchema, “Abulahamu!” Na heye nakedichila, “Ena ndanguhulichiza.” <verse eid="GEN 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 22:2"/>Nguluwi nakamlonjela, “Umuhole mwanago Isaka, mwanago wa udewele umganile, ulute mbaka isi ya Molia, ukamlavye nhambiko ya kulakazwa kuchanya mwa chidunda chimwenga chondikulajila.” <verse eid="GEN 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 22:3"/>Hamitondo iyage, Abulahamu nakalilimka lufuku, kalilambalika goya idogowi lyake, nakawahola vitumagwa wa heye weli hamwe na Isaka mwanage. Nakatema ngodi kwa mbuli ya nhambiko ya kulakazwa, hamba nakaluka majendo kuluta honhu hoyalonjelwe na Nguluwi. <verse eid="GEN 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 22:4"/>Zuwa lya kadatu, Abulahamu nakenula meho nakahona honhu aho kwa kutali. <verse eid="GEN 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 22:5"/>Abulahamu nakawalonjela wala vitumagwa wa heye, “Betezeni bahano na ali idogowi. Heni na mwana wa heni toluta mbaka kula tukamfugamile Nguluwi, hamba towahiluchilani.”<verse eid="GEN 22:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 22:6"/>Abulahamu nakamdwika zila ngodi mwanage Isaka, heye yuye nakahola chiluli na chimaje mmoko, na kuka hamwe. <verse eid="GEN 22:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 22:7"/>Isaka nakamchema mhaza wa heye Abulahamu, “Mhaza!” Na heye nakedichila, “Ena, ndabahano mwanangu.” Isaka nakamuuza mhaza wa heye, “Chiluli na ngodi twanazo, ila ing'holo lya nhambiko ya kulakazwa lya kohi?” <verse eid="GEN 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 22:8"/>Abulahamu nakamwidichila, “Mwana wa heni, Nguluwi heye kotigalila ing'holo lyana lya nhambiko ya kulakazwa.” Nawalutilila na majendo.<verse eid="GEN 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 22:9"/>Nalowafichile honhu hala Nguluwi hoyamlajize, Abulahamu nakazenga honhu ha kulavila nhambiko na kuwika goya ngodi hachanya hake. Hamba nakamuwopa mwanage Isaka na kumuwasiliza mchanya hali ngodi kuli honhu ha kulavila nhambiko. <verse eid="GEN 22:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 22:10"/>Abulahamu nakagolola moko, kahola chimaje yamdumule mwanage.<verse eid="GEN 22:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 22:11"/>Ila mhilisi wa Mkulu Nguluwi nakamchema kulawa kilanga, “Abulahamu, Abulahamu!” Na heye nakedichila, “Ena, ndanguhulichiza.” <verse eid="GEN 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 22:12"/>Mhilisi nakamlonjela, “Uleche kumlumiza mwana na uleche kumdita choneche. Sambi ndivizela kota kwangumdumba Nguluwi, kwa vila hundemeze mwanago wa udewele.” <verse eid="GEN 22:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 22:13"/>Ndo baho Abulahamu nakenula meho, nakona ing'holo ilume, ligwilizwe mbalati kuli miwa hali chisosolo. Nakaluta, kalihola alila ing'holo, na kulilavya nhambiko ya kulakazwa honhu ha mwanage. <verse eid="GEN 22:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 22:14"/>Lelo Abulahamu nakahachema honhu aho, “Mkulu Nguluwi kotigalila.” Kota vyoilingulonjigwa mazuwa aga, “Kuli chidunda cha Mkulu Nguluwi kotigalila.”<verse eid="GEN 22:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 22:15"/>Mhilisi wa Mkulu Nguluwi nakamchema Abulahamu lwa keli kulawa kilanga, <verse eid="GEN 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 22:16"/>na kumlonjela, “Mkulu Nguluwi kangulonga hino, ndilaha nene baha, kwa vila kudita hino, nahundemeze mwanago wa udewele, <verse eid="GEN 22:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 22:17"/>ndangukomya ndokutambichiza, na walelwa wa hegwe ndowonjeza kota nhondwe za kilanga, na kota sangalaza mfungo mwa bahali. Walelwa wa hegwe woihalila miji ja wang'honyo wa hewo. <verse eid="GEN 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 22:18"/>Kulawa kwa walelwa wa hegwe wanhu wa isi zeng'ha wotambichizwa kwa vila hegwe nakwidichila ilajizo lyangu.” <verse eid="GEN 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 22:19"/>Abulahamu nakawahiluchila wala vitumagwa wa heye, nawo nawoka hamwe kuhiluka Beeli-sheba, Abulahamu nakekala ako.<verse eid="GEN 22:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wana wa Naholi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 22:20"/>Logalawile ago geng'ha Abulahamu nakahulika mbuli kota Milika kahi kampondela Naholi mng'holoze, wana walume. <verse eid="GEN 22:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 22:21"/>Usi mlelwa wa mwaluko na Busi mng'holoze na Kemueli mhaza wa Alamu <verse eid="GEN 22:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 22:22"/>na Kesedi na Haso na Pilidashi na Yidilafu na Betueli. <verse eid="GEN 22:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 22:23"/>Betueli nakamponda Lebeka. Milika nakampondela Naholi, mng'holoze Abulahamu, wana awo nane. <verse eid="GEN 22:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 22:24"/>Kulawila aho, Leuma mha wa Naholi nayawele kota mchewake, kahi nakampondela wana, Teba na Gahamu na Tahashi na Maaka.<verse eid="GEN 22:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="GEN 23"/>
  <para style="s">Kubagama kwa Sala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 23:1"/>Sala nakekala miyaka miya imwe na makumi meli na saba. <verse eid="GEN 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 23:2"/>Nakabagama ako Kiliati-aliba, ako Hebuloni kuli isi ya Kanaani. Abulahamu nakalombocheza na kumditila matanga mchewake Sala. <verse eid="GEN 23:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 23:3"/>Abulahamu nakauleka mtufi wa mchewake, nakalawa kuluta kulongasa na Wahiti, nakawalonjela, <verse eid="GEN 23:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 23:4"/>“Heni ndangikala kota mjenzi hali hemwe. Mnguzile honhu ha kubawa chilaga leka nditile mtufi wa mchewangu na wanhu wa heni wabagame hamba.” <verse eid="GEN 23:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 23:5"/>Wahiti nawamwidichila Abulahamu, <verse eid="GEN 23:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 23:6"/>“Ena mkulu wa hetwe, tuhulichize, hegwe kwa chilongozi uhaguligwe na Nguluwi hali hetwe. Umtile mchewako kuli chilaga choneche wihagulile, kuduhu yoneche yokulemeza chilaga kwa hetwe, na kukulemeza kutila mtufi wa mchewako na wanhu wa hegwe wabagame.” <verse eid="GEN 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 23:7"/>Aho Abulahamu nakema na kinamiza hamwando ha wanhu wa isi yila ya Wahiti, <verse eid="GEN 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 23:8"/>na kuwalonjela, “Wone mlingung'hundiza ndiutile mtufi wa mchewangu na wanhu wa heni wabagame, dedede mlandeni Efuloni mwana Sohali, kwa mbuli ya heni, <verse eid="GEN 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 23:9"/>yanguzile alila ipalika lyake lya Makipela liwele mmbaka mwa mgunda wa heye. Mumdedeze yanguzile ndilidite vilaga vya heni, yanguzile kwa sendi zakuhega namwe mlibaha.”<verse eid="GEN 23:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 23:10"/>Efuloni heye nayali bahala howawele Wahiti awo nawawele wating'hane hali lwizi lwa muji. Efuloni Mhiti, nakamwidichila Abulahamu, kumwando kwa Wahiti weng'ha. <verse eid="GEN 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 23:11"/>“Hebu mkulu, dedede unyhulichize. Ndangukupa mgunda weng'ha na ipalika liwele mumo, kahi ndangukupa hamwando ha Wahiti wayangu. Utile amo mtufi wa mchewako na wanhu wa hegwe wabagame.”<verse eid="GEN 23:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 23:12"/>Abulahamu nakenamiza kahi hamwando ha wanhu wa isi yila ya Wahiti, <verse eid="GEN 23:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 23:13"/>na kumlonjela Efuloni, leka wanhu weng'ha wahuliche, “Ndangukulanda, dedede unyhulichize. Ndolavya sendi za kuhega mgunda wa hegwe, na ndangukulanda ubochela sendi azo leka ndiutile amo mtufi wa mchewangu na wanhu wa hegwe wabagame.” <verse eid="GEN 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 23:14"/>Efuloni nakamwidichila Abulahamu, <verse eid="GEN 23:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 23:15"/>“Mkulu, unyhulichize, mgunda wanguguzigwa kwa migwala miya zine ndo chinhu chachi hali heni na hegwe? Utile mtufi wa mchewako na wanhu wa hegwe wabagame.” <verse eid="GEN 23:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 23:16"/>Abulahamu nakekundiza na Efuloni, nakampimila chasi cha sendi zoyalonjile hawele na Wahiti weng'ha, migwala miya zine, kota naviwele vipimilo vya wawele nguguza vinhu mhela awo.<verse eid="GEN 23:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 23:17"/>Lelo mgunda wa Efuloni nauwele ako Makipela, kolilawilaga isanya mwa Mamle, ipalika na migodi jeng'ha hamwe na honhu heng'ha, liwa lya heye, <verse eid="GEN 23:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 23:18"/>Abulahamu hamwando ha Wahiti weng'ha naweting'hane mlwizi lwa muji. <verse eid="GEN 23:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 23:19"/>Kulawila aho, Abulahamu nakamtila Sala mchewake kuli ipalika alyo naloliwele kuli mgunda wa Makipela, kolilawilaga isanya mwa Mamle, Hebuloni kuli isi ya Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 23:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 23:20"/>Mgunda na ipalika liwele amo nalitawizwa na Wahiti liwe lyake Abulahamu yawatile amo wanhu wa heye wabagame.<verse eid="GEN 23:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="GEN 24"/>
  <para style="s">Isaka kanguhesa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 24:1"/>Abulahamu lelo nayali yalalile yawele na miyaka minji, na heye Mkulu Nguluwi nakamtambichiza kwa chila mbuli. <verse eid="GEN 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 24:2"/>Zuwa limwe Abulahamu nakamlonjela chitumagwa wa heye yawele yalalile kusinda weng'ha na mwamizi wa lufufu lwake lweng'ha, “Dedede uwiche moko ga hegwe hasi ha mahaza ga heni, kulajila kota kwangilaha <verse eid="GEN 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 24:3"/>nani ndokulahiza kwa Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa kilanga na isi, kota hambe humgalile mwana wa heni mdala yoneche hali wadala wa Wakanaani wondilingikala nawo. <verse eid="GEN 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 24:4"/>Ndilahile kota koluta mbaka kuli isi ya heni, kwa ivyazi lyangu, ukampalile mdala kwa mwana wa heni Isaka.” <verse eid="GEN 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 24:5"/>Chitumagwa nakamlonjela, “Hanji mdala ayo kolema kilongoza na heni kuya akuno, wone iwe ahyo, ndaze, ingana ndimhiluse mwanago kuli isi koulawile?” <verse eid="GEN 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 24:6"/>Abulahamu nakamlonjela, “Hebu! Wilolele ng'hatu uleche kumhilusa mwana wa heni ako. <verse eid="GEN 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 24:7"/>Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa kilanga, yandavile kaye kwa mhaza wa heni na kulawa kuli isi yomvumbuche, na yalingulonga na heni, nakandilahila kota kowapa walelwa wa heni isi ayi. Heye komlajiza mhilisi wa heye kumwando mwa hegwe leka umigalile mdala mwana wa heni kulawa ako. <verse eid="GEN 24:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 24:8"/>Wone mdala ayo kolema kiwinza na hegwe mbaka kuno, lelo chilaho cha heni, hachikubata hebu, ila kwa vyeng'ha vila, uleche kumhilusa mwana wa heni ako”. <verse eid="GEN 24:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 24:9"/>Lelo chitumagwa ayo nakawika moko wa heye hasi ha mahaza ga Abulahamu, mkulu wa heye, nakilaha kwa mbuli ayo.<verse eid="GEN 24:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 24:10"/>Hamba, ayo chitumagwa nakahola ngamiya kumi wa mkulu wa heye na kuka yawele na ndolendole zinojile za vinjivinji. Kenula majendo kuluta kuli muji loyekale Naholi, kuli isi ya Mesopotamiya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:10 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mesopotamiya </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kwa Chiebulaniya yanguzeleka kota Alamu Nahalaimu.</char></note>. <verse eid="GEN 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 24:11"/>Loyafichile, nakawafugamiza ngamiya wa heye hafungo mwa izimbo liwele hafungo mwa muji. Nayali matinazo mhela uwele wadala nawalutaga kudeha mazi kuli izimbo. <verse eid="GEN 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 24:12"/>Na heye nakalanda, “Hegwe Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa mkulu wa heni Abulahamu, ndangukulanda sumye, na umditile igano lya kwimilila mkulu wa heni Abulahamu. <verse eid="GEN 24:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 24:13"/>Nda ahano hafungo mwa nzasa hawele wahinza wa wenyeng'haye wa muji huyaga kudeha mazi. <verse eid="GEN 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 24:14"/>Lelo mhinza yondimlonjela, yenenule chiya cha heye cha mazi yangalile mazi nyinwe, na heye nakangalila hamwe na kuwanweza ngamiya wa heni, na yawe ndo youmuhagulile chitumagwa wa hegwe Isaka. Mbuli ayo yondajila kota kumditila igano lya kwimilila mkulu wa heni.”<verse eid="GEN 24:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 24:15"/>Naloyang'hali kusinda kulanda, baho du Lebeka, mhinza wa Betueli, mwanage Milika, mchewake Naholi, mng'holoze Abulahamu, nakafika yaholile chiya cha heye mmayega. <verse eid="GEN 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 24:16"/>Mhinza ayo nakanoga lukami nayali na kumeho kunojile ng'hatu, na chigoli hanating'hana na mlume yoneche. Lelo nakedulisa minzasa, na kudeha mazi na chiya lochimemile, nakakwina na kuka. <verse eid="GEN 24:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 24:17"/>Ndo yula chitumagwa nakaluta himahima kuza ting'hana na heye, na kumlonjela, “Dedede, ndangulanda mazi ga kunwa kulawa mchiya cha hegwe.” <verse eid="GEN 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 24:18"/>Mhinza nakamwidichila, “Goya ung'we mkulu wa heni.” Na baho nakanenula chiya cha heye, na kibatilila leka yamnweze. <verse eid="GEN 24:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 24:19"/>Loyampele mazi, nakamlonjela, “Ndowawichila mazi na ngamiya wa hegwe nawo, wanwe mbaka ng'halu imale.” <verse eid="GEN 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 24:20"/>Lelo nakadita himahima, na kuwajidila ngamiya mazi ga chiya cha heye mibato, na kubilimila kuli izimbo kudeha mazi ganji na kuwanweza ngamiya wa heye weng'ha. <verse eid="GEN 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 24:21"/>Yula chitumagwa nayali yomlola ne kulonga chinhu, yavizele kota Mkulu Nguluwi nakatambichiza majendo ga heye ama hebu.<verse eid="GEN 24:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 24:22"/>Ngamiya lowanwele mazi, yula munhu nakamvaliza yula mhinza pete ndodo ya dhahabu ya kuvala mmenyhelo iwele na itunyo lya gilamu sita na banjili mbili za dhahabu ziwele na gilamu miya imwe na makumi meli chila imwe. <verse eid="GEN 24:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 24:23"/>Nakamuuza, “Dedede undonjele, hegwe kwa mhinza wa whaani? Ndaze, hana honhu ha kuwasa hakaye ha mhaza wa hegwe?” <verse eid="GEN 24:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 24:24"/>Lebeka nakedichila, “Heni nda mhinza wa Betueli, mwana Milika, mchewake Naholi. <verse eid="GEN 24:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 24:25"/>Kwa hetwe kuna misolo na honhu ha kudimila hakulu na honhu ha kuhega kuwasa wajenzi.” <verse eid="GEN 24:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 24:26"/>Ndo yula munhu nakenamiza mutwi wa heye, na kumfugamila Mkulu Nguluwi, <verse eid="GEN 24:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 24:27"/>yolonga, “Yatogoligwe Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa mkulu wa heni Abulahamu, yawele hambe yasemwe igano lya kwimilila na makundo ga heye kwa mkulu wa heni. Mkulu Nguluwi kandongoza heni ndute mbaka kwa ivyazi lya mkulu wa heni!”<verse eid="GEN 24:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 24:28"/>Hamba yula mdala nakabilima kuza kuwalonjela mbuli yila ivyazi lya mayake. <verse eid="GEN 24:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 24:29"/>Lebeka nayali na mkulugwe yalinguchemigwa Labani. Labani nakalawa yobilima kuza ting'hana na yula munhu kuli nzasa. <verse eid="GEN 24:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 24:30"/>Labani nayali yaiwene ila pete na banjili mmoko mwa lumbulye na kuhulika mbuli Lebeka nazoyalonjelwe na ayo munhu. Labani nakamfika ayo munhu yemile behi na ngamiya wa heye hafungo mwa nzasa. <verse eid="GEN 24:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 24:31"/>Labani nakamlonjela, “Uye haluga hetu hegwe utambichizwe na Mkulu Nguluwi. Ndaze kwangwima kunze? Heni mina mbika goya ng'handa na honhu kwa mbuli ya awa ngamiya wa hegwe.” <verse eid="GEN 24:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 24:32"/>Lelo chitumagwa ayo wa Abulahamu nakenjila mng'handa. Labani nakawachumula ngamiya na kuwagalila misolo, nakamgalila heye na wanhu wa heye mazi ga kuhovujila magulu. <verse eid="GEN 24:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 24:33"/>Ndiya loipile, yula munhu nakalonga, “Silya mbaka londilonga nachonganile kulonga.” Labani nakamlonjela, “Lelo utulonjele.”<verse eid="GEN 24:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 24:34"/>Yula munhu nakalonga, “Heni nda chitumagwa wa Abulahamu. <verse eid="GEN 24:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 24:35"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nakamtambichiza ng'hatu mkulu wa heni, na heye kawa munhu yawele na lufufu. Nakamgalila vilundo vya ming'holo na vilundo vya migongolo jinji jilingudimigwa minji na sendi na zahabu na vitumagwa wadala na walume na ngamiya na midogowi. <verse eid="GEN 24:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 24:36"/>Sala, mchewake mkulu wa heni kuli ulalilo weng'ha ula, nakampondela mkulu wa heni mwana, na mkulu wa heni nakamha ayo mwana lufufu lwake lweng'ha. <verse eid="GEN 24:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 24:37"/>Mkulu wa heni nakandita ndilahe yolonga, ‘Humholela mwana wa heni mhinza yoneche kuli wahinza wa Wakanaani ndilingikala kuli isi ya hewo. <verse eid="GEN 24:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 24:38"/>Ila koluta kuli isi ya heni, kwa wang'holozangu, leka ukampalile mdala mwana wa heni Isaka.’ <verse eid="GEN 24:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 24:39"/>Na heni nandimlonjela mkulu wa heni, ‘Hanji mdala ayo kolema kilongoza na heni kuya kuno.’ <verse eid="GEN 24:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 24:40"/>Ila heye nakalonga, ‘Gwaa Mkulu Nguluwi yalingundongoza mli ukomu wa heni, komlajiza mhilisi wa heye yalute hamwe nagwe na kukudita usumye kuli majendo ga hegwe, nagwe kumholela mwana wa heni mdala kulawa kwa ivyazi lyangu na ng'handa ya mhaza wa heni. <verse eid="GEN 24:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 24:41"/>Wone houfika kwa ivyazi lyangu na hawokupa ayo mhinza, lelo huchibatigwa hebu na kilaha kwa heni.’<verse eid="GEN 24:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 24:42"/>“Lehano lofichile kuli nzasa, nandanda, ‘Gwaa Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa mkulu wa heni Abulahamu, ndangulanda usumye goya lehano kuli majendo ga heni. <verse eid="GEN 24:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 24:43"/>Nda ahano hafungo mwa nzasa. Mhinza yokuya kudeha mazi ndo yondimlanda yangalile mazi mado ga kunwa kulawa mchiya cha heye, <verse eid="GEN 24:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 24:44"/>na heye nakanjidila na kuwadehela mazi ngamiya wa heni, lelo ayo na ndo yahaguligwe na Mkulu Nguluwi yawe mdala wa mwana wa mkulu wa heni.’<verse eid="GEN 24:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 24:45"/>“Londing'hali sinda kulanda mnhumbula ya heni, baho du Lebeka nakafika na chiya cha heye cha mazi mmayega, nakidulisa kuli nzasa na kudeha mazi. Na heni nandimlonjela, ‘Dedede ndangulanda mazi ga kunwa.’ <verse eid="GEN 24:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 24:46"/>Na heye nakenenula chiya himahima kulawa mmayega mwa heye, na kulonga, ‘Lelo unwe mkulu wa heni. Nandowawichila mazi na ngamiya wa hegwe kahi.’ Lelo heni nyinwa na ngamiya wa heni nawo nakawapa mazi. <verse eid="GEN 24:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 24:47"/>Ndo nambuza, ‘Ndaze, hegwe kwa mhinza wa whaani?’ Nakandonjela, ‘Heni nda mhinza wa Betueli, mwana Milika, mchewake Naholi.’ Aho ndo hondimpele pete ndodo ya kuwika mmenyhelo na kumvaliza banjili mmoko. <verse eid="GEN 24:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 24:48"/>Hamba nandimfugamila na kumtogola Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa mkulu wa heni Abulahamu, yawele yondongoza kwa nzila igoloche mbaka kwa mhinza wa lukolo lwa mkulu wa heni kwa mbuli ya mwanage. <verse eid="GEN 24:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 24:49"/>Lelo mndonjele kota mkunda kumditila igano lya kwimilila na makundo kwa mkulu wa heni, wone hebu, lelo mlonje, nani ndovizela cha kudita.”<verse eid="GEN 24:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 24:50"/>Loyahuliche ago, Labani na Betueli nawamwidichila, “Mbuli ayi nailawa kwa Mkulu Nguluwi, hetwe hatuweza kulonga choneche. <verse eid="GEN 24:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 24:51"/>Lebeka ayu baha, umhole ulute. Na yawe mdala wa mwana wa mkulu wa hegwe kota Mkulu Nguluwi navyoyalonjile.” <verse eid="GEN 24:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 24:52"/>Chitumagwa wa Abulahamu loyahuliche ulonzi awo, nakamwinamila Mkulu Nguluwi. <verse eid="GEN 24:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 24:53"/>Hamba nakalavya vinhu vilingupulika na zahabu na nguwo, nakamha Lebeka. Kahi nakawapa wakulugwe na mayake Lebeka vinoliga vya sendi nyinji.<verse eid="GEN 24:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 24:54"/>Chitumagwa wa Abulahamu na wanhu woyoyile nawo walya na kunwa na kuwasa kuko. Lowalilimche mitondo, chitumagwa yula nakalonga, “Ndangulanda kuhiluka kwa mkulu wa heni.” <verse eid="GEN 24:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 24:55"/>Ila mkulugwe na mayake Lebeka nawalonga, “Umleche mhinza yekale na hetwe mhela udo hela, kota mazuwa kumi hino, hamba koluta.” <verse eid="GEN 24:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="GEN 24:56"/>Ila heye nakalonga, “Dedede, mleche kung'hawiza, kwa vila Mkulu Nguluwi mina kagadita goya majendo ga heni, ndangulanda mng'hundize nyhiluche kwa mkulu wa heni.”<verse eid="GEN 24:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="GEN 24:57"/>Na hewo wedichila, “Lelo tumcheme mhinza tumuuze.” <verse eid="GEN 24:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="GEN 24:58"/>Nawamchema Lebeka na kumuuza, “Ndaze, koluta na munhu ayu?” Na heye nakedichila, “Ndoluta.” <verse eid="GEN 24:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="GEN 24:59"/>Lelo nawamleka Lebeka yalute na chitumagwa wa Abulahamu na wanhu wa heye. Chitumagwa mdala yamhembulize lumbulye Lebeka kulawila yavumbuche naye nakalutasa na heye. <verse eid="GEN 24:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="GEN 24:60"/>Lelo nawamtambichiza Lebeka wolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 24:60">“Hegwe lumbuliyetu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 24:60">Uwe mamo wa maelufu kwa maelufu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 24:60">walelwa wa hegwe waihalile miji ja wang'honyo wa hewo.”<verse eid="GEN 24:60"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="GEN 24:61"/>Hamba Lebeka na vitumagwa wadala wa heye nawakwina ngamiya na kumuwinza chitumagwa ayo wa Abulahamu, na hewo weng'ha woka.<verse eid="GEN 24:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="GEN 24:62"/>Mhela awo, Isaka nayali yochile Beeli-lahai-loi, nakawa yochikala ako nzingo ya Negebu. <verse eid="GEN 24:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="GEN 24:63"/>Zuwa limwe matinazo, Isaka nakaluta kumgunda kijesa. Lelo nakalola nakona ngamiya wanguya. <verse eid="GEN 24:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="GEN 24:64"/>Na heye Lebeka loyalolile na kumona Isaka, nakedulika kulawa kuli ngamiya, <verse eid="GEN 24:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="GEN 24:65"/>na kumuuza chitumagwa wa Abulahamu, “Ka whaani yula yalingujenda kula kumgunda, kanguya kutubochela?” Yula chitumagwa nakalonga, “Ka mkulu wa heni.” Lelo Lebeka nakahola igubiko lyake na kigubika kumeho. <verse eid="GEN 24:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="GEN 24:66"/>Yula chitumagwa nakamsimila Isaka geng'ha goyagaditile. <verse eid="GEN 24:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="GEN 24:67"/>Lelo Isaka nakamhola Lebeka mng'handa mwa chibumuli cha Sala mayake, kawa mchewake. Isaka nakamgana Lebeka kwa kumhembuliza loyabagame mayake.<verse eid="GEN 24:67"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="GEN 25"/>
  <para style="s">Walelwa wanji wa Abulahamu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 1:32-33">1 Mihela 1:32-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 25:1"/>Abulahamu namkahola mdala yunji, itagwa lyake lyali Ketula. <verse eid="GEN 25:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 25:2"/>Ketula nakampondela Abulahamu wana awa, Simulani na Yokishani na Medani na Midiani na Ishibaki na Shua. <verse eid="GEN 25:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 25:3"/>Yokishani nayali mhaza wa Sheba na Dedani, na walelwa wa Dedani wali Ashulu na Aletushi na Aleumi. <verse eid="GEN 25:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 25:4"/>Wana wa Midiani wali Efa na Efeli na Enoki na Abida na Elidaa. Weng'ha awo wali walelwa wa Ketula.<verse eid="GEN 25:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 25:5"/>Abulahamu nakamhaliza Isaka lufufu lwake lweng'ha. <verse eid="GEN 25:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 25:6"/>Ila wana wa wahawake wanji wa Abulahamu nakawapa ndolendole, na mhela loyali yang'hali mkomu, nakawahilika kuli isi ya kolilawilaga isanya, kutali na mwanage Isaka.<verse eid="GEN 25:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kubagama kwa Abulahamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 25:7"/>Abulahamu nakekala miyaka miya imwe makumi saba na jihano. <verse eid="GEN 25:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 25:8"/>Abulahamu nakabagama naloyekale kwa mihela minji lukami na ja kuhega, nakaza kilumba na wasekulu wa heye wamlongole. <verse eid="GEN 25:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 25:9"/>Isaka na Ishimaeli, wanage Abulahamu, wamtila mhaza wa hewo kuli ipalika lya Makipela, behi na Mamle kuli mgunda nauwele wa Efuloni, mwana wa Sohali Mhiti. <verse eid="GEN 25:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 25:10"/>Abulahamu nayali yagulile mgunda awo kwa Wahiti, kuko du ndo kowatiligwe Abulahamu na mdala wa heye Sala. <verse eid="GEN 25:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 25:11"/>Loyabagame Abulahamu, Nguluwi nakamtambichiza Isaka mwanage. Na heye Isaka kawa yochikala behi na nzasa ya Beeli-lahai-loi.<verse eid="GEN 25:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Walelwa wa Ishimaeli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 1:28-31">1 Mihela 1:28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 25:12"/>Ayi ndo mbuli ya walelwa wa Ishimaeli mwanage Abulahamu yapondigwe na Hagali Mmisili nayawele chitumagwa mdala wa Sala. <verse eid="GEN 25:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 25:13"/>Aga ndo matagwa gawo kota vyowapondigwe, Nebayoti mlelwa wa mwaluko, na wanji ndo Kedali na Adibeli na Mibisamu <verse eid="GEN 25:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 25:14"/>na Mishima na Duma na Masa <verse eid="GEN 25:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 25:15"/>na Hadadi na Tema na Yetuli na Nafishi na Kadema. <verse eid="GEN 25:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 25:16"/>Awo ndo wana wa Ishimaeli, nawawele vilongozi wa nhanzi kumi na mbili, howali kikala na vijiji vya hewo navizeleka kwa matagwa gawo. <verse eid="GEN 25:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 25:17"/>Ishimaeli nayali na miyaka miya imwe makumi gadatu na saba nakabagama, nakaza kilumba na wasekulu wa heye wamlongole. <verse eid="GEN 25:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 25:18"/>Walelwa wa Ishimaeli nawekala kuli honhu hawele hagati ha Havila na Shuli, behi na Misili, kulutilila Ashulu. Nawekala wehilwe na ivyazi linji lya Abulahamu.<verse eid="GEN 25:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kupondigwa kwa Esau na Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 25:19"/>Ayi ndo mbuli ya walelwa wa Isaka mwana wa Abulahamu. <verse eid="GEN 25:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 25:20"/>Isaka naloyawele na miyaka makumi gane, nakamhola Lebeka mhinza wa Betueli, Mwalamu wa Padani-alamu. Lebeka nayali lumbulye Labani. <verse eid="GEN 25:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 25:21"/>Lebeka nayali mhende, lelo Isaka nakamlanda Mkulu Nguluwi. Na heye Mkulu Nguluwi nakakunda kulanda kwa heye, Lebeka nakawa na himila. <verse eid="GEN 25:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 25:22"/>Himila ayo nayali ya wanyambili. Wana awo nawali wochilewa mmunda mwa Lebeka, na heye nakalonga, “Wone hino ndo vyozili mbuli azi, ya choni kuwa mkomu?” Lelo nakaluta kumuuza Mkulu Nguluwi. <verse eid="GEN 25:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 25:23"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlonjela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 25:23">“Wanhu wa nhanzi mbili za mmunda mwa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 25:23">nhanzi mbili zopondigwa na hegwe, zochibagula.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 25:23">Imwe yowa na ludali kusinda yinji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 25:23">mkulugwe kowa chitumagwa wa mdodowe.”<verse eid="GEN 25:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 25:24"/>Mazuwa ga kuponda logafichile, Lebeka nakaponda wanyambili. <verse eid="GEN 25:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 25:25"/>Wa mwaluko nayali mdung'hu lukuli lweng'ha kota ikoti idung'hu ligongomanyigwe kwa milaika ja migongolo, ahyo nawamchema Esau. <verse eid="GEN 25:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 25:26"/>Wa keli nakapondigwa yamibate Esau chisigino, ahyo nawamha itagwa lya Yakobo. Isaka nayali yawele na miyaka makumi sita mhela Esau na Yakobo lowapondigwe.<verse eid="GEN 25:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Esau kanguguza hachi ya heye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 25:27"/>Wana awo nawakula, Esau kawa mpelembi ng'hatu, yaganile kikala kisolo, na Yakobo nakawa munhu yaholile na yawele ngugana kikala haluga. <verse eid="GEN 25:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 25:28"/>Lelo Isaka nakamgana Esau kwa vila yaliyogana kulya upelembi wa heye woyali yochigala, ila Lebeka nakamgana Yakobo.<verse eid="GEN 25:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 25:29"/>Zuwa limwe, Yakobo loyawele yoteleka chilyo, Esau nakahiluka haluga kulawa kuupelembi yawele na nzala lukami. <verse eid="GEN 25:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 25:30"/>Ahyo Esau nakamlonjela Yakobo, “Ndangubagama na nzala, dedede, umhe muhuzi awo udung'hu nyinwe, mina nhoka.” Ahyo Esau nakachemigwa Edomu izeleche kota ndung'hu. <verse eid="GEN 25:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 25:31"/>Yakobo nakedichila, “Tandi unguzile honhu ha uhalizi wa hegwe wa ulelwa wa hegwe wa mwaluko.” <verse eid="GEN 25:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 25:32"/>Esau nakalonga, “Goya! Ndahabehi kubagama, hachi ya heni ya ulelwa wa mwaluko yonhanza choni?” <verse eid="GEN 25:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 25:33"/>Yakobo nakamlonjela, “Wilahe tandi.” Aho Esau nakelaha na kumguzila Yakobo honhu ha uhalizi wa ulelwa wa mwaluko. <verse eid="GEN 25:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 25:34"/>Ndo Yakobo nakamha Esau ibumunda na muhuzi wa mpanda. Esau nakalya na kanwa, hamba koka, kaluta nakoyalawile. Ahyo ndo Esau navyoyaibezile hachi ya heye ya ulelwa wa mwaluko.<verse eid="GEN 25:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="GEN 26"/>
  <para style="s">Isaka kanguhamila Gelali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 26:1"/>Hamba nailawila nzala muisi yila, nzala ilivinji na aho katali mhela wa ukomu wa Abulahamu. Isaka nakaluta Gelali kwa Abimeleki mndewa wa Wafilisti. <verse eid="GEN 26:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 26:2"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlawila Isaka na kumlonjela, “Uleche kuluta Misili, ila wikale kuli isi yondikulonjela. <verse eid="GEN 26:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 26:3"/>Wikale kuujenzi kuli isi ayo, na heni ndowa hamwe na hegwe na kukutambichiza. Ndokwimilila ilagano nalondimpele mhaza wa hegwe Abulahamu, ahyo ndokupa hegwe na lulelo lwako isi azi zeng'ha. <verse eid="GEN 26:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 26:4"/>Ndokonjezela lulelo lwako luwe kota nhondwe za kilanga na kuwapa isi azi zeng'ha. Kwa kukolela lulelo lwako, wanhu wa isi zeng'ha muisi wotambichizwa. <verse eid="GEN 26:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 26:5"/>Kwa vila Abulahamu nakanyhulichiza heni, nakakunda mizilo ja heni na malajizo ga heni na malanguso ga heni na utaguso wa heni.”<verse eid="GEN 26:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 26:6"/>Lelo Isaka nakekala ako Gelali. <verse eid="GEN 26:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 26:7"/>Wanhu wa ako nalowamuuzile mbuli za mchewake, heye nakedichila, “Ayu ka lumbulyangu.” Nakadumba kulonga kota kamchewake kwa kudumba kota wanhu wa isi yila wahamkopole kwa chiwalo cha Lebeka, mina Lebeka nakanoga lukami. <verse eid="GEN 26:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 26:8"/>Naloyekale ako kwa miyaka minji, Abimeleki mndewa wa Wafilisti nakasunjilila mitubuli nakamona Isaka yomkumbatila mchewake Lebeka. <verse eid="GEN 26:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 26:9"/>Abimeleki nakamchema Isaka na kumlonjela, “Hambi ayu kamchewako. Lekachoni nakulonga kalumbulyo?” Isaka nakedichila, “Kwa vila nandumba kota ndahakopoligwe kwa chiwalo cha heye.”<verse eid="GEN 26:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 26:10"/>Abimeleki nakamuuza, “Ndo mbuli yachi youtuditile? Yumwe wa wanhu wa heni yahawasile na mchewako, ndangijesa nagwe wahatwambuze kudita gehile.” <verse eid="GEN 26:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 26:11"/>Ndo baho Abimeleki nakawalonjela wanhu weng'ha yolonga, “Yoneche yomdoliza munhu ayu ama mchewake, ndangukomya kokopoligwa.”<verse eid="GEN 26:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 26:12"/>Mhela awo Isaka nakanyala nyhadikwa kuli isi yila, nakabeta vya kuhega ng'hatu, mina Mkulu Nguluwi nakamtambichiza, <verse eid="GEN 26:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 26:13"/>na heye nakawa munhu yawele na lufufu. Nakalutilila kuwa na lufufu mbaka kawa yawele na lufufu ng'hatu. <verse eid="GEN 26:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 26:14"/>Kwa vila nayali yawele na chilundo cha ming'holo na misenga na vitumagwa wenji, Wafilisti nawamonela fihi. <verse eid="GEN 26:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 26:15"/>Wafilisti wali watilile mizimbo jeng'ha ja mazi jila vitumagwa wa Abulahamu, mhaza wa heye, nawabawile mhela naloyang'hali mkomu. <verse eid="GEN 26:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 26:16"/>Ndo baho Abimeleki nakamlonjela Isaka, “Uche hetu, kwa vila hegwe kuna ludali luhejile kusinda hetwe.”<verse eid="GEN 26:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 26:17"/>Lelo Isaka nakoka ako, nakazenga kambi kuli ibindi lya Gelali, nakekala ako. <verse eid="GEN 26:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 26:18"/>Isaka nakadikula jila mizimbo najibawigwe na mhaza wa heye Abulahamu naloyawele yang'hali mkomu, mizimbo jila Wafilisti nawatilile mhela Abulahamu naloyabagame. Nakajipa matagwa gagala nayajipele mhaza wa heye. <verse eid="GEN 26:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 26:19"/>Ila vitumagwa wa Isaka nalowabawile kuli ibindi, nawaifika nzasa ilingulavya mazi, <verse eid="GEN 26:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 26:20"/>wadimi wa aho Gelali nawelewa na wadimi wa Isaka wolonga, “Mazi aga ndo ga hetwe.” Ahyo Isaka nakalichema izimbo alyo Eseki. Izeleche kilewa. <verse eid="GEN 26:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 26:21"/>Hamba nawabawa izimbo linji, nalyo kahi nawelewela, ahyo Isaka nakalichema izimbo alyo Sitina. Izeleche kota ung'honyo. <verse eid="GEN 26:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 26:22"/>Hamba Isaka nakaluta honhu hanji na kubawa izimbo linji. Ila alyo nahawalewele, ahyo Isaka nakalichema Lehoboti yolonga, “Lelo Mkulu Nguluwi katulechela honhu, natwe tokonjezeka kuli isi ayi.”<verse eid="GEN 26:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 26:23"/>Kulawa ako, Isaka nakaluta Beeli-sheba. <verse eid="GEN 26:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 26:24"/>Nechilo yiyo Mkulu Nguluwi nakalawila na kumlonjela, “Heni nda Nguluwi wa mhaza wa hegwe Abulahamu. Uleche kudumba kwa vila nda hamwe na hegwe, ndokutambichiza na kukonjezela lulelo lwako kwa mbuli ya Abulahamu, chitumagwa wa heni.” <verse eid="GEN 26:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 26:25"/>Ahyo Isaka nakazenga honhu ha kulavila nhambiko ako na nakamfugamila Mkulu Nguluwi nakachimika ihema na kwesela kwa mhela udo ako, na vitumagwa wa heye nawabawa izimbo.<verse eid="GEN 26:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isaka na Abimeleki wangiyamba moko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 26:26"/>Abimeleki nakalawa Gelali yawele hamwe na Ahusati munhu wa heye wa habehi ng'hatu, na Fikoli mkulu wa wamizi, nakamlutila Isaka. <verse eid="GEN 26:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 26:27"/>Isaka nakawauza, “Lekachoni muya kwa heni, hanga mlingunzudila na mmbinga kwa hemwe?” <verse eid="GEN 26:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 26:28"/>Hewo nawamwidichila, “Natona hazelu kota Mkulu Nguluwi kahamwe na hegwe. Ahyo natikundiza yangugana tuwiche chilaho hamwe na hegwe na kuwika ilagano, <verse eid="GEN 26:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 26:29"/>kota hotudumya, hetwe hihyo hotukudumya. Natukuditila ganojile, natukuleka ulute goya, ne kukuditila chinhu choneche chihile. Na sambi hegwe kwa mtambichizwa wa Mkulu Nguluwi.” <verse eid="GEN 26:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 26:30"/>Lelo Isaka nakawawichila chilyo cha mnvina, nawo walya na kunwa. <verse eid="GEN 26:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 26:31"/>Mitondo, nawalilimka ng'hanu hananya na kilaha. Hamba Isaka nakawasindichiza na kilaga nawo goya. <verse eid="GEN 26:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 26:32"/>Zuwa lilila vitumagwa wa Isaka nawamuyila na kumlonjela mbuli ya lila izimbo nalowali wabawile, wolonga, “Tugafika mazi.” <verse eid="GEN 26:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 26:33"/>Lelo Isaka nakalichema izimbo ali Shiba, kwa vila itagwa lya muji awo ndo Beeli-sheba mbaka lehano.<verse eid="GEN 26:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wadala wa Esau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 26:34"/>Esau naloyali na miyaka makumi gane, nakahesa wadala weli Wahiti, Yuditi mhinza wa Beeli, na Basemati mhinza wa Eloni. <verse eid="GEN 26:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 26:35"/>Wadala awo nawawadita Isaka na Lebeka wekale kwa usungu.<verse eid="GEN 26:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="GEN 27"/>
  <para style="s">Isaka kangumtambichiza Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 27:1"/>Isaka nakalala lukami na meho gali hambe galole. Lelo nakamchema Esau mwanage mkulu, nakamlonjela, “Mwana wa heni.” Na heye nakedichila, “Ena mhaza, ndanguhulichiza.” <verse eid="GEN 27:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 27:2"/>Isaka nakalonga, “Ulole, heni ndala lukami, ne zuwa lya kubagama siizelele. <verse eid="GEN 27:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 27:3"/>Lelo uhole misale na upinde wa hegwe, ulute kisolo kapelembe igongolo. <verse eid="GEN 27:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 27:4"/>Hamba unditile ndiya inonile, undigalile ndiye, nene baha ndikutambichize nding'hali kubagama.”<verse eid="GEN 27:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 27:5"/>Hambi, mhela awo Isaka naloyali yolongasa na mwanage Esau, Lebeka nayali yohulichiza. Ahyo, Esau naloyalutile kisolo kupelemba igongolo na kuligala, <verse eid="GEN 27:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 27:6"/>Lebeka nakamlonjela mwanage Yakobo, “Nandimhulika mhaza wa hegwe yomlonjela mkulugo Esau, <verse eid="GEN 27:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 27:7"/>yampelembile igongolo na yamditile chilyo chinonile ng'hatu, leka yalye, hamba yamtambichize hali Mkulu Nguluwi naloyang'hali kubagama. <verse eid="GEN 27:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 27:8"/>Lelo mwana wa heni, uhulichize ulonzi wa heni na uwinze kota vyondilikulajiza. <verse eid="GEN 27:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 27:9"/>Ulute hali chilundo cha mhene, ukengalile vinyehe vya mhene vili vinojile, ndimditile mhaza wa hegwe chilyo chinojile, chila choyogana. <verse eid="GEN 27:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 27:10"/>Hamba komhilichila mhaza wa hegwe yalye, leka yakutambichize loyang'hali kubagama.”<verse eid="GEN 27:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 27:11"/>Ila Yakobo nakamlonjela mayake Lebeka, “Ukumbuchile kota mkulu wangu Esau kamema milaika mlukuli, ila heni ndahela. <verse eid="GEN 27:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 27:12"/>Hanji mhaza kogana kwabasa mlukuli lwangu, nani ndokoneka kota ndangumhada, ahyo ndochigalila kipanjila honhu ha utambichizo.” <verse eid="GEN 27:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 27:13"/>Mayake nakamlonjela, “Kupanjilwa kwa hegwe na kuye kwa heni, mwana wa heni, hegwe udite vyondilikukulajiza. Ulute ukengalile avyo vinyehe.”<verse eid="GEN 27:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 27:14"/>Lelo Yakobo nakaluta, nakahola vila vinyehe na kimigalila mayake, na heye nakadita chilyo chinonile ng'hatu, chila nachoyaganile mhaza wa heye Isaka. <verse eid="GEN 27:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 27:15"/>Hamba Lebeka nakahola nguwo za Esau zinojile lukami, zoyawele nazo mwanage mkulu, nakumvaliza mwanage mdodo Yakobo. <verse eid="GEN 27:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 27:16"/>Kahi nakamvaliza migozi ja vila vinyehe mmoko na honhu hadechedeche msingo ya heye. <verse eid="GEN 27:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 27:17"/>Hamba Lebeka nakamha Yakobo chila chilyo chinonile na ibumunda nalyoyamditile.<verse eid="GEN 27:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 27:18"/>Lelo Yakobo nakenjila mng'handa mwa mhaza wa heye, na kumchema, “Mhaza” Na heye nakedichila, “Ena. Kwa whaani hegwe mwana wa heni?” <verse eid="GEN 27:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 27:19"/>Yakobo nakamwidichila mhaza wa heye, “Nda heni Esau, mlelwa wa hegwe wa mwaluko. Ndita kota vyoundajize. Dedede mhaza, wikale ulye upelembi wa heni leka unhambichize.” <verse eid="GEN 27:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 27:20"/>Ila Isaka nakamuuza, “Iwa ndaze kupelemba himahima hino, mwana wa heni?” Yakobo nakamwidichila, “Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa hegwe, nakandita sumye.”<verse eid="GEN 27:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 27:21"/>Ndo baho Isaka nakamlonjela Yakobo, “Lelo mwana wa heni uhejele behi ndikwabase leka ng'hunde kota hegwe kwa heye mwana wa heni Esau ama hebu.” <verse eid="GEN 27:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 27:22"/>Yakobo nakamhejelela mhaza wa heye Isaka, na heye nakamwabasa na kulonga, “Luzi ndo lwa Yakobo, ila moko ndo ga Esau.” <verse eid="GEN 27:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 27:23"/>Nahamzelele kwa vila moko ga heye gali na milaika minji kota ja Esau mkulugwe, ahyo nakewika goya kumtambichiza. <verse eid="GEN 27:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 27:24"/>Nakamuuza kahi, “Kwangukomya ng'hatu hegwe ndo kwa mwana wa heni Esau?” Na heye nakamwidichila, “Ena.” <verse eid="GEN 27:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 27:25"/>Mhaza wa heye nakalonga, “Ndigalile alyo liwunde ndiye upelembi wa hegwe, mwana wa heni, ndikutambichize.” Aho Yakobo nakamhilichila ndiya, naye nakalya, nakamhilichila divai kahi, nakanwa. <verse eid="GEN 27:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 27:26"/>Ndo mhaza wa heye Isaka, nakamlonjela, “Uhejele habehi mwana wa heni, unonele.” <verse eid="GEN 27:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 27:27"/>Lelo Yakobo nakamhejelela mhaza wa heye na kumnonela, na mhaza wa heye loyahuliche kunhunyhilila kwa mivalo ja heye, nakamtambichiza yolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:27">“Kunhunyhilila kwa mwana wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:27">ndo kota kunhunyhilila kwa mgunda woyautambichize Mkulu Nguluwi!<verse eid="GEN 27:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 27:28"/>Nguluwi yakujidile nhungwi ya kilanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:28">yakupe misanga jiwele na mboto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:28">nyhule na zabibu kwa winji.<verse eid="GEN 27:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 27:29"/>Nhanzi za wanhu ziwe chitumagwa kwa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:29">na wanhu wa isi wakinamizile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:29">Uwe chilongozi wa wang'holozo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:29">na lulelo lwa mayako lukinamizile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:29">Chila yokupanjila, nayapanjilwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:29">chila yokutambichiza, yatambichizwe!”<verse eid="GEN 27:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Esau kangulanda utambichizo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 27:30"/>Isaka loyasindile kumtambichiza Yakobo, na heye Yakobo loyali yokuka hela kumwando ha mhaza wa heye Isaka, Esau mkulugwe Yakobo, nakahiluka kulawa kuupelembi. <verse eid="GEN 27:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 27:31"/>Esau kahi nakadita chilyo chinonile, na kumhilichila mhaza wa heye, na kumlonjela, “Ena mhaza, winuche ulye upelembi wa heni mwanago, leka unhambichize” <verse eid="GEN 27:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 27:32"/>Isaka nakauza, “Hegwe kwa whaani?” Na heye nakamwidichila, “Nda heni mwanago Esau, mlelwa wa hegwe wa mwaluko.” <verse eid="GEN 27:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 27:33"/>Aho Isaka nakakakama lukami, nakalonga, “Ka whaani lelo yula yapelembile na kingalila upelembi, nani mina ndiya, kahi mina ndimtambichiza hegwe hunoya? Ena na kotambichizwa.”<verse eid="GEN 27:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 27:34"/>Esau loyahuliche ulonzi wa mhaza wa heye, nakaluka kulila kwa usungu. Hamba nakamlonjela mhaza wa heye, “Mhaza wa heni, dedede unhambichize na heni!” <verse eid="GEN 27:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 27:35"/>Ila Isaka nakalonga, “Mng'holozo nakoya chiuhadi, naye kahola utambichizo wa hegwe.” <verse eid="GEN 27:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 27:36"/>Esau nakalonga, “Ndo mina kanguchemigwa Yakobo. Kwa vila nakahola honhu hangu lwa keli. Mwaluko nakahola honhu hangu ha ulelwa wa mwaluko, na sambi kahola utambichizo wa heni.” Hamba nakamuuza mhaza wa heye, “Ndaze, hauponile utambichizo woneche ula?” <verse eid="GEN 27:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 27:37"/>Isaka nakamwidichila, “Mina ndimdita Yakobo yawe chilongozi wa hegwe, na ndimpa wang'holozo weng'ha wawe vitumagwa wa heye. Ndimpa nyhule na divai. Ndikuditile choni lelo hegwe mwana wa heni?” <verse eid="GEN 27:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 27:38"/>Esau nakamlonjela mhaza wa heye, “Mhaza, hambi kwanawo utambichizo umwe hela? Unhambichize na heni kahi, mhaza.” Aho Esau nakalila kwa lizi likulu. <verse eid="GEN 27:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 27:39"/>Ndo Isaka mhaza wa heye, nakamlonjela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:39">“Honhu hako ha kuchikala kowa kutali na ulongo uwele na mboto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:39">na kutali na nhungwi ya kilanga.<verse eid="GEN 27:39"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 27:40"/>Kochikala kwa kitowa ngondo kwa ipanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:40">na kowa chitumagwa wa mng'holozo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:40">ila lougana kumhinduka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:40">kowa kutali na ulongozi wa heye.”<verse eid="GEN 27:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 27:41"/>Esau baho nakamzudila Yakobo kwa chiwalo cha utambichizo nayapegwe na mhaza wa heye. Esau nakejesa, “Mazuwa ga kuwasiliza chililo cha mhaza gahabehi, mbuli ayo hoimala, baho hondimkopola mdodowangu Yakobo.” <verse eid="GEN 27:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 27:42"/>Ila Lebeka naloyavizelele nachoyogana kudita mwanage mkulu, nakamchema mwanage mdodo Yakobo, na kumlonjela, “Wilolele, mng'holozo Esau kangisangalaza kwa kiwika goya yogana yakukopole. <verse eid="GEN 27:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 27:43"/>Lelo mwana wa heni uhulichize ulonzi wa heni. Uche ubilimile kwa kalumbu Labani akula Halani. <verse eid="GEN 27:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 27:44"/>Wikale na heye kwa mhela udo, mbaka kuzudila kwa mng'holozo hokumala. <verse eid="GEN 27:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 27:45"/>Kuzudila kwa heye hokuhola, na heye hoyowa yasemwile goumditile, ndomlajiza munhu yakuhiluse. Lekachoni filigwe na hemwe mweng'ha weli zuwa imwe?”<verse eid="GEN 27:45"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yakobo kangulajizwa kwa Labani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 27:46"/>Lebeka nakamlonjela Isaka, “Heni nhoka kikala na awa wadala weli Wahiti wa Esau. Wone Yakobo yohesa yumwe wa wadala awa Wahiti, fola mbagame.”<verse eid="GEN 27:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="GEN 28"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 28:1"/>Ahyo Isaka nakamchema Yakobo, nakamtambichiza na kumlajiza yolonga, “Uleche kuhesa mdala yoneche Mkanaani. <verse eid="GEN 28:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 28:2"/>Ulute Padani-alamu, hakaye ha sekulu wa hegwe Betueli, kahole yumwe wa wala wahinza wa kolo wa hegwe Labani. <verse eid="GEN 28:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 28:3"/>Nguluwi yawele na mong'ho yakutambichize uwe na walelwa wenji na konjezeka, leka uwe nhanzi ya wanhu wenji. <verse eid="GEN 28:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 28:4"/>Leka yakutambichize hegwe hamwe na walelwa wa hegwe kota navyoyamtambichize Abulahamu, uihole isi youwelengikala kota mjenzi, isi yila Nguluwi yampele Abulahamu!” <verse eid="GEN 28:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 28:5"/>Lelo Isaka nakamlajiza Yakobo, na heye nakaluta Padani-alamu kwa Labani, mwana wa Betueli, Mwalamu. Labani kalumbu wa Lebeka na Lebeka ndo nayawele mayawo Yakobo na Esau.<verse eid="GEN 28:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Esau kanguhesa mche wa kadatu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 28:6"/>Esau nakavizela kota Isaka nakamtambichiza Yakobo na kumlajiza yalute yakahese ako Padani-alamu, na kota loyamtambichize, nakamlemeza yaleche kuhesa mdala Mkanaani. <verse eid="GEN 28:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 28:7"/>Nakavizela kahi kota Yakobo nayali yowahulichiza mayake na mhaza wa heye, nakaluta Padani-alamu. <verse eid="GEN 28:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 28:8"/>Lelo Esau nakavizela kota mhaza wa heye, hawaganile wadala wa Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 28:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 28:9"/>Ahyo, Esau nakaluta kwa Ishimaeli, mwana wa Abulahamu, nakaza konjeza mdala yunji kwa kumhesa Mahalati mhinza wa Ishimaeli, lumbulyake Nebayoti.<verse eid="GEN 28:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kulota kwa Yakobo kula Beteli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 28:10"/>Yakobo nakoka Beeli-sheba, nakaluta Halani. <verse eid="GEN 28:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 28:11"/>Loyafichile honhu hamwe, nakawasa baho kwa vila isanya nalyali lilutile. Nakahola iganga limwe lya honhu aho, nakawika hasi hali mutwi wa heye, nakawasa. <verse eid="GEN 28:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 28:12"/>Nakalota, na kuli kulota ako, nakona chikwinilo chimizwe muisi na kuduma kwa chikwinilo ufika mbaka kilanga. Wahilisi wa Nguluwi nawali wokwina na kidulika kuli chikwinilo acho. <verse eid="GEN 28:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 28:13"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nakema kuli chikwinilo acho, nakamlonjela, “Heni ndo Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa Abulahamu mhaza wa hegwe na Nguluwi wa Isaka. Isi youlinguwasila ndokupa hegwe na lulelo lwako. <verse eid="GEN 28:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 28:14"/>Lulelo lwako lowa lwinji kota sangalaza za muisi na wokwenela chila honhu, kolizibilaga isanya na kolilawilaga isanya na kasikazini na kusini. Kwa kukolela hegwe na lulelo lwako, lukolo lweng'ha muisi lotambichizwa. <verse eid="GEN 28:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 28:15"/>Heni nda hamwe na hegwe, ndokwamila koneche kouluta na kukuhilusa kuli isi ayi. Sikuleka mbaka hondigongomanya ilagano lyondikupele.” <verse eid="GEN 28:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 28:16"/>Ndo Yakobo nakalilimka muusinjizi nakalonga, “Ndangukomya Mkulu Nguluwi ka honhu aha, nani nasivizelele.” <verse eid="GEN 28:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 28:17"/>Yakobo nakadumba nakalonga, “Honhu aha hangudumbiza kota choni. Ne majesa aha ndo ng'handa ya Nguluwi na lwizi lwa kilanga.”<verse eid="GEN 28:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 28:18"/>Yakobo nakalilimka lufuku nakahola lila iganga nayaliwichile hasi ha mutwi, nakalimiza kota izengo na kulijidila mafuta. <verse eid="GEN 28:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 28:19"/>Nakahachema honhu aho Beteli, ila itagwa lya katali lya muji awo nalyali Lusu <verse eid="GEN 28:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 28:20"/>Hamba Yakobo nakelaha yolonga, “Wone hegwe Nguluwi kowa hamwe na heni, na kunyamila kuli majendo ga heni, umha chilyo na nguwo, <verse eid="GEN 28:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 28:21"/>leka nyiluche kaye goya, lelo hegwe Mkulu Nguluwi kowa ndo Nguluwi wa heni. <verse eid="GEN 28:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 28:22"/>Nalyo iganga ali lyonyimize aha kota izengo, lyowa ng'handa ya hegwe Nguluwi nani ndokupa honhu hamwe ha kumi ha vinhu vyeng'ha vyoumha.”<verse eid="GEN 28:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 28"/>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="GEN 29"/>
  <para style="s">Yakobo kangufika hakaye kwa Labani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 29:1"/>Yakobo nakalutilila na majendo ga heye, nakaluta kuli isi ya wanhu wa kolilingulawila isanya. <verse eid="GEN 29:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 29:2"/>Hamba nakona izimbo kuli chiwala, na hafungo hali izimbo alyo kwali na vilundo vidatu vya ming'holo jilingwesela. Ming'holo najali jing'wezwa mazi ga izimbo alyo ligubichigwe na iganga ikulu. <verse eid="GEN 29:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 29:3"/>Vilundo vyeng'ha hoviting'hana hala, wadimi nawoyaga na kulavya iganga alyo kwa kitanza leka wachumule izimbo alyo na kunweza mazi migongolo, hamba nawagubikaga kahi izimbo alyo kwa iganga lilyo. <verse eid="GEN 29:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 29:4"/>Yakobo nakawauza wadimi, “Wang'holozangu, mwangulawila kohi?” Nawamwidichila, “Twangulawila Halani.” <verse eid="GEN 29:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 29:5"/>Na heye nakawauza, “Ndaze, mumzela Labani mwana wa Naholi?” Nawamwidichila, “Twangumzela.” <verse eid="GEN 29:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 29:6"/>Nakalutilila kuwauza, “Ndaze, kalamka?” Na hewo nawamwidichila, “Kalamka, na mhinza wa heye Laheli yula kula kanguya na ming'holo ja heye!” <verse eid="GEN 29:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 29:7"/>Yakobo nakawalonjela, “Ndangona ing'hali nemisi, hauwa mhela wa kujikungajiza ming'holo hamwe. Lelo mjinweze mazi ming'holo, mlute mkajidime.” <verse eid="GEN 29:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 29:8"/>Hewo nawamwidichila, “Hatulingudita ahyo mbaka vilundo vyeng'ha hoviting'hana hamwe na iganga lilavigwa kuli izimbo, aho ndo tojinweza mazi ming'holo.”<verse eid="GEN 29:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 29:9"/>Yakobo loyawele yolonga na wala wadimi, Laheli nayawele mdimi nakafika na ming'holo ja mhaza wa heye. <verse eid="GEN 29:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 29:10"/>Yakobo loyamuwene Laheli, mhinza wa Labani, kalumbu wa mamo wa heye, na loyajiwene ming'holo ja Labani, kolo wa heye, nakaluta kulihejeza lila iganga liwele hala kuli izimbo, nakachinweza mazi chilundo cha ming'holo ja kolo wa heye Labani. <verse eid="GEN 29:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 29:11"/>Hamba Yakobo nakamnonela Laheli na kulila kwa kusangalala. <verse eid="GEN 29:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 29:12"/>Hamba Yakobo nakamlonjela Laheli, kota heye ka yumwe wa lukolo lwa mhaza wa heye, mwana wa Lebeka. Laheli nakabilima hakaye kumlonjela mhaza wa heye.<verse eid="GEN 29:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 29:13"/>Labani loyahuliche mbuli za Yakobo, mwana wa lumbulye, nakabilima kumbochela, na kamkumbatila nakamnonela na kumbochela hakaye ha heye. Yakobo nakamsimila Labani chila chinhu chilawile. <verse eid="GEN 29:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 29:14"/>Labani nakalonga, “Ndikomya, hegwe wa lukolo lwangu, danda imwe na heni!” Yakobo nakekala na heye kwa mhela wa mwezi umwe.<verse eid="GEN 29:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yakobo kanguhesa wahinza wa Labani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 29:15"/>Zuwa limwe Labani nakamlonjela Yakobo, “Hegwe wa lukolo lwangu, ila ayo yahela mana kota konditila mijito hihi hela. Ndonjele, kwangugana ndikulipe sendi zilinga?” <verse eid="GEN 29:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 29:16"/>Lelo Labani nayali na wahinza weli, mkulu yachemigwe Lea na mdodo yachemigwe Laheli. <verse eid="GEN 29:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 29:17"/>Lea nayali yanojile, ila Laheli nayali yanojile lukami. <verse eid="GEN 29:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 29:18"/>Yakobo nayali yomgana Laheli, ahyo nakamlonjela Labani, “Ndokukolela mijito kwa mhela wa miyaka saba leka ungalile mhinza mdodo wa hegwe Laheli.” <verse eid="GEN 29:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 29:19"/>Labani nakamlonjela, “Yowa goya kukugalila hegwe Laheli, kusinda kumgalila munhu yunji yoneche. Ulutilile kikala na heni.” <verse eid="GEN 29:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 29:20"/>Lelo Yakobo nakamkolela mijito Labani kwa mhela wa miyaka saba kwa chiwalo cha Laheli, ila mhela ula kwa heye nawali kota mazuwa mado, kwa vila nayali yomgana Laheli.<verse eid="GEN 29:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 29:21"/>Hamba Yakobo nakamlonjela Labani, “Mhela wa heni wenela, ahyo ngalile mchewangu.” <verse eid="GEN 29:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 29:22"/>Lelo Labani nakawika goya mnvina na kuwalalika wanhu weng'ha wa ako. <verse eid="GEN 29:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 29:23"/>Ila matinazo, Labani nakamhola Lea, mhinza mkulu wa heye, nakamhilika kwa Yakobo. Yakobo nakawasa na heye. <verse eid="GEN 29:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 29:24"/>Ila Labani nakamlavya Silipa, mpogozi wa heye, yawe mpogozi wa Lea. <verse eid="GEN 29:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 29:25"/>Lokubwemwenzuche, Yakobo nakavizela kota nayali Lea! Lelo nakamuuza Labani, “Nakunditila mbuli yachi? Ndaze, nasikukolile hegwe mijito kwa chiwalo cha Laheli? Lekachoni nakundeteleza?” <verse eid="GEN 29:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 29:26"/>Labani nakedichila, “Hatuditaga ahyo kuli isi ya hetwe ayi, chihendo cha hetwe changulemeza kulongola kuhesigwa mhinza mdodo, aku mkulu yang'hali kuhesigwa. <verse eid="GEN 29:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 29:27"/>Mgongomanyile mnvina Lea kwa mazuwa geng'ha saba, natwe tokugalila Laheli kwa kutukolela mijito mhela wa miyaka saba jinji.” <verse eid="GEN 29:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 29:28"/>Yakobo nakakunda. Yakobo loyamgongomanyile Lea kwa mazuwa saba, Labani nakamgalila Laheli, mhinza wa heye mdodo yawe mchewake. <verse eid="GEN 29:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 29:29"/>Labani nakamlavya Biliha mpogozi wa heye, yawe mpogozi wa Laheli. <verse eid="GEN 29:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 29:30"/>Lelo Yakobo nakawasa na Laheli kahi. Ila Yakobo nakamgana ng'hatu Laheli kusinda Lea, nakamkolela mijito Labani kwa miyaka saba jinji.<verse eid="GEN 29:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wana wa Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 29:31"/>Mkulu Nguluwi loyawene Lea kanguzudilwa, nakamdita yawe na mwana, ila Laheli nayali mhende. <verse eid="GEN 29:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 29:32"/>Lea nakawa na himila, nakaponda mwana msongolo, nakamchema <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29:32 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Lubeni </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kwa Chiebulaniya yanguzeleka kota “Ulole mwana.”</char></note>Lubeni, kwa vila nakalonga, “Mkulu Nguluwi nakona kugazika kwa heni, sambi mlume wa heni kongana.” <verse eid="GEN 29:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 29:33"/>Lea nakawa na himila kahi, nakaponda mwana msongolo, nakamchema Simeoni<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29:33 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Simeoni </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kwa Chiebulaniya ndo mina “Yalinguhulika.”</char></note>, kwa vila nayali yolonga, “Mkulu Nguluwi nakangalila mwana yunji msongolo kwa vila nakahulika vyondilinguzudilwa.” <verse eid="GEN 29:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 29:34"/>Nakawa na himila kahi, nakaponda mwana msongolo, nakamchema Lawi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29:34 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Lawi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kwa Chiebulaniya ndo kuchilumba.</char></note>, kwa vila nayali yolonga, “Mhela uno mlume wa heni kochilumba hamwe na heni, kwa vila ndimpondela wana wasongolo wadatu.” <verse eid="GEN 29:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 29:35"/>Lea nakawa na himila kahi, nakaponda mwana msongolo, nakamchema Yuda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29:35 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Yuda </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kwa Chiebulaniya ndo kutogola.</char></note>, kwa vila nayali yolonga, “Mhela uno ndomtogola Mkulu Nguluwi.” Hamba Lea nakaleka kuponda.<verse eid="GEN 29:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 29"/>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="GEN 30"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 30:1"/>Laheli loyawene kota hambe yaponde mwana kwa Yakobo, nakamwonela fihi lumbulyake Lea, nakamlonjela Yakobo, “Ngalile wana, wone huditile ahyo, ndobagama.” <verse eid="GEN 30:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 30:2"/>Yakobo nakazudizwa na Laheli na kumlonjela, “Ndaze, heni ndiwa honhu ha Nguluwi yakulemeze kuwa na wana?” <verse eid="GEN 30:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 30:3"/>Laheli nakamwidichila, “Mpogozi wa heni Biliha kabaha. Uwase na heye leka yawe na wana honhu ha heni, nani kahi ndiwe na wana kwa kulawa kwa heye.” <verse eid="GEN 30:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 30:4"/>Ahyo Laheli nakamgalila Yakobo mpogozi wa heye Biliha, yawe kota mchewake, na heye nakawasa na heye. <verse eid="GEN 30:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 30:5"/>Biliha nakawa na himila nakampondela Yakobo mwana msongolo. <verse eid="GEN 30:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 30:6"/>Laheli nakalonga, “Nguluwi nakanhagusa goya, nakahulika chililo cha heni na kungalila mwana msongolo.” Nakamchema mwana ayo Dani<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:6 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Dani </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kwa Chiebulaniya ndo nakanhagusa goya. </char></note>. <verse eid="GEN 30:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 30:7"/>Biliha mpogozi wa Laheli, nakawa na himila kahi na nakampondela Yakobo mwana wa keli msongolo. <verse eid="GEN 30:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 30:8"/>Aho Laheli nakalonga, “Natitowa lukami na lumbulyangu, nani sumya.” Ahyo nakamchema mwana ayo Nafutali<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:8 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Nafutali </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kwa Chiebulaniya ndo kitowa.</char></note>.<verse eid="GEN 30:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 30:9"/>Lea loyawene nakaleka kuponda, nakamhola mpogozi wa heye Silipa, nakamgalila Yakobo leka yawe kota mchewake. <verse eid="GEN 30:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 30:10"/>Silipa nakampondela Yakobo mwana msongolo. <verse eid="GEN 30:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 30:11"/>Lea nakalonga, “Mbuli zangundutila goya.” Ahyo nakamchema mwana ayo Gadi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Gadi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kwa Chiebulaniya ndo mbuli zangundutila goya. </char></note>. <verse eid="GEN 30:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 30:12"/>Silipa mpogozi wa Lea, nakampondela Yakobo mwana wa keli msongolo. <verse eid="GEN 30:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 30:13"/>Lea nakalonga, “Ndangusangalala! Lelo wadala wonyhema heni kusangalala.” Ahyo, nakamchema mwana ayo Asheli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:13 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Asheli </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kwa Chiebulaniya ndo kusangalala.</char></note>.<verse eid="GEN 30:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 30:14"/>Nawali mhela wa mbena ya ngano, Lubeni nakaluta kisolo na ako nakahola ifuza lilinguchemigwa mituletule<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:14 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mituletule</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kwa Chiebulaniya ndo ifuza liwele hewo wangutumbila kota wone mdala yolya ifuza alyo lyomwambuza kuponda lukami.</char></note>, nakamgalila mayake, Lea. Laheli nakamlonjela Lea, “Dedede, ngalile jimwe ja ajo mituletule ja mwanago.” <verse eid="GEN 30:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 30:15"/>Ila Lea nakalonga, “Ndaze, kwangujesa ndo mbuli ndodo kumhola mlume wa heni, na sambi kwangugana kuhola mituletule ja mwana wa heni?” Laheli nakamwidichila, “Loungalila mituletule ja mwanago, Yakobo kowasa kwa hegwe lehano.”<verse eid="GEN 30:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 30:16"/>Lelo matinazo Yakobo loyawele yohiluka kulawa kumgunda, Lea nakalawa kumbochela, nakamlonjela, “Ndimha mituletule ja mwanangu, ahyo kwanguganigwa kuwasa na heni.” Ahyo Yakobo nakawasa kwa Lea nechilo ayo. <verse eid="GEN 30:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 30:17"/>Nguluwi nakahulichiza kulanda kwa Lea, na heye nakawa na himila nakampondela Yakobo mwana wa kahano msongolo. <verse eid="GEN 30:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 30:18"/>Lea nakalonga, “Nguluwi nakangalila chonolo cha heni kwa vila nandimpa mlume wa heni mpogozi wa heni.” Lelo nakamchema mwana ayo Isakali<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:18 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Isakali </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kwa Chiebulaniya ndo chonolo.</char></note>. <verse eid="GEN 30:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 30:19"/>Lea nakawa na himila kahi nakampondela Yakobo mwana wa sita msongolo. <verse eid="GEN 30:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 30:20"/>Lea nakalonga, “Nguluwi nakangalila ndolendole inojile. Lelo mlume wa heni konyhulichiza kwa vila nandimpondela mwana wa sita msongolo.” Ahyo nakamchema mwana ayo Sebuluni<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:20 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Sebuluni </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kwa Chiebulaniya ndo kuhulichiza.</char></note>. <verse eid="GEN 30:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 30:21"/>Hamba nakaponda mwana mhinza nakamchema Dina.<verse eid="GEN 30:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 30:22"/>Hamba Nguluwi nakamkumbuchila Laheli, nakahulichiza kulanda kwa heye nakamdita yawe na wana. <verse eid="GEN 30:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 30:23"/>Laheli nakawa na himila, nakaponda mwana msongolo, nakalonga, “Nguluwi nakambusila soni ya heni.” <verse eid="GEN 30:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 30:24"/>Ahyo nakamchema mwana ayo Yusufu, yolonga, “Mkulu Nguluwi nayanyonjezele mwana yunji msongolo.”<verse eid="GEN 30:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yakobo kanguwa na lufufu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 30:25"/>Laheli loyampondile Yusufu, Yakobo nakamlonjela Labani, “Ng'hundize nyiluche hakaye hangu, hali isi ya heni. <verse eid="GEN 30:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 30:26"/>Ngalile wadala wa heni na wana wa heni wapondigwe kwa kukukolela mijito hegwe, mbuche na hewo. Kwanguvizela kota nandikukolela mijito goya.” <verse eid="GEN 30:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 30:27"/>Ila Labani nakamlonjela, “Ng'hundize kwa uganililo nani ndonje. Ndivizela kwa kulagula kota Mkulu Nguluwi nakamha utambichizo kwa chiwalo cha hegwe. <verse eid="GEN 30:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 30:28"/>Ulonje sendi zilinga, nani ndokugalila.” <verse eid="GEN 30:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 30:29"/>Yakobo nakamlonjela, “Hegwe kwanguvizela ndaze vyondikukolele mijito, na ndaze vyondijilolele migongolo ja hegwe. <verse eid="GEN 30:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 30:30"/>Kwa vila londing'hali kuya kuno nawali na lufufu ludo hela ila kulawa lofichile, lufufu lwa hegwe lonjezeka ng'hatu, na Mkulu Nguluwi nakakutambichiza chila hondilinguluta. Ila sambi ndowalolela nili wang'holozangu?”<verse eid="GEN 30:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 30:31"/>Labani nakamuuza, “Ndikugalile choni?” Yakobo nakamwidichila, “Humha chinhu choneche. Ndolutilila kujilolela migongolo ja hegwe wone konditila mbuli ayi. <verse eid="GEN 30:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 30:32"/>Ng'hundize ng'hole hagati hali migongolo ja hegwe jeng'ha lehano, ndibagule hali ilundo chila ing'holo lyana liwele na usalagwe na utoletole na chila ing'holo lyana lititu na chila mhene iwele na usalagwe na utoletole. Azo ndo zowa sendi za heni. <verse eid="GEN 30:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 30:33"/>Ahyo, mazuwa galinguya, kutanganika kwa heni kokoneka hazelu hala hondipegwa sendi za heni. Mhene yoneche yohaiwele na utoletole ama ing'holo lyana lyoneche lyohaliwele lititu likoneka hali ilundo lya heni, alyo lyowa lihizigwa.” <verse eid="GEN 30:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 30:34"/>Labani nakalonga, “Goya! Na iwe kota vyoulonjile.” <verse eid="GEN 30:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 30:35"/>Ila Labani zuwa lilyo nakaluta kujibagula mipongo jeng'ha jiwele usalagwe na utoletole na mhene zinji ndala ziwele na utoletole na usalagwe na uzelu na chila ing'holo lyana lititu na nakaziwika hali wamizi wa wanage leka jiwe ja Yakobo. <verse eid="GEN 30:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 30:36"/>Migongolo ja Labani na migongolo ja Yakobo najibaguligwa kwa utali wa kujenda mazuwa gadatu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 30:36">Yakobo nakapona bahala yodima migongolo ja Labani jiponile. <verse eid="GEN 30:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 30:37"/>Lelo Yakobo nakahola fito za migodi jidatu jilivinji nakajibadula mibadu leka misitali mizelu joneche kuli fito azo. <verse eid="GEN 30:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 30:38"/>Nakazimiza fito azo zoyazibadule hali migongolo hali mibuli ja kunwezela mazi, honhu hawele migongolo najuya kunwa mazi, <verse eid="GEN 30:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 30:39"/>migongolo milume najikwina midala najiwa na nyinda hali fito azo, najilela migongolo jinji jiwele na usalagwe na utoletole. <verse eid="GEN 30:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 30:40"/>Yakobo nakajibagula ajo ming'holo myana, hamba nakajilajila kuli migongolo jiwele na usalagwe na mititu kuli chilundo cha Labani. Kwa nzila ino, Yakobo nakawa na chilundo cha heye yuye, na hambe yahanzile na chilundo cha Labani. <verse eid="GEN 30:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 30:41"/>Naiwa chila mhela wa migongolo jinenehe kuhola nyinda, Yakobo nakawikaga fito azo kumwando mwa ajo migongolo hali mibuli ja kunwezela mazi, leka wahole nyinda hali fito azo. <verse eid="GEN 30:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 30:42"/>Ila nahawichile fito azo kumwando mwa migongolo jiwele ng'hochele lojali jihola nyinda. Baho du, migongolo jigandile najali ja Labani, na migongolo jinenehe najali ja Yakobo. <verse eid="GEN 30:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 30:43"/>Lelo Yakobo nakawa na lufufu lukami, nakawa na vilundo vikulu vya migongolo na wakolamijito wa heye wadala na walume na ngamiya na midogowi.<verse eid="GEN 30:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 30"/>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="GEN 31"/>
  <para style="s">Yakobo kangulawa kwa Labani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 31:1"/>Lelo Yakobo nakahulika kota wana wasongolo wa Labani nawali wolonga, “Yakobo nakahola chila chinhu cha mhaza wa hetwe, na ndo kawa na lufufu.” <verse eid="GEN 31:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 31:2"/>Yakobo kahi nakavizela kota Labani sambi hamganile heye kota aho hamwande. <verse eid="GEN 31:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 31:3"/>Hamba Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlonjela Yakobo, “Uhiluche kuli isi ya wasekulu wa hegwe na ivyazi lyako, nani ndowa hamwe na hegwe.”<verse eid="GEN 31:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 31:4"/>Lelo Yakobo nakagana Laheli na Lea wachemigwe, na hewo nawaluta ako kuchiwala koyawele yodima ming'holo. <verse eid="GEN 31:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 31:5"/>Yakobo nakawalonjela, “Ndangona kota mhaza wa hemwe hambe yangane heni kota aho hamwande. Ila Nguluwi wa mhaza wa heni kahamwe na heni. <verse eid="GEN 31:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 31:6"/>Hemwe mvizela kota nandimkolela mijito mhaza wa hemwe kwa mong'ho wa heni weng'ha <verse eid="GEN 31:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 31:7"/>Ila heye nakanyhada na kugalula sendi za heni mala kumi. Ila Nguluwi nahamkundize heye kundumiza heni. <verse eid="GEN 31:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 31:8"/>Hala mhaza wa hemwe hoyali yolonga, ‘Migongolo jiwele na usalagwe ndo jowa sendi za hegwe,’ lelo chilundo cheng'ha nachilela migongolo jiwele na usalagwe. Na hala hoyali yolonga, ‘Migongolo jiwele na misitali ndo jowa sendi za hegwe,’ lelo chilundo cheng'ha nachilela migongolo jiwele na misitali. <verse eid="GEN 31:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 31:9"/>Ahi ndo Nguluwi navyoyaholile migongolo ja mhaza wa hemwe, na kungalila heni.<verse eid="GEN 31:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 31:10"/>“Mhela wa migongolo kuhola nyinda nandota ulotezi, na kuli ulotezi awo nandota mipongo jeng'ha najikwinha mhene ndala jiwele na usalagwe na utoletole. <verse eid="GEN 31:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 31:11"/>Mhilisi wa Nguluwi nakalonga na heni kuli ulotezi awo, nakanyhema, ‘Yakobo,’ nani nyhidichila, ‘Ena.’ <verse eid="GEN 31:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 31:12"/>Na heye nakandonjela, ‘Ulole mipongo jeng'ha jangukwinha mhene ndala ziwele na misitali na ziwele na usalagwe na utoletole. Mbuli ayi naiwa kota ahi kwa vila nandola vyoyakuditile Labani. <verse eid="GEN 31:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 31:13"/>Heni nda yula Nguluwi yakulawilile kula Beteli, honhu hala houliwichile lila izengo lyoulijidile mafuta na hala houwichile ilagano kwa kilaha. Lelo uche kuli isi ayi uhiluche kuli isi ya nhanzi ya hegwe.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 31:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 31:14"/>Laheli na Lea nawamwidichila Yakobo, “Hetwe twahela honhu ha lufufu ama uhalizi woneche hali ng'handa ya mhaza wa hetwe. <verse eid="GEN 31:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 31:15"/>Heye kangutona hetwe kota wajenzi, lelo ndo nakatuguza, nakatumiya lufufu lweng'ha loyapatile kwa kutuguza. <verse eid="GEN 31:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 31:16"/>Lufufu lweng'ha luwele Nguluwi nakahola kulawa kwa mhaza wa hetwe ndo wa hetwe na wana wa hetwe. Ahyo, udite vila vyoulajizwe na Nguluwi.”<verse eid="GEN 31:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 31:17"/>Lelo Yakobo nakenuka na kiwika goya kwa majendo kwa kuwakwiniza wana wa heye na wadala wa heye mchanya mwa ngamiya. <verse eid="GEN 31:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 31:18"/>Nakajihola migongolo ja heye jeng'ha na lufufu lwa heye lweng'ha loyapatile ako Padani-alamu, nakaluka majendo ga kuhiluka kuli isi ya Kanaani kwa Isaka mhaza wa heye. <verse eid="GEN 31:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 31:19"/>Mhela awo Labani nayali yalutile kujitema milaika ming'holo ja heye. Ahyo Laheli nakahiza jimalukolo ja milungu ja mhaza wa heye. <verse eid="GEN 31:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 31:20"/>Yakobo nakadeta kwa Labani Mwalamu kwa kuka ne kumzelesa. <verse eid="GEN 31:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 31:21"/>Lelo Yakobo nakahola lufufu lwa heye lweng'ha, na kuka. Loyalochile lwanda lwa Eyufulate, nakaluta Gileadi isi ya vidunda.<verse eid="GEN 31:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Labani kangumuwinza Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 31:22"/>Logakolile mazuwa gadatu, Labani nakahulika kota Yakobo nakoka ne kumlonjela. <verse eid="GEN 31:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 31:23"/>Lelo Labani nakawahola wang'holoze, nakamuwinza Yakobo kwa majendo ga mazuwa saba, nakamfika kuli isi ya vidunda vya Gileadi. <verse eid="GEN 31:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 31:24"/>Ila nechilo, Nguluwi nakamlawila Labani Mwalamu kuli ulotezi, nakamlonjela, “Ulolele, uleche kumpanjila ne kumtambichiza Yakobo.”<verse eid="GEN 31:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 31:25"/>Lelo Labani nakamfichila Yakobo. Mhela awo Yakobo nakesela kuli isi ya vidunda kwa mhela udo. Na heye Labani na wang'holoze nawesela hala kahi kuli vidunda vya Gileadi. <verse eid="GEN 31:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 31:26"/>Ahyo, Labani nakamlonjela Yakobo, “Nakudita choni? Lekachoni nakunyhada, nakuwahola wahinza wa heni kota wapogozi wa kuli ngondo? <verse eid="GEN 31:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 31:27"/>Lekachoni nakuka kwa uviso, nakunyhada nahundonjele hebu leka ndikulaje kwa kusangalala na nzimbo na ngoma na ving'hweleng'hwele? <verse eid="GEN 31:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 31:28"/>Hambe hung'hundize heni kuwanonela wahinza wa heni na wazukulu wa heni? Ndikomya nakudita chinhu cha upoka. <verse eid="GEN 31:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 31:29"/>Heni ndoweza kukuditila wihe, ila Nguluwi wa mhaza wa hegwe nakandawila nechilo ya kuya lehano, nakandonjela, ‘Ulolele, uleche kumlonjela Yakobo ulonzi woneche ula, linojile ama lihile.’ <verse eid="GEN 31:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 31:30"/>Ndivizela nakuka ne kulonga kwa vila nawali ugana ng'hatu kuhiluka kaye kwa mhaza wa hegwe, ila lekachoni nakuhiza jimalukolo ja milungu ja heni?” <verse eid="GEN 31:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 31:31"/>Yakobo nakamwidichila Labani, “Nandumba kwa vila ndali ndijesa kota wahambochile wahinza wa hegwe. <verse eid="GEN 31:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 31:32"/>Ila youmfika na jimalukolo ja milungu ja hegwe umkopole. Ulajile chinhu choneche chiwele cha hegwe hali wano wang'holozetu, uhole.” Yakobo nayali havizelele kota Laheli nayali yahizile jimalukolo ja milingu ja Labani.<verse eid="GEN 31:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 31:33"/>Lelo Labani najikapala jimalukolo ja milungu jake kuli ihema lya Yakobo na lya Lea na lya wadala wa wapogozi weli, ila nahajiwene. Hamba nakalawa kuli ihema lya Lea na kwinjila kuli ihema lya Laheli. <verse eid="GEN 31:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 31:34"/>Laheli nayali yaholile jimalukolo ajo, nakavisa hali chigoda cha kikalila mli ngamiya na kikala mchanya mwake. Labani nakapala mli ihema lyeng'ha, ila nahajiwene. <verse eid="GEN 31:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 31:35"/>Aho, Laheli nakamlonjela mhaza wa heye, “Dedede mhaza wa heni, uleche kuzudila, heni siweza hebu kwima kumwando kwa hegwe kwa vila ndina mbuli za chidala.” Labani nakapala jimalukolo ja milungu ja heye nahajiwene.<verse eid="GEN 31:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 31:36"/>Aho Yakobo nakazudila, naketwanza na Labani yolonga, “Lekachoni wali umbinga, ndita gehile gachi? <verse eid="GEN 31:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 31:37"/>Ndaze, nakona choni lousakule mhomolo za heni zeng'ha? Chiwiche kumwando mwa wang'holozangu na wang'holozo, leka wataguse hali hetwe weli. <verse eid="GEN 31:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 31:38"/>Nandikala na hegwe kwa mhela wa miyaka makumi meli, na mhela awo weng'ha ming'holo ja hegwe na mhene za hegwe zeng'ha haziwifile nyinda, nani sidile ing'holo ilume lya chilundo cha hegwe. <verse eid="GEN 31:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 31:39"/>Heni sikugalile ne zuwa limwe igongolo lya hegwe likopoligwe na migongolo ja kisolo, ila nandihilusa nene baha. Hegwe nakungana ndikuhilusile ne kijesa kota nakahizigwa nemisi ama nechilo. <verse eid="GEN 31:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 31:40"/>Ahyo nemisi ndikangaza isanya likali na nechilo mbeho naimhutila heni nasipatile kuwasa ne hado. <verse eid="GEN 31:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 31:41"/>Kwa miyaka makumi meli aga geng'ha nandikala hakaye kwa hegwe. Nandikukolela mijito kwa mhela wa miyaka kumi na gane kwa chiwalo cha wahinza wa hegwe weli, na miyaka jinji sita nandima migongolo ja hegwe. Ila hegwe, nakugalula msahala wa heni mala kumi. <verse eid="GEN 31:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 31:42"/>Kota Nguluwi wa mhaza wa heni Abulahamu, Nguluwi yamditile mhaza wa heni Isaka yakakame, wone nahawele ubanzi wa heni, ndikomya nakugana kundeka heni ndute ne chinhu. Ila Nguluwi nakona kugazika kwa heni na mijito yong'holile kwa moko ga heni, nakakung'hanuchila nechilo ya kuya lehano.”<verse eid="GEN 31:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 31:43"/>Aho Labani nakamwidichila Yakobo, “Wahinza wano ndo wahinza wa heni, na wana wano ndo wana wa heni, migongolo jino ndo migongolo ja heni na vyeng'ha vyoulinguvyona hano ndo vya heni. Ila heni ndoweza kudita choni lehano kuwalapa wano wahinza wa heni na wana wa hewo wawapondile? <verse eid="GEN 31:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 31:44"/>Lelo natudite ilagano heni na hegwe leka liwe ulolezi wa heni na hegwe.”<verse eid="GEN 31:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 31:45"/>Lelo Yakobo nakahola iganga, nakalimiza kota izengo. <verse eid="GEN 31:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 31:46"/>Kahi Yakobo nakawalonjela wang'holoze, “Mkungajize maganga.” Na hewo nawakungajiza na kudita chibugulu. Hamba nawalya chilyo behi na chibugulu acho cha maganga. <verse eid="GEN 31:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 31:47"/>Labani nakachichema chibugulu acho cha maganga Yegali-sahaduta, ila Yakobo nakachichema Galeedi. <verse eid="GEN 31:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 31:48"/>Labani nakalonga, “Chibugulu achi cha maganga ndo ulolezi wa heni na hegwe lehano.” Ahyo, ndo mina chibugulu acho nakachichema Galeedi, <verse eid="GEN 31:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 31:49"/>na chibugulu chila kahi nachichemigwa Misipa aku yolonga, “Mkulu Nguluwi nayatwamile lotuwele kutali ne kiwona. <verse eid="GEN 31:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 31:50"/>Wone uwagaze wahinza wa heni, ama louhesa wadala wanji kusinda wano, ne kuvizela munhu yunji, lelo uvizele kota kuduhu yawele mlolezi hali hetwe ila ndo Nguluwi yuye.” <verse eid="GEN 31:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 31:51"/>Hamba Labani nakamlonjela Yakobo, “Ulole chibugulu achi cha maganga na izengo lyondilimize hali hegwe na heni. <verse eid="GEN 31:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 31:52"/>Chibugulu chino ndo ulolezi na izengo ali ndo ulolezi kota heni hambe ndoche chibugulu chino kuya kwa hegwe kukuditila wihe, na huweza kuloka chibugulu chino kuya kwa heni kunditila wihe. <verse eid="GEN 31:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 31:53"/>Nguluwi wa Abulahamu na Nguluwi wa Naholi, kotagusa hali hetwe.” Lelo Yakobo nakelaha kwa Nguluwi yamditile Isaka mhaza wa heye yakakame. <verse eid="GEN 31:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 31:54"/>Hamba Yakobo nakalavya nhambiko ako kuli isi ya vidunda na kuwalalika wang'holoze walye chilyo. Lowasindile kulya nawapona kuko nechilo.<verse eid="GEN 31:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 31:55"/>Lufuku Labani nakenuka, nakawanonela wazukulu wa heye na wahinza wa heye na nakawatambichiza. Hamba nakoka kuhiluka kaye.<verse eid="GEN 31:55"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 31"/>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="GEN 32"/>
  <para style="s">Yakobo kangiwika goya kiting'hana na Esau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 32:1"/>Yakobo nakalutilila na majendo ga heye. Lelo wahilisi wa Nguluwi naweting'hana na heye. <verse eid="GEN 32:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 32:2"/>Yakobo loyawawene, nakalonga, “Ayi ndo kambi ya Nguluwi!” Ahyo, nakahachema honhu aho Mahanaimu.<verse eid="GEN 32:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 32:3"/>Yakobo nakawalajiza wahilisi wamlongole kwa mng'holoze Esau, ako Seili hali isi ya Edomu. <verse eid="GEN 32:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 32:4"/>Nakawagalila malajizo gano, “Momulonjela hino mkulu wa heni Esau. Chitumagwa wa hegwe Yakobo kangulonga hino, ‘Nandikala kuli isi ya ujenzi kwa Labani mbaka sambi. <verse eid="GEN 32:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 32:5"/>Ndina misenga na midogowi na milundo ja ming'holo na vitumagwa walume na wadala. Ndangukulajizila usenga awu, mkulu wa heni, leka ndiwe na uganililo hali hegwe.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 32:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 32:6"/>Awo wahilisi nawaluta, hamba nawahiluka na kumlonjela Yakobo, “Natufika kwa mng'holozo Esau, na heye kamzila kuya kukubochela, yawele na walume miya zine.” <verse eid="GEN 32:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 32:7"/>Lelo Yakobo nakadumba ng'hatu na nakawa na lunhwinhwi. Nakawabagula wanhu wowawele hamwe na heye kuli vilundo vili na ming'holo na migongolo jinji na ngamiya ako kuli kambi <verse eid="GEN 32:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 32:8"/>yojesa, “Wone Esau kokuya na kubagamiza chilundo chimwe, chilundo chiyage chonyeleduka kuli kambi.”<verse eid="GEN 32:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 32:9"/>Hamba Yakobo nakamlanda Nguluwi yolonga, “Hegwe Nguluwi wa mhaza wa heni Abulahamu na Nguluwi wa mhaza wa heni Isaka. Hegwe Mkulu Nguluwi youndonjele kota nyhiluche hali isi ya heni hawele na ivyazi lya heni, nakundonjela kunditila ganojile, <verse eid="GEN 32:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 32:10"/>hambe nganigwe ne hado madito ga hegwe ga igano lya kwimilila na makundo goundajile heni chitumagwa wa hegwe. Londochile lwanda Yolodani, nandali hela chinhu ila ng'hweku hela, ila sambi ndanazo kambi mbili. <verse eid="GEN 32:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 32:11"/>Ndangukulanda undohole sambi kulawa kwa mng'holozangu Esau, mina ndangudumba kota kotutowa na kutubagamiza hetwe tweng'ha, wadala hamwe na wana. <verse eid="GEN 32:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 32:12"/>Hegwe nakundonjela ukomya konditila ganojile na kudita lulelo lwa heni luwe lwinji kota sangalaza ya mli bahali yohailinguwazika.”<verse eid="GEN 32:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 32:13"/>Lelo Yakobo nakawasa baho nechilo ayo. Hamba nakabagula honhu ha lufufu lwa heye hawe ndolendole kwa mng'holoze Esau. <verse eid="GEN 32:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 32:14"/>Mhene ndala miya mbili na mipongo makumi meli na ming'holo midala miya mbili na ming'holo milume makumi meli <verse eid="GEN 32:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 32:15"/>na ngamiya makumi gadatu walingonyeza hamwe na wana na misenga makumi gane na mibuguma kumi hamwe na midogowi midala makumi meli na milume kumi. <verse eid="GEN 32:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 32:16"/>Nakawagalila vitumagwa wa heye chila yumwe na ilundo lya heye, nakawalonjela, “Mlongole kuno mleka honhu hagati kulawa chilundo chimwe na chiyage kuli majendo ga hemwe.” <verse eid="GEN 32:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 32:17"/>Nakamlajiza yula chitumagwa yalongole, “Louting'hana na mng'holozangu Esau, wone yakuuze, ‘Hegwe kwa chitumagwa wa whaani? Kwanguluta kohi? Na migongolo jino ja whaani?’ <verse eid="GEN 32:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 32:18"/>Nagwe komwidichila, ‘Alu ndo lufufu lwa chitumagwa wa hegwe Yakobo, na ndo ndolendole ya hegwe mkulu wa heni Esau. Kahi Yakobo yuye ka kumbele kanguya.’ ” <verse eid="GEN 32:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 32:19"/>Nakalavya ilajizo lilyo kwa chilundo cha keli na cha kadatu na wanji weng'ha yolonga, “Momlonjela Esau ulonzi wuwo lomting'hana na heye. <verse eid="GEN 32:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 32:20"/>Kupuluta kwa geng'ha, momlonjela, ‘Chitumagwa wa hegwe Yakobo ka kumbele, kanguya.’ ” Yakobo nakadita ahyo yojesa, “Hanji ndomdita yasindamale kwa ndolendole ino yoilongole, hamba ndoweza kiwona meho kwa meho, hanji kombochela heni.” <verse eid="GEN 32:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 32:21"/>Lelo nakalongola ndolendole ya heye, ila heye nakawika kambi.<verse eid="GEN 32:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ngondo nechilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 32:22"/>Nechilo yiyo Yakobo nakenuka, nakawahola wadala wa heye weli na wapogozi wa heye wadala weli na wana wa heye kumi na yumwe, nawakola chiloko cha Yaboki. <verse eid="GEN 32:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 32:23"/>Loyawalajize kuloka lwanda alo wala wawele na heye na lufufu lwa heye lweng'ha, <verse eid="GEN 32:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 32:24"/>Yakobo nakasigala yaliyeka. Munhu yumwe nakoya, nawetowa mbaka lufuku. <verse eid="GEN 32:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 32:25"/>Munhu ayo loyawene kota howeza kumsumya Yakobo, nakamdoliza Yakobo kuli chuno, na heye nakatweguka loyawele yochitowa. <verse eid="GEN 32:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 32:26"/>Hamba yula munhu nakamlonjela Yakobo, “Ndeche ndute, mina kubwemwenzuka sambi.” Ila Yakobo nakamlonjela, “Sikuleka ng'oo mbaka unhambichize!” <verse eid="GEN 32:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 32:27"/>Na heye nakamuuza, “Itagwa lyako lyachi?” Heye nakamwidichila, “Yakobo.” <verse eid="GEN 32:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 32:28"/>Yula munhu nakamlonjela, “Hochemigwa Yakobo kahi, ila Isilaeli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">32:28 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Isilaeli </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kwa Chiebulaniya ndo kitowa na Nguluwi.</char></note>, kwa vila nakwimilila kitowa na Nguluwi.” <verse eid="GEN 32:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 32:29"/>Aho, Yakobo nakamlonjela, “Dedede, ndangukulanda undonjele itagwa lya hegwe.” Ila heye nakamlonjela, “Ya choni kumbuza itagwa lya heni?” Hamba nakamtambichiza Yakobo. <verse eid="GEN 32:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 32:30"/>Yakobo nakahachema honhu aho Penieli, yolonga, “Nandimona Nguluwi meho kwa meho, na hambe mbagame.” <verse eid="GEN 32:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 32:31"/>Isanya nalyali lyaluka kulawa mhela Yakobo loyochile Penueli, nayali yodudila kwa chiwalo cha chigudi cha heye. <verse eid="GEN 32:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 32:32"/>Ndo mina mbaka lehano Waisilaeli hambe walye idanha lya honhu ha chigudi, mina yula munhu nakamdoliza Yakobo hali midanha ha chigudi cha heye.<verse eid="GEN 32:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 32"/>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="GEN 33"/>
  <para style="s">Yakobo kanguting'hana na Esau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 33:1"/>Lelo Yakobo nakalola, nakamona Esau hamwe na walume miya zine. Aho, nakawabagula wana wa heye kwa Lea na Laheli na wala wapogozi wa heye wadala weli. <verse eid="GEN 33:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 33:2"/>Nakawawika wapogozi wadala na wana wa hewo kumwando, hamba Lea na wana wa heye na kumbele ng'hatu nawali Laheli na mwana wa heye Yusufu. <verse eid="GEN 33:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 33:3"/>Hamba heye nakalongoza, nakaluta kwa kufugama mala saba, mbaka loyafichile habehi na mng'holoze.<verse eid="GEN 33:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 33:4"/>Lelo Esau nakaluta kwa kubilima kumbochela Yakobo, nakamkumbatila kuli singo na kumnonela, na weng'ha weli nawalila. <verse eid="GEN 33:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 33:5"/>Esau loyalolile na kuwona wala wadala na wana, nakauza, “Awa wawele na hegwe ndo wanhu wachi?” Yakobo nakedichila, “Wano ndo wana wawele Nguluwi yangalile heni chitumagwa wa hegwe kwa kunoga kwa heye.”<verse eid="GEN 33:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 33:6"/>Hamba wala wapogozi nawahejela hamwe na wana wa hewo, nawenamiza kwa kuhulichiza. <verse eid="GEN 33:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 33:7"/>Na heye Lea kahi nakoya hamwe na wana wa heye, nakenamiza kwa kuhulichiza. Hamba, Laheli na Yusufu nawoya, nawenamiza kwa kuhulichiza.<verse eid="GEN 33:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 33:8"/>Aho, Esau nakauza, “Kuting'hana heni na chilundo chino mnzila kuna mana yachi?” Yakobo nakamwidichila, “Ndali nditumbila kuwa na uganililo kulawa kwa hegwe mkulu wa heni.” <verse eid="GEN 33:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 33:9"/>Ila Esau nakalonga, “Ndina lufufu lwa kuhega mng'holozangu. Lufufu lwa hegwe na lupone kwa hegwe.” <verse eid="GEN 33:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 33:10"/>Yakobo nakamlonjela, “Hebu, kota kukomya, nakukunda kumbochela heni, lelo ndangukudedeza ubochele ndolendole ya heni. Ndikomya, sangalala kukona hegwe kota ndimona Nguluwi, kwa vila nakumbochela goya. <verse eid="GEN 33:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 33:11"/>Lelo ndangukudedeza ubochele ndolendole kota utambichizo kulawa kwa heni yondikugalile, kwa vila nani kahi Nguluwi nakambonela isungu heni na kwa vila nandali na chinhu cha kuhega.” Ahi ndo Yakobo vyoyamdedeze ng'hatu Esau, na heye nakabochela ndolendole ya heye.<verse eid="GEN 33:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 33:12"/>Esau nakalonga, “Natulutilile na majendo ga hetwe, heni ndokulongola.” <verse eid="GEN 33:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 33:13"/>Ila Yakobo nakamlonjela, “Mkulu wa heni, hegwe kuvizela kota wana wano ndo vyali na kahi migongolo jino jangonyeza, na heni ndanguganigwa kujilolela, kota migongolo jino johilikwa kwa kubilima kwa zuwa limwe, jeng'ha jobagama. <verse eid="GEN 33:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 33:14"/>Lelo mkulu wa heni ulongole, nani ndokuya mholemhole kota migongolo na wana vyowalingujenda mbaka londifika kwa mkulu wa heni ako Seili.”<verse eid="GEN 33:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 33:15"/>Aho Esau nakalonga, “Inoga ndikulechele wanhu wamwe wa heni.” Ila Yakobo nakalonga, “Lekachoni kuganigwa kudita ahyo? Ihega kota heni mhegwa uganililo wa hegwe, mkulu wa heni.” <verse eid="GEN 33:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 33:16"/>Lelo zuwa alyo Esau nakaluka majendo ga kuhiluka Seili. <verse eid="GEN 33:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 33:17"/>Ila Yakobo nakaheluka nakafika Sukoti, na ako nakezenjela ng'handa na vibumuli kwa chiwalo cha migongolo ja heye. Kwa chiwalo acho, honhu aho nahachemigwa Sukoti.<verse eid="GEN 33:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 33:18"/>Kulawila nzila ilingukolela Padani-alamu Yakobo nakafika goya kuli muji wa Shekemu, kuli isi ya Kanaani, nakawika kambi behi na muji awo. <verse eid="GEN 33:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 33:19"/>Honhu aho ha misanga hawele yesele kwa mhela udo nakagula kulawa kwa lulelo lwa Hamoli, mhaza wa Shekemu kwa migwala miya imwe ja sendi. <verse eid="GEN 33:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 33:20"/>Ako, nakazenga honhu ha kulavila nhambiko na kuhachema Nguluwi ndo Nguluwi wa Isilaeli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">33:20 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Nguluwi ndo Nguluwi wa Isilaeli </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kwa Chiebulaniya yanguzeleka kota Eli Elohi Isilaeli.</char></note>.<verse eid="GEN 33:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 33"/>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="GEN 34"/>
  <para style="s">Simeoni na Lawi wanguhilula chibida kwa chiwalo cha lumbulyawo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 34:1"/>Zuwa limwe Dina, mhinza wa Yakobo na Lea, nakoka kuwajendela wadala wa isi ayo. <verse eid="GEN 34:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 34:2"/>Lelo Shekemu mwana wa Hamoli, Muhivi, nayawele mkulu wa isi ayo, loyamuwene Dina, nakambata na kuwasa na heye kwa lupichi na kumdita yone soni. <verse eid="GEN 34:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 34:3"/>Ila Shekemu nakanojezwa ng'hatu na ayo mhinza, nakamgana na nakaluka kumdedeza. <verse eid="GEN 34:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 34:4"/>Ahyo, Shekemu nakadogola na Hamoli mhaza wa heye, nakamlonjela, “Ndangulanda ndigalile ayo mhinza ndimhole yawe mchewangu.”<verse eid="GEN 34:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 34:5"/>Yakobo nakahulika kota mhinza wa heye Dina, nakaditikwa yawe mwavu na Shekemu, ila kwa vila wana wa heye nawali wodima migongolo, nakanyamalila mbaka lowahiluche. <verse eid="GEN 34:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 34:6"/>Hamoli mhaza wa Shekemu nakaluta kwa Yakobo leka yadogole na heye, <verse eid="GEN 34:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 34:7"/>na mhela wuwo wana walume wa Yakobo nawali wohiluka kulawa kudima migongolo. Lowahuliche ago, wasongolo awo nawona usungu ng'hatu na kuzudila ng'hatu, kwa vila Shekemu nayali yawabasile soni wanhu wa Isilaeli kwa kuwasa na mhinza wa Yakobo, mina mbuli ayo nailemezigwa ng'hatu.<verse eid="GEN 34:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 34:8"/>Ila Hamoli nakawalonjela, “Nhumbula ya mwana wa heni Shekemu nainojezwa ng'hatu na mhinza wa hemwe. Lelo dedede mumkundize yamhole. <verse eid="GEN 34:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 34:9"/>Tihole. Hetwe towahola wahinza wa hemwe, namwe mowahola wahinza wa hetwe. <verse eid="GEN 34:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 34:10"/>Ahyo mochikala hamwe na hetwe, mowa milejehe mli isi ayi. Mochikala amu, mgule na kuguza vinhu na muwe na honhu ha isi ayi.” <verse eid="GEN 34:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 34:11"/>Na kahi, Shekemu nakawalonjela mhaza wa Dina na wang'holoze, “Dedede, ndangulanda uganililo hali hemwe, nani ndowagalila choneche chomlonga. <verse eid="GEN 34:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 34:12"/>Mndonjele chasi choneche cha kulavya na ndolendole ya kuhesa, hanji na iwe ng'hulu ndaze, nani ndolavya, leka hela ndimhole mhinza ayu.”<verse eid="GEN 34:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 34:13"/>Lelo wana walume wa Yakobo nawamwidichila kwa kumhada Shekemu na mhaza wa heye Hamoli, kwa vila Shekemu nakamdita lumbulyawo Dina yawe mwavu. <verse eid="GEN 34:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 34:14"/>Nawawalonjela, “Hambe tumlavye lumbulyetu kwa munhu yohambe yenjile ikumbi. Kudita ahyo ndo kibasa soni kwa hetwe. <verse eid="GEN 34:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 34:15"/>Tochikundiza na wone modita chinhu achi hela. Muwe kota hetwe kwa kumwinjiza ikumbi chila mlume hali hemwe. <verse eid="GEN 34:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 34:16"/>Aho ndo towagalila wahinza wa hetwe na kuwahola wahinza wa hemwe, tochikala hamwe na hemwe na kuwa lukolo lumwe. <verse eid="GEN 34:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 34:17"/>Ila wone hatikundize na hetwe na kwinjila ikumbi, hetwe tomhola mhinza wa hetwe na kuka na heye.”<verse eid="GEN 34:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 34:18"/>Chowalonjile nachali chinoga kwa Hamoli na mwanage Shekemu. <verse eid="GEN 34:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 34:19"/>Msongolo ayo nahalemile kudita ahyo, kwa vila navyoyanojezwe na mhinza wa Yakobo. Na kahi, Shekemu ndo nayali yotogoligwa ng'hatu kusinda weng'ha hakaye ha mhaza wa heye.<verse eid="GEN 34:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 34:20"/>Lelo Hamoli na mwanage Shekemu nawaluta hali lwizi lwa muji, honhu ha nhing'hano, nawalonga na wanhu wa hewo, wolonga, <verse eid="GEN 34:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 34:21"/>“Wanhu wano tigana na hetwe. Hamba tuwabochele na kikala hali isi ya hetwe na kuguza na kugula vinhu, kwa vila twanayo isi ihejile kikala hetwe na hewo, hamba towahola wahinza wa hewo na hewo wowahola wahinza wa hetwe. <verse eid="GEN 34:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 34:22"/>Ila hewo wokunda kikala na hetwe na towa lukolo lumwe wone hetwe tokunda kudita ahi. Tomwinjiza ikumbi chila mlume hali hetwe kota hewo navyowenjile ikumbi. <verse eid="GEN 34:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 34:23"/>Ndaze, hamlingona kota migongolo ja hewo na lufufu lwawo lweng'ha vyowa vya hetwe? Lelo tikundize na hewo leka wekale hamwe na hetwe.” <verse eid="GEN 34:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 34:24"/>Walume weng'ha wowating'hane hala hali lwizi lwa muji awo, nawekundiza na Hamoli na mwanage Shekemu. Hamba walume weng'ha nawenjila ikumbi.<verse eid="GEN 34:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 34:25"/>Mazuwa gadatu hamba, wala wenjile ikumbi wowawele wang'hali na usungu ng'hatu, wana weli wa Yakobo, Simeoni na Lawi kalumbu wa Dina, nawahola mipanga ja hewo wauvada muji, baho du na kuwakopola walume weng'ha. <verse eid="GEN 34:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 34:26"/>Nawawakopola kwa mipanga Hamoli na mwanage Shekemu, nawamlavya Dina hali ng'handa ya Shekemu, nawoka. <verse eid="GEN 34:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 34:27"/>Kukopola ako lokupulute, wasongolo wanji wa Yakobo nawenjila hali muji awo na kuhola chila chinhu, kwa vila lumbulyawo nayali yaditikwe yawe mwavu. <verse eid="GEN 34:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 34:28"/>Nawahola ming'holo na mhene na misenga na midogowi na choneche chiwele kuli muji ama kumgunda. <verse eid="GEN 34:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 34:29"/>Nawawebata wana na wadala weng'ha na kuhola lufufu lweng'ha na choneche chiwele mli ng'handa za hewo.<verse eid="GEN 34:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 34:30"/>Hamba, Yakobo nakawalonjela Simeoni na Lawi, “Hemwe namungalila kugaya kwa kundita heni nzudilwe na wenyeng'haye wa isi ayi ya Wakanaani na Wapelisi. Heni ndahela wanhu wenji, wone wating'hane kuya kunhowa heni wong'hopola heni hamwe na wang'holozangu.” <verse eid="GEN 34:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 34:31"/>Hewo nawedichila, “Hambi nakakundigwa kumditila lumbulyetu kota mng'hondwa?”<verse eid="GEN 34:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 34"/>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="GEN 35"/>
  <para style="s">Yakobo kanguhiluka Beseli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 35:1"/>Zuwa limwe Nguluwi nakamlonjela Yakobo, “Waluche majendo, ulute kikala Beteli na kunzenjela honhu ha kulavila nhambiko heni Nguluwi yondikulawile mhela loumbilime mkulugo Esau.” <verse eid="GEN 35:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 35:2"/>Lelo Yakobo nakawalonjela wang'holoze na wanhu weng'ha wowali na heye, “Mtajile kutali jimalukolo ja milungu cha chijenzi jomlinajo, mihovuje na kuvala nguwo zinji. <verse eid="GEN 35:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 35:3"/>Hamba, toluta Beteli leka ndimzenjele honhu ha kulavila nhambiko Nguluwi yanhanzile zuwa lya kugaya, Nguluwi nayawele na heni heng'ha hondutile.” <verse eid="GEN 35:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 35:4"/>Lelo nawamha Yakobo jimalukolo jeng'ha ja milungu mijenzi najowali najo hamwe na vipuli navyowavalile mmakutu, na heye nakavitila hasi ha mwaloni nauwele behi na Shekemu.<verse eid="GEN 35:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 35:5"/>Yakobo na wanage nalowawele mlimajendo, Nguluwi nakawadumbiza ng'hatu wenyeng'haye wa miji jeng'ha ja habehi mbaka hawajezile kuwawinza. <verse eid="GEN 35:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 35:6"/>Yakobo hamwe na wanhu weng'ha nawoyawele nawo nawafika Lusu ichemigwe kahi Beteli kuli isi ya Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 35:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 35:7"/>Nakazenga honhu ha kulavila nhambiko na kuhachema honhu aho Eli-beteli kwa vila aho ndo honhu Nguluwi nayelajile kwa heye mhela naloyali yombilima mkulugwe. <verse eid="GEN 35:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 35:8"/>Debola chitumagwa wa Lebeka nakabagama, nakatiligwa hasi ha igodi lilinguchemigwa mwaloni nzingo ya kusini mwa Beteli. Lelo Yakobo nakahachema honhu aho Aloni-bakuti ilinguzeleka ibuyu lya kuzapila.<verse eid="GEN 35:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 35:9"/>Yakobo naloyahiluche kulawa Padani-alamu, Nguluwi nakamlawila kahi na kumtambichiza. <verse eid="GEN 35:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 35:10"/>Nguluwi nakamlonjela, “Itagwa lyako ndo Yakobo, ila huchemigwa ahyo kahi, sambi kochemigwa Isilaeli.” Lelo Yakobo nakachemigwa Isilaeli. <verse eid="GEN 35:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 35:11"/>Kahi Nguluwi nakamlonjela, “Heni ndo Nguluwi yawele na mong'ho. Uwe na wana wenji na mwonjezeche, kwa hegwe wolawila wanhu wenji wa nhanzi na nhanzi nyinji na wandewa. <verse eid="GEN 35:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 35:12"/>Isi yondiwapele Abulahamu na Isaka, ndokupa hegwe na wanago.” <verse eid="GEN 35:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 35:13"/>Lelo loyasindile kulonga na Yakobo, Nguluwi nakamleka. <verse eid="GEN 35:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 35:14"/>Yakobo nakemiza izengo honhu aho Nguluwi naloyalongase na heye, nakamjidila nhambiko ya chakunwa na mafuta. <verse eid="GEN 35:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 35:15"/>Lelo Yakobo nakahachema honhu aho loyalongase na Nguluwi, Beteli.<verse eid="GEN 35:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kupondigwa kwa Benjamini na kubagama kwa Laheli.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 35:16"/>Yakobo na ivyazi lya heye lyeng'ha nawalutilila na majendo ga hewo kulawila Beteli. Nalowali utali umwenga wang'hali kufika Efulata, Laheli nakebatikwa na usungu ung'hang'hale wa kuponda. <verse eid="GEN 35:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 35:17"/>Naye loyawele mli usungu awo, mkunga nakamlonjela, “Uleche kugozola, kuponda mwana yunji mlume.” <verse eid="GEN 35:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 35:18"/>Laheli aku yawele behi kubagama, nakamchema ayo mwana itagwa lya Beni-oni. Ila mhaza wa mwana nakamchema Benjamini. <verse eid="GEN 35:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 35:19"/>Laheli nakabagama na kutiligwa hafungo mwa nzila ilinguluta Efulata. Ayo ndo Betelehemu. <verse eid="GEN 35:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 35:20"/>Yakobo nakemiza izengo mchanya mwa chilaga cha Laheli liwele baho mbaka lehano. <verse eid="GEN 35:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 35:21"/>Isilaeli nakalutilila na majendo na kwesela naloyapulute Migidoli-edeli izeleche kota ilingo lya Edeli.<verse eid="GEN 35:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 35:22"/>Mhela Isilaeli naloyali yochikala muisi ayo, mwanage Lubeni, nakawasa na Biliha, mpogozi yawele kota mchewake mhaza wa heye, na heye Isilaeli nakahulika mbuli azo.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="GEN 35:22">Wana wa Yakobo</para>
  <para style="r" vid="GEN 35:22">(<ref loc="1CH 2:1-2">1 Mihela 2:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 35:22">Yakobo nayali na wana kumi na weli. <verse eid="GEN 35:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 35:23"/>Wana wa Lea nawali Lubeni, mlelwa wa mwaluko wa Yakobo, na Simeoni na Lawi na Yuda na Isakali na Sebuluni. <verse eid="GEN 35:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 35:24"/>Wana wa Laheli nawali Yusufu na Benjamini. <verse eid="GEN 35:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 35:25"/>Wana wapondigwe na Biliha, chitumagwa mdala wa Laheli, nawali Dani na Nafutali. <verse eid="GEN 35:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 35:26"/>Na wana wapondigwe na Silipa, chitumagwa mdala wa Lea, nawali Gadi na Asheli. Awo ndo wana wa Yakobo nayawapatile naloyawele kula Padani-alamu.<verse eid="GEN 35:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kubagama kwa Isaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 35:27"/>Yakobo nakoka nakuluta Mamle kwa mhaza wa heye Isaka, ako Kiliati-aliba, ako Hebuloni, honhu hawele Abulahamu na Isaka nawekale kota wajenzi. <verse eid="GEN 35:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 35:28"/>Isaka nayali na miyaka miya imwe na makumi nane, <verse eid="GEN 35:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 35:29"/>nakabagama yawele yalalile lukami na nakaza kilumba na wasekulu wa heye wamlongole. Wana wa heye Esau na Yakobo nawamtila.<verse eid="GEN 35:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 35"/>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="GEN 36"/>
  <para style="s">Lulelo lwa Esau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 36:1"/>Ayi ndo mbuli ya walelwa wa Esau, ahyo ndo Edomu. <verse eid="GEN 36:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 36:2"/>Esau nakahesa wadala Wakanaani, Ada mhinza Eloni Mhiti na Oholibama mhinza wa Ana na kahi mzukulu wa Sibeoni Muhivi <verse eid="GEN 36:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 36:3"/>na Basemati mhinza wa Ishimaeli, lumbulye Nebayoti. <verse eid="GEN 36:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 36:4"/>Ada nakampondela Esau Elifasi, na heye Basemati nakampondela Leueli. <verse eid="GEN 36:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 36:5"/>Oholibama nakampondela Yeushi na Yalamu na Kola. Awo ndo wana wa Esau woyawapatile naloyekale kuli isi ya Kanaani.<verse eid="GEN 36:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 36:6"/>Hamba Esau nakawahola wachewake na wanage walume na wadala na wanhu weng'ha wa haluga hake, na misenga na migongolo ja heye jinji na vinhu vya heye vyeng'ha navyoyapalile kuli isi ya Kanaani, nakahamila honhu hanji, kutali na mng'holoze Yakobo. <verse eid="GEN 36:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 36:7"/>Nakadita ahyo kwa vila vinhu vya hewo navyali vinji mbaka nawalemwela kikala hamwe. Isi nayowekale kota wajenzi nayali ndodo kwa winji wa vinhu navyowali navyo na misenga. <verse eid="GEN 36:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 36:8"/>Ahyo, Esau nakaluta kikala kuli isi ya vidunda vya Seili. Itagwa linji lya Esau ndo Edomu.<verse eid="GEN 36:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 36:9"/>Ayi ndo mbuli ya wana wa Esau, mhaza wa Edomu kuli vidunda vya Seili. <verse eid="GEN 36:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 36:10"/>Wana wa Esau wali Elifasi yapondigwe na Ada mchewake, na Leueli yapondigwe na Basemati mchewake yunji. <verse eid="GEN 36:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 36:11"/>Wana wa Elifasi wali Temani na Omali na Sefo na Gatamu na Kenasi. <verse eid="GEN 36:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 36:12"/>Elifasi nayali na mhawake itagwa lyake Timuna. Ayu nakampondela mwana itagwa lyake Amaleki. Wano nawali wana wa mchewake Esau nayachemigwe Ada <verse eid="GEN 36:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 36:13"/>Basemati mchewake Esau, nakamponda Leueli. Wana wa Leueli wali Nahati na Sela na Shama na Misa. <verse eid="GEN 36:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 36:14"/>Oholibama mhinza wa Ana, mhinza wa Sibeoni, nakampondela Esau wana wadatu, Yeushi na Yalamu na Kola.<verse eid="GEN 36:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 36:15"/>Awa ndo wakulu wa nhanzi ilawile kwa Esau. Elifasi, nayawele mlelwa wa mwaluko wa Esau nakawaponda Temani na Omali na Sefo na Kenasi <verse eid="GEN 36:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 36:16"/>na Kola na Gatamu na Amaleki, chila yumwe wa hewo nayali mkulu wa nhanzi ya heye. Awo weng'ha ndo wana wa Elifasi kuli isi ya Edomu, nawalawile kwa Ada mchewake Esau. <verse eid="GEN 36:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 36:17"/>Leueli, mwanage Esau, nakawaponda Nahati na Sela na Shama na Misa. Chila yumwe nayali mkulu wa nhanzi ya heye. Awo weng'ha ndo wana wa Leueli kuli isi ya Edomu nawalawile kwa Basemati mchewake Esau. <verse eid="GEN 36:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 36:18"/>Wana wa Oholibama mchewake Esau nawali, Yeushi na Yalamu na Kola, chila yumwe nayali mkulu wa nhanzi ya heye. Awo weng'ha ndo wana wa Oholibama mhinza wa Ana, mchewake Esau. <verse eid="GEN 36:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 36:19"/>Lelo awo ndo walelwa wa Esau mina ndo Edomu, chila yumwe nayawele mkulu wa nhanzi ya heye.<verse eid="GEN 36:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Walelwa wa Seili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 1:38-42">1 Mihela 1:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 36:20"/>Awa ndo walelwa wa Seili Mholi, na ndo wenyeng'haye wa isi ayo, Lotani na Shobali na Sibeoni na Ana <verse eid="GEN 36:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 36:21"/>na Dishoni na Eseli na Dishani, chila yumwe nayali mkulu wa nhanzi ya heye mli wala Waholi wa lulelo lwa Seili, kuli isi ya Edomu. <verse eid="GEN 36:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 36:22"/>Wana wa Lotani nawali Holi na Hemani, na lumbulye Lotani nayachemigwe Timuna. <verse eid="GEN 36:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 36:23"/>Wana wa Shobali nawali Alivani na Manahasi na Ebali na Shefo na Onamu. <verse eid="GEN 36:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 36:24"/>Wana wa Sibeoni nawali Aya na Ana. Ana nandoyaziwene nzasa za mazi gapwituche kuchiwala, naloyali yodima midogowi ja mhaza wa heye Sibeoni. <verse eid="GEN 36:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 36:25"/>Wana wa Ana nawali Dishoni na mhinza yumwe itagwa lyake Oholibama. <verse eid="GEN 36:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 36:26"/>Wana walume wa Dishoni nawali Hemdani na Eshibani na Itilani na Kelani. <verse eid="GEN 36:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 36:27"/>Wana walume wa Eseli nawali Bilihani na Saawani na Akani. <verse eid="GEN 36:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 36:28"/>Wana walume wa Dishani nawali Usi na Alani. <verse eid="GEN 36:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 36:29"/>Lelo awo ndo wakulu wa Waholi, Lotani na Shobali na Sibeoni na Ana <verse eid="GEN 36:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 36:30"/>na Dishoni na Eseli na Dishani, chila yumwe wa hewo yawele mkulu wa nhanzi ya Waholi kuli isi ya Seili.<verse eid="GEN 36:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wandewa wa isi ya Edomu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 1:43-54">1 Mihela 1:43-54</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 36:31"/>Awa ndo wandewa nawalongoze isi ya Edomu, lokung'hali kuduhu mndewa ne yumwe yalongoze Waisilaeli. <verse eid="GEN 36:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 36:32"/>Bela, mwana Beoli, nakalongoza isi ya Edomu yawele na ng'handa ya undewa kuli muji wa Dinaba. <verse eid="GEN 36:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 36:33"/>Bela loyabagame, Yobabu mwana wa Sela kulawa Bosila nakalongoza honhu hake. <verse eid="GEN 36:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 36:34"/>Yobabu loyabagame, Hushamu wa isi ya Watemani, nakalongoza honhu hake. <verse eid="GEN 36:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 36:35"/>Hushamu loyabagame, Hadadi mwana wa Bedadi nakalongoza honhu hake, ng'handa ya heye ya undewa nayali kuli muji wa Aviti. Ayu ndo nayawatowile na kuwasumya Wamidiani kuli isi ya Moabu. <verse eid="GEN 36:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 36:36"/>Hadadi loyabagame, Samula kulawila Masileka, nakalongoza honhu hake. <verse eid="GEN 36:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 36:37"/>Samula loyabagame, Shauli kulawila Lehoboti, muji uwele behi na lwanda lwa Eyufulate, nakalongoza honhu hake. <verse eid="GEN 36:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 36:38"/>Shauli loyabagame, Baali-hanani, mwana wa Akiboli, nakalongoza honhu hake. <verse eid="GEN 36:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 36:39"/>Baali-hanani loyabagame, Hadadi nakalongoza honhu hake, na itagwa lya muji wa heye liwa Pau. Mchewake Akiboli nayali Mehetabeli, mhinza wa Matiledi na mzukulu wa Mesahabu. <verse eid="GEN 36:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 36:40"/>Wakulu wa nhanzi zilawile kwa Esau, kota nhanzi za hewo na honhu hao ha kikala, wali Timuna na Aluva na Yeteti <verse eid="GEN 36:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 36:41"/>na Oholibama na Ela na Pinoni <verse eid="GEN 36:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 36:42"/>na Kenasi na Temani na Mibisali <verse eid="GEN 36:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 36:43"/>na Magidieli na Ilamu. Awo ndo wakulu wa Edomu, wachemigwa kulawa honhu hawo kuli honhu ha isi nazowekale. Esau nayali sekulu wa Waedomu.<verse eid="GEN 36:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 36"/>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="GEN 37"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 37:1"/>Yakobo nakalutilila kikala kuli isi ya Kanaani, moyali ngikala mhaza wa heye kota mjenzi. <verse eid="GEN 37:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 37:2"/>Ayi ndo mbuli ya lukolo lwa Yakobo, Yusufu naloyali msongolo wa miyaka kumi na saba, nayali yodima ming'holo na mhene hamwe na wang'holoze, wana wa Biliha na Silipa wadala wa mhaza wa heye. Yusufu nayali yomlonjela mhaza wa heye mbuli za wihe wa wang'holoze. <verse eid="GEN 37:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 37:3"/>Isilaeli nakamgana lukami Yusufu kusinda wana weng'ha, kwa vila nakapondigwa mhela wa ulalilo wa heye na nakamhonela Yusufu ikanzu lya chiuyeng'ha linoligwe ng'hatu. <verse eid="GEN 37:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 37:4"/>Ila wang'holoze vyowawene kota mhaza wa hewo nakamgana Yusufu kusinda hewo, nawamzudila ne kulonga na heye goya.<verse eid="GEN 37:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yusufu kangulota</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 37:5"/>Nechilo imwe, Yusufu nakalota, ila loyawasimile wang'holoze, hewo nawamzudila ng'hatu. <verse eid="GEN 37:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 37:6"/>Nakawalonjela, “Mhulichize vyondotile. <verse eid="GEN 37:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 37:7"/>Nandota kota tweng'ha twali kumgunda tukoweleza nyhinza na baho du nyhinza ya heni nazima wima. Nyhinza za hemwe, nazikungajiza na kuzunguluta na kinamizila nyhinza ya heni.” <verse eid="GEN 37:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 37:8"/>Wang'holoze nawamuuza, “Ndaze, kwangugana kutulonjela kota kotulongoza? Ama kowa na ludali kwa hetwe?” Lelo walutilila kumzudila ng'hatu kwa mbuli ya kulota na ulonzi wa heye. <verse eid="GEN 37:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 37:9"/>Hamba Yusufu nakalota kahi, nakawasimila wang'holoze yolonga, “Mhulichize, ndota kahi, nambona nhondwe kumi na imwe na isanya na nyelezi, nazinamizila heni.” <verse eid="GEN 37:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 37:10"/>Loyamsimile mhaza na wang'holoze kulota ako, mhaza wa heye nakamng'hanuchila yolonga, “Ndo kulota kwachi ako koulotile? Ndaze, yotulapa heni na mayako na wang'holozo kuya na kinamiza hasi hamwando ha hegwe kukutogola?” <verse eid="GEN 37:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 37:11"/>Wang'holoze nawamonela fihi, ila mhaza wa heye nakalutilila kijesa mbuli ayo.<verse eid="GEN 37:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yusufu nakaguzigwa na wang'holoze</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 37:12"/>Zuwa limwe, wang'holoze Yusufu nawaluta kudima misenga ja mhaza wa heye behi na Shekemu. <verse eid="GEN 37:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 37:13"/>Isilaeli nakamlonjela Yusufu, “Kuvizela kota wang'holozo wangudima migongolo kula Shekemu. Lelo ndangugana ndikulajize kwa hewo.” Yusufu nakedichila, “Heni nda goya.” <verse eid="GEN 37:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 37:14"/>Mhaza wa heye nakamlonjela, “Ulute ukawalole wang'holozo na migongolo wone wawele wakomu hamba uye undonjele.” Yakobo nakamlajiza Yusufu kulawila ibindi lya Hebuloni. Yusufu naloyawele behi na Shekemu, <verse eid="GEN 37:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 37:15"/>munhu yumwe nakamfika yolubaluba mchiwala, nakamuuza, “Kwangupala choni?” <verse eid="GEN 37:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 37:16"/>Yusufu nakamwidichila, “Ndanguwapala wang'holozangu, dedede, undonjele honhu howali ngudima migongolo.” <verse eid="GEN 37:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 37:17"/>Yula munhu nakamlonjela, “Ndangijesa kota mina woka, kwa vila nandiwahulika wolonga kota wanguluta Dotani.” Lelo Yusufu nakawawinza wang'holoze nakawafika ako Dotani.<verse eid="GEN 37:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 37:18"/>Wang'holoze lowamuwene yang'hali kutali, hanoya behi, nawaheha wogana wamkopole. <verse eid="GEN 37:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 37:19"/>Nawalongasa, “Mloleni! Yula yalingulota kanguya. <verse eid="GEN 37:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 37:20"/>Natumkopole na kumtoza mli izimbo lilihela mazi, hamba tolonga kota nakadakuligwa na igongolo ling'hang'hale lya kisolo. Hamba tolola ako kulota kwa heye kowa ndaze.” <verse eid="GEN 37:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 37:21"/>Ila Lubeni loyahuliche luzi alo, nakagana kumlohola mli moko gawo, nakawalonjela wang'holoze, “Dedede, tuleche kumkopola. <verse eid="GEN 37:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 37:22"/>Mleche kubohola danda. Ila mumjele amu mli ideho hano mchiwala, ila mleche kumlumiza.” Nakalonga ahyo leka yamlohole mmoko mwa hewo, na hamba yamhiluse kwa mhaza wa heye. <verse eid="GEN 37:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 37:23"/>Yusufu loyawafichile wang'holoze, nawamvula ikanzu lya chiuyeng'ha linoligwe. <verse eid="GEN 37:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 37:24"/>Hamba wamibata na kumtoza kuli ideho, ila ideho lila nahaliwele na mazi.<verse eid="GEN 37:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 37:25"/>Lowekalise kulya, nawona majendo ga Waishimaeli wojenda kulawila Gileadi kuza Misili. Ngamiya wa hewo nawapapa ubani na mafuta ga mono na manemane. <verse eid="GEN 37:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 37:26"/>Aho Yuda nakawalonjela wang'holoze, “Topegwa choni wone tumkopole mng'holozetu, na kuvisa kukopola kwa heye?. <verse eid="GEN 37:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 37:27"/>Inoga tumguze kwa awa Waishimaeli, ila tuleche kudita chinhu chiwala ukomu wa heye, kwa vila heye ka mng'holozetu na twaivyazi limwe.” Wang'holoze nawakunda ga heye. <verse eid="GEN 37:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 37:28"/>Waguzaji na wagulaji Wamidiani lowafichile honhu hala, awo wang'holoze wamlavya Yusufu kuli ideho na wamguza kwa Waishimaeli kwa migwala makumi meli, nawo nawamhola Yusufu mbaka Misili.<verse eid="GEN 37:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 37:29"/>Lubeni loyahiluche kuli lila ideho, nahamuwene Yusufu kahi, nakadega nguwo zoyavalile kwa masinzo. <verse eid="GEN 37:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 37:30"/>Nakawalutila wang'holoze na kuwalonjela, “Msongolo ka haduhu, nani ndute kohi?” <verse eid="GEN 37:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 37:31"/>Nawalidumula singo ipongo limwe, nawahola ikanzu lya Yusufu na kwinjiza mli danda ya ila mhene. <verse eid="GEN 37:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 37:32"/>Hamba wamhilichila lila ikanzu mhaza wa hewo, na kumlonjela, “Natulokota ikanzu ali, lole tandi, liwhana kota lya mwanago ama hebu.” <verse eid="GEN 37:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 37:33"/>Mhaza wa hewo nakalizela lila ikanzu, nakalonga, “Ena ng'hatu! Ndangijesa kota ne lunhwinhwi igongolo ling'hang'hale lya kisolo nalimdakula. Ndangukunda Yusufu kadumuligwa viwundewunde.” <verse eid="GEN 37:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 37:34"/>Aho Yakobo nakadega nguwo zoyavalile kwa masinzo na kuvala igunila mchuno kwa kulajila masinzo. Nakamlilila mwanage kwa mhela wa mazuwa menji. <verse eid="GEN 37:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 37:35"/>Wanage walume na wadala nawoya kumhembuliza, ila heye nakalema kuhembulizwa yolonga, “Mndeche ndolutilila kulombocheza kwa mbuli ya mwana wa heni, mbaka hondibagama na kuluta kuli isi ya wabagame koyawele mwana wa heni”. Yakobo nandovyoyamlilile mwanage. <verse eid="GEN 37:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 37:36"/>Mhela awo kula Misili wala Wamidiani nawamguza Yusufu kwa munhu nayachemigwe Potifa, nayawele mng'hangala wa chimwe cha vilundo vya wamizi vya Falao.<verse eid="GEN 37:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 37"/>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="GEN 38"/>
  <para style="s">Yuda na Tamali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 38:1"/>Mhela awo Yuda nakebagula na wang'holoze, nakaluta kikala na munhu yumwe Mwadulami itagwa lyake Hila. <verse eid="GEN 38:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 38:2"/>Loyali ako, Yuda nakamona mhinza wa Shua, Mkanaani, nakamhesa na kuwasa na heye. <verse eid="GEN 38:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 38:3"/>Mhinza wa Shua nakebata himila, nakaponda mwana mlume, Yuda nakamchema Eli. <verse eid="GEN 38:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 38:4"/>Nakahola himila inji, nakaponda mwana mlume, nakamchema Onani. <verse eid="GEN 38:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 38:5"/>Hamba nakaponda mwana yunji mlume, nakamchema Shela. Mhela Shela loyapondigwe, Yuda nayali Kesibu. <verse eid="GEN 38:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 38:6"/>Hamba Yuda nakamhesela mwanage wa mwaluko Eli, kwa mdala yachemigwe Tamali. <verse eid="GEN 38:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 38:7"/>Ila Eli, mlelwa wa mwaluko wa Yuda, nayali na wihe hameho ha Mkulu Nguluwi, ahyo Mkulu Nguluwi nakamkopola. <verse eid="GEN 38:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 38:8"/>Yuda nakamlonjela Onani, “Mhole mdala wa mng'holozo yabagame, ahyo kota vyoilinguganigwa kudita leka umpondele mng'holozo wana kulawa kwa mlamugo.” <verse eid="GEN 38:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 38:9"/>Ila Onani nakavizela kota awo wana hawowa wa heye. Ahyo, loyawasile na mdala wa mng'holoze nakabohola hasi nyhadikwa za lulelo, yolema kumpondela mng'holoze wana. <verse eid="GEN 38:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 38:10"/>Chinhu achi chihile ng'hatu hali meho ga Mkulu Nguluwi, nakamkopola Onani kahi. <verse eid="GEN 38:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 38:11"/>Ndo Yuda nakamlonjela Tamali, mdala wa mwanage, “Uhiluche kaye kwa mhaza wa hegwe, upone kuko ne kuhesigwa mbaka mwana wa heni Shela hoyowa msongolo.” Yuda nakadumba Shela kota kobagama kota wang'holoze. Lelo Tamali nakahiluka kaye kwa mhaza wa heye.<verse eid="GEN 38:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 38:12"/>Hamba mhinza wa Shua, mdala wa Yuda nakabagama. Yuda loyasindile kuwasiliza matanga, nakaluta na mganwa wa heye Hila, Mwadulami, nawaluta Timuna kwa wadumula milaika ja ming'holo ja heye. <verse eid="GEN 38:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 38:13"/>Tamali loyahuliche kota mgosi wa heye nayali mnzila kuluta Timuna kudumula milaika ja ming'holo ja heye, <verse eid="GEN 38:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 38:14"/>nakavula nguwo za mlekwa, na kigubika nguwo lukuli na kumeho, hamba kaza kikala honhu hawele na lwizi lwa Enaimu, chijiji nachiwele mnzila kuza Timuna. Nakadita ahyo, kwa vila nakona kota Shela nayali msongolo ila heye Tamali nahahesigwe yawe mdala wa heye.<verse eid="GEN 38:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 38:15"/>Yuda nakamfika Tamali aho, nakejesa kota kamdala mng'hondwa, kwa vila nakegubika kumeho. <verse eid="GEN 38:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 38:16"/>Aho ne kuvizela kota ayo nayali mdala wa mwanage, nakamlutila hala hafungo mwa nzila na kumlonjela, “Ndagugana kuwasa nagwe.” Tamali nakamuuza, “Komha choni hondikunda?” <verse eid="GEN 38:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 38:17"/>Yuda nakamwidichila, “Ndokupa kanyehe ka mhene mli chilundo cha heni.” Tamali nakamlonjela, “Wilahe na undechele chinhu kota chilajilo cha kungalila ako kanyehe.” <verse eid="GEN 38:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 38:18"/>Yuda nakamuuza, “Kwangugana ndikupe choni chiwe ulajilo?” Na heye nakamwidichila, “Umhe ayo pete iwele na ulajilo wa hegwe na ng'weso ya pete ayo na ayo ng'hweku ndivibate.” Yuda nakamha vinhu avyo vyeng'ha, nakawasa naye. Baho Tamali nakebata himila ya heye. <verse eid="GEN 38:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 38:19"/>Tamali nakahiluka kaye, nakavula nguwo nazoyavalile nakuvala kahi nguwo za heye za ulekwa.<verse eid="GEN 38:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 38:20"/>Mhela Yuda loyamlajize Mwadulami yamhilichile kala kanyehe yula mdala leka yahiluse vinhu vyoyampele kota ulajilo, Hila nahamfichile. <verse eid="GEN 38:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 38:21"/>Hila nakawauza wenyeng'haye wa Enaimu, “Kakohi yula mdala mng'hondwa nayawele hafungo mwa nzila behi na hano?” Wamwidichila, “Enaimu hakuwele na mdala mng'hondwa.” <verse eid="GEN 38:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 38:22"/>Ayo munhu nakahiluka kwa Yuda, nakamlonjela, “Simuwene. Kahi wenyeng'haye wa ako nawandonjela kota hakuwele na mdala mng'hondwa yoneche ako.” Wadala wanji nawali wodita ung'hondwa kota honhu ha kujifugamila jimalukolo jawo <verse eid="GEN 38:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 38:23"/>Yuda nakalonga, “Leche yahole vinhu avyo, hanji kotudita tusechigwe. Hegwe baho kona kota nandimigalila kanyehe, ila humuwene.”<verse eid="GEN 38:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 38:24"/>Lojikwete myezi jidatu, Yuda nakahulika kota, “Tamali mdala wa mwanage, kagaluka mng'hondwa, kahi kana himila kwa kudita ung'hondwa.” Yuda nakalajiza, “Mlavyeni kunze yasomigwe na chiluli.” <verse eid="GEN 38:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 38:25"/>Lowali womlavya kunze, Tamali nakalajiza usenga kwa mgosi wa heye yolonga, “Yawele na vinhu avi ndo yamhele himila. Lelo ndangugana umzele munhu yawele na pete ayi na ng'weso na ng'hweku ayi.” <verse eid="GEN 38:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 38:26"/>Yuda nakavizela vinhu avyo, nakalonga, “Tamali ndo yatanganiche kusinda heni, mina ndangukomya, simhesile heye kwa mwana wa heni Shela.” Kulawila zuwa alyo, Yuda hawasile kahi na Tamali.<verse eid="GEN 38:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 38:27"/>Mhela wa kuponda Tamali loufichile, naizeleka kota kana wanyambili. <verse eid="GEN 38:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 38:28"/>Usungu wa kuponda lowaluche, mwana yumwe nakalavya moko kunze, na heye mkunga kauwoha ng'weso ndung'hu, yolonga, “Ayu ndo yapondigwe mwaluko.” <verse eid="GEN 38:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 38:29"/>Ila mwana ayo loyahiluse moko mgati, mng'holoze nakatoma kupondigwa. Mkunga nakalonga, “Ndaze hegwe kupondigwa kwa lupichi?” Ahyo, nakachemigwa Pelesi. <verse eid="GEN 38:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 38:30"/>Hamba mng'holoze nakapondigwa yawele na ng'weso ndung'hu mmoko, na heye nakachemigwa Sela.<verse eid="GEN 38:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 38"/>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="GEN 39"/>
  <para style="s">Mdala wa Potifa na Yusufu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 39:1"/>Yusufu loyaholigwe mbaka Misili, Mmisili yumwe nayachemigwe Potifa yawele chilongozi wa Falao na chilongozi wa chilundo cha heye cha wamizi, nakamgula kulawa kwa Waishimaeli wamigale Misili. <verse eid="GEN 39:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 39:2"/>Mkulu Nguluwi, nayali hamwe na heye Yusufu, nakamdita yasumye ng'hatu. Yusufu nayali yochikala mli ng'handa ya mkulu wa heye Mmisili. <verse eid="GEN 39:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 39:3"/>Ayu mkulu wa heye nakavizela kota Mkulu Nguluwi nayali hamwe na Yusufu na ndo heye yaditile yasumye geng'ha yalingudita Yusufu. <verse eid="GEN 39:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 39:4"/>Yusufu nakaganika ng'hatu hali Potifa na ndo yawele chitumagwa wa heye nakadita yawe chilongozi wa ng'handa ya heye na lufufu lweng'ha. <verse eid="GEN 39:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 39:5"/>Kulawila mhela Potifa loyamditile Yusufu yawe mwamizi wa ng'handa ya heye na mwamizi wa lufufu lwake, Mkulu Nguluwi nakaitambichiza ng'handa ya ayo Mmisili kwa mbuli ya Yusufu. Utambichizo wa Mkulu Nguluwi uwa kwa chila chinhu choyawele nacho haluga na kumgunda. <verse eid="GEN 39:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 39:6"/>Kwa mbuli ayo, Potifa nakamha ludali lwa vinhu vya heye vyeng'ha, na heye Potifa, nakaleka kudita choneche chila ila kulya chilyo cha heye yeka.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 39:6">Yusufu nayali msongolo yanojile na wa kuganigwa. <verse eid="GEN 39:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 39:7"/>Loukwete mhela udo hela, mdala wa Potifa nakanojezwa na heye Yusufu nakamlonjela, “Uwase na heni.” <verse eid="GEN 39:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 39:8"/>Ila Yusufu nakalema na kumlojela ayo mdala wa Potifa, “Hebu! Mkulu wa heni kamha ludali lwa chila chinhu hano haluga, na kwa vila ndahano, kahela lunhwinhwi kuwala chinhu choneche. <verse eid="GEN 39:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 39:9"/>Ahano haluga heye kahela ludali kusinda heni. Heye handemeze kibata choneche ila hegwe kwa vila kwa mchewake. Lelo yowa ndaze ndite wihe ukulu na gehile hali Nguluwi.” <verse eid="GEN 39:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 39:10"/>Ayo mdala nakalutilila kumlanda Yusufu chila zuwa, ila Yusufu nahamhulichize na kukunda kikala behi na heye ama kuwasa na heye.<verse eid="GEN 39:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 39:11"/>Zuwa limwe Yusufu nakenjila mng'handa kukola mijito kota vyoilinguganigwa, nayali yeka kwa vila walume wanji nawakolasa hamwe mijito nawali haduhu haluga. <verse eid="GEN 39:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 39:12"/>Mdala wa Potifa nakamibata ikanzu lyake na kumlonjela, “Uwase na heni.” Ila Yusufu nakamlechela lila ikanzu mmoko mwa heye nakabilimila kunze. <verse eid="GEN 39:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 39:13"/>Aho yula mdala loyawene Yusufu nakamlechela igolole mmoko mwa heye nakabilimila kunze, <verse eid="GEN 39:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 39:14"/>nakawachema vitumagwa wa ng'handa ya heye na kuwalonjela, “Loleni! Ayu Muebulaniya yotugalilwe kangutubasa soni. Nakoya kwa heni yogana kimbata kwa lupichi, ila heni nanhowa iyowe.” <verse eid="GEN 39:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 39:15"/>Loyahuliche nditowa iyowe, nakalileka igolole lyake, na kubilimila kunze. <verse eid="GEN 39:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 39:16"/>Yula mdala nakaliwika behi na heye lila igolole mbaka mlume wa heye loyahiluche haluga. <verse eid="GEN 39:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 39:17"/>Nakamsimila mbuli ila yolonga, “Ayu chitumagwa Muebulaniya umigale kwa hetwe, nakambuyila kumbasa soni.” <verse eid="GEN 39:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 39:18"/>Ila baho du lonhowile iyowe, nakalileka igolole lyake na kubilimila kunze.<verse eid="GEN 39:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 39:19"/>Mkulu wa Yusufu loyahuliche ulonzi wa mchewake, kota chitumagwa wa heye ndovyoyaditile, nakazudila lukami. <verse eid="GEN 39:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 39:20"/>Nakamhola Yusufu na kumhindila mchinweng'ho, honhu nahowahindilwe wanhu wawele na nongwa kwa mndewa. Ahyo Yusufu nakapona hala mchinweng'ho. <verse eid="GEN 39:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 39:21"/>Ila mbaka amo mchinweng'ho, Mkulu Nguluwi nayali hamwe na Yusufu, yomditila igano lya kwimilila mbaka kumdita yaganigwe hali mkulu wa chinweng'ho. <verse eid="GEN 39:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 39:22"/>Ayo mkulu wa chinweng'ho nakamuwika Yusufu yawe chilongozi wa weng'ha wawele mchinweng'ho. Chila chinhu chiditikwe amo, nachiditikwa kwa ludali lwake. <verse eid="GEN 39:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 39:23"/>Ayo mkulu wa chinweng'ho nahajesile chinhu choneche chila choyapegwe Yusufu, kwa vila Mkulu Nguluwi nayali hamwe na Yusufu na nakasumya chila chinhu choyaditile.<verse eid="GEN 39:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 39"/>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="GEN 40"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 40:1"/>Mhela wunji lozikwete mbuli azo, vilongozi weli wa mndewa wa Misili nawamditila wihe mndewa. Vilongozi awo wali mlolela vyakunwa mkulu na mgongomanya mibumunda mkulu wa mndewa. <verse eid="GEN 40:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 40:2"/>Falao nakazudizwa ng'hatu na awo vilongozi weli, <verse eid="GEN 40:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 40:3"/>nakawahindila mgati mwa chinweng'ho cha mkulu wa chilundo cha wamizi honhu nahoyahindilwe Yusufu. <verse eid="GEN 40:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 40:4"/>Mkulu wa chilundo cha wamizi nakamhagula Yusufu yawe chitumagwa wa hewo. Nawo nawekala mchinweng'ho mhela umwenga.<verse eid="GEN 40:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 40:5"/>Nechilo imwe, yula mlolela vyakunwa mkulu, na yula mgongomanya mibumunda mkulu wa mndewa wa Misili, chila yumwe nakalota ilivinji na chila ulotezi nawali na utang'huzi ulivinji. <verse eid="GEN 40:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 40:6"/>Yusufu loyalutile kwa hewo lufuku kuwalola, weng'ha weli wali na lunhwinhwi. <verse eid="GEN 40:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 40:7"/>Yusufu nakawauza awo vilongozi wa Falao nawawele mchinweng'ho hamwe na heye, mng'handa mwa mkulu wa heye, “Ndaze, lehano mwangoneka mna masinzo?” <verse eid="GEN 40:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 40:8"/>Nawamwidichila, “Tuna masinzo kwa vila kuduhu munhu ne yumwe yatutang'ulile vyotulotile.” Yusufu nakawalonjela, “Ndaze, kutang'hula kulota aku haiwa mijito ja Nguluwi? Lelo mndonjele kulota kwa hemwe.”<verse eid="GEN 40:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 40:9"/>Mlolela vyakunwa mkulu wa mndewa nakamsimila Yusufu vyoyalotile yolonga, “Nandota hino, nambona mzabibu kumwando kwa heni, <verse eid="GEN 40:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 40:10"/>nawo wali na nhagala zidatu. Baho du, lowaluche kutitima mahamba, uluwa ubahula, na ving'honyo vyake viwa zabibu zipile. <verse eid="GEN 40:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 40:11"/>Mmoko mwangu ndali na chizombe cha Falao, ng'hama zabibu mli chizombe acho, na ndimha Falao.” <verse eid="GEN 40:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 40:12"/>Yusufu nakamlonjela ayo chitumagwa, “Kutang'hula kwa vyoulotile ndo hino, zila nhagala zidatu ndo mazuwa gadatu. <verse eid="GEN 40:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 40:13"/>Logopuluta mazuwa gadatu, Falao kokwinula nakolawa mchinweng'ho na kukuhilusa kahi mli ulongozi louwele nawo. Koweza kahi kumha Falao chizombe mmoko kota vyowali udita aho katali. <verse eid="GEN 40:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 40:14"/>Ila dedede, uleche kusemwa ndiyago mhela mbuli hozikulutila goya, unhowanhile na kunyhema hali Falao nani ndawe amu mchinweng'ho. <verse eid="GEN 40:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 40:15"/>Mina heni nyholigwa kuli isi ya Waebulaniya na hano Misili siditile choneche chindapa mbichigwe mchinweng'ho.”<verse eid="GEN 40:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 40:16"/>Yula mgongomanya mibumunda mkulu, loyawene utang'huzi ula unoga, nakamlonjela Yusufu, “Na heni nandota, ndidwiche kumutwi nyhelo zidatu za mibumunda. <verse eid="GEN 40:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 40:17"/>Kuli luhelo lwa kuchanya, mwali na vilyo vinji vitelechigwe kwa mbuli ya mnvina ya Falao. Ila videje vyali vidobola na kulya kuli luhelo alo naluwele kumutwi wa heni.” <verse eid="GEN 40:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 40:18"/>Yusufu nakamlonjela, “Ulaguzi wa vyoulotile ndo awu, zila nyhelo zidatu ndo mazuwa gadatu. <verse eid="GEN 40:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 40:19"/>Logopuluta mazuwa gadatu, Falao kokulavya mchinweng'ho, kowinula mutwi wa hegwe na kuniniza lukuli mchanya mli igodi, navyo videje vyolya lukuli lwako.”<verse eid="GEN 40:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 40:20"/>Kuli zuwa lya kadatu, iwele ndo zuwa lya mnvina ya kukumbuchila kupondigwa kwa Falao nakawawichila chilyo wakulu wa heye weng'ha. Nakawalavya mchinweng'ho mlolela vyakunwa mkulu na mgongomanya mibumunda mkulu, nakawawika hali wakulu wanji wa heye. <verse eid="GEN 40:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 40:21"/>Hamba nakamhilusila ukulu yula mlolela vyakunwa, leka yamigalile Falao chizombe. <verse eid="GEN 40:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 40:22"/>Ila yula mgongomanya mibumunda nakamniniza kuli igodi, kota Yusufu navyoyatang'ule kulota kwa hewo. <verse eid="GEN 40:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 40:23"/>Ahyo, yula mlolela vyakunwa nakamsemwa Yusufu, honhu ha kumkumbuka.<verse eid="GEN 40:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 40"/>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="GEN 41"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 41:1"/>Lojikwete miyaka mili, Falao nakalota, nakewona yemile hafungo mwa lwanda lwa Naili, <verse eid="GEN 41:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 41:2"/>nakona misenga saba jinenehe na kunojeza jilawa mlwanda lwa Naili na kuya kulya misolo. <verse eid="GEN 41:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 41:3"/>Hamba misenga jinji saba jigandile na jihile ng'hatu najilawa mlwanda lwa Naili, juya na kwima behi na jila misenga jinenehe hafungo mwa lwanda. <verse eid="GEN 41:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 41:4"/>Ajo misenga jigandile lukami najiwalya jila misenga jinenehe, aho Falao nakalilimka. <verse eid="GEN 41:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 41:5"/>Loyawasile kahi, nakalota lwa keli, nakona miso mikulu saba ja uhemba na jititime jizuchile mli ibeleje limwe. <verse eid="GEN 41:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 41:6"/>Hamba logakwete ago, miso jinji saba mizisili jikalile kwa ivuche lya mbeho kulawa kugunuche nalilawila. <verse eid="GEN 41:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 41:7"/>Ajo miso saba, najimela jila miso saba jitiliwale jinenehe na jiwele na nyhule nyinji. Falao loyalilimche, nakavizela kota nayali yolota. <verse eid="GEN 41:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 41:8"/>Lokubwemwenzuche, Falao yawele na lunhwinhwi lukami, nakawachema wahawi weng'ha wa Misili na wawele wasomile lukami na kuwalonjela navyoyalotile, ila kuduhu ne yumwe yadahile kutang'ula vyoyalotile.<verse eid="GEN 41:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 41:9"/>Ndo yula mlolela vyakunwa mkulu nakamlonjela Falao kata, “Lehano ndangukumbuchila hala londitile gehile ga heni. <verse eid="GEN 41:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 41:10"/>Mhela wula loutuzudile hetwe vitumagwa wa Falao, heni na mgongomanya mibumunda, nakutuhindila mng'handa mwa ngome ya mkulu wa chilundo cha wamizi. <verse eid="GEN 41:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 41:11"/>Nechilo imwe natulota, chila yumwe nakalota ilivinji na chila ulotezi nawali na utang'huzi ulivinji. <verse eid="GEN 41:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 41:12"/>Lelo msongolo yumwe Muebulaniya, chitumagwa wa mkulu wa wamizi, nayali hamwe na hetwe mchinweng'ho. Lotumsimile kulota kwa hetwe, na heye nakatutang'ulila chila yumwe wa hetwe choyalotile. <verse eid="GEN 41:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 41:13"/>Na iwa kota vila vyoyatutang'ulile. Heni nanyiluswa kuli mijito ja heni na yula mgongomanya mibumunda nakaninizwa kuli igodi.”<verse eid="GEN 41:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 41:14"/>Lelo Falao nakahilika wanhu, nakamchema Yusufu, nawamigala himahima kulawila kuchinweng'ho. Nakabeya mnvili na kuvala nguwo zinji na kwinjila kwa Falao. <verse eid="GEN 41:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 41:15"/>Falao nakamlonjela Yusufu, “Ndota ila kuduhu munhu yadahile kutang'hula. Nanyhulika lutogo lwa hegwe kota wone munhu yakulonjele kulota kwa heye koweza kutang'hula.” <verse eid="GEN 41:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 41:16"/>Yusufu nakamwidichila Falao, “Ndahela uwanzi awo, ila Nguluwi kokwidichila vitanganiche.” <verse eid="GEN 41:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 41:17"/>Aho Falao nakamlonjela Yusufu, “Nandota kota nanyhima hafungo mwa lwanda lwa Naili, <verse eid="GEN 41:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 41:18"/>nambona misenga saba jinojile na jinonile jilawa mlwanda lwa Naili na kulya misolo. <verse eid="GEN 41:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 41:19"/>Awo nawawinzwa na misenga jinji saba jigandile lukami. Heni sinajona misenga jifandile kota ajo kuli isi ya Misili. <verse eid="GEN 41:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 41:20"/>Lelo jila misenga jigandile lukami jiwadakula jila misenga saba jinenehe lukami. <verse eid="GEN 41:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 41:21"/>Ila lojiwadakule jila misenga jinenehe, munhu yoneche howeza kuvizela kota najiwadakula jiyawo, kwa vila najali jigandile hihila kota mwaluko. Aho nandilimka kulawa kuli kuwasa. <verse eid="GEN 41:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 41:22"/>Kahi nandota, mbona miso saba jimemile nyhule jitiliwale kuli ibeleje limwe. <verse eid="GEN 41:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 41:23"/>Hamba najiwinzigwa na miso minji saba jilihela chinhu, jigandile na jikalile kwa ivuche lya mbeho ya kugunuche. <verse eid="GEN 41:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 41:24"/>Jila mizuchila jigandile jimela jila mizuchila saba jitiliwale. Lelo heni nandiwalonjela wahawi kulota aku ila kuduhu munhu yadahile kundonjela goya.”<verse eid="GEN 41:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 41:25"/>Aho Yusufu nakamlonjela Falao, “Kulota kwa hegwe kweng'ha kwangulajila mana imwe. Nguluwi nakakugubulila mbuli zoyalingugana kudita behi hihi. <verse eid="GEN 41:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 41:26"/>Jila misenga saba jinonile, ndo miyaka saba, na jila mizuchila saba jinonile ndo miyaka saba kahi, kulota kwa hegwe kuna mana imwe. <verse eid="GEN 41:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 41:27"/>Jila misenga jigandile lukami, jiwadakule jila misenga jinonile, na jila miso saba jilihela chinhu jikalizwe na ivuche lya mbeho kula kugunuche, izeleche kota ndo miyaka saba ja nzala. <verse eid="GEN 41:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 41:28"/>Kota vyondikulonjele, hegwe Falao, Nguluwi nakakugubulila mbuli zoyalingugana kudita behi hihi. <verse eid="GEN 41:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 41:29"/>Kowa na miyaka saba ja kiguta kuli isi yeng'ha ya Misili. <verse eid="GEN 41:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 41:30"/>Ila hamba kowa na miyaka saba ja nzala, na kiguta kuleche kukumbuchilwa. Nzala ayo yoigaza isi ino. <verse eid="GEN 41:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 41:31"/>Kiguta ako kuleche kukumbuchilwa ng'hatu kwa vila nzala yoikuya yowa ng'hulu lukami. <verse eid="GEN 41:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 41:32"/>Kulota kwa hegwe nakuya mala mbili kwa nhelo mbili zilingiwhana kukulajila kota Nguluwi nakamula kwa kukomya kudita ahyo, na heye kodita mbuli ayo behi hihi.<verse eid="GEN 41:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 41:33"/>“Lelo inoga sambi, hegwe Falao, umlajize munhu yawele na uwanzi na luhala, umhe mijito na ludali lwa kuilolela isi yeng'ha ya Misili. <verse eid="GEN 41:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 41:34"/>Kahi, gwaa Falao, wahagule wamizi wanji hano muisi, uwalonjele wakungajize chinhu chimwe kuli chila vinhu vihano vya mbena yeng'ha ya Misili kuli mhela uno wa miyaka saba ya kiguta. <verse eid="GEN 41:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 41:35"/>Uwalonjele awo wamizi wakungajize chilyo cheng'ha kuli miyaka saba ilinguya ya mbena kwa winji. Nyhule azo ziwichigwe hali ludali lwa wamizi wa hegwe, gwaa Falao, iwe ng'hano ya chilyo kwa miji jeng'ha, nawo wailolele nyhule ayo. <verse eid="GEN 41:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 41:36"/>Chilyo acho chowa ng'hano ya hamba kwa isi ya Misili leka ileche kubagama kwa nzala ya miyaka saba ilinguya.”<verse eid="GEN 41:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yusufu kangupegwa ukulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 41:37"/>Kwamula koyamule Yusufu nakoneka kunoga hali Falao na wakulu wa heye weng'ha. <verse eid="GEN 41:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 41:38"/>Ahyo Falao nakawauza wakulu wa heye, “Munhu ayu kana muhe wa Nguluwi. Ndaze, towa na munhu yunji kahi kota ayu?” <verse eid="GEN 41:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 41:39"/>Hamba Falao nakamlonjela Yusufu, “Kwa vila Nguluwi nakakugubulila aga geng'ha, kuduhu munhu yawele na luhala na nyhala kota hegwe. <verse eid="GEN 41:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 41:40"/>Hegwe ndo munhu yoilongoza isi ya heni, na wanhu wa heni weng'ha wowa hali ulongozi wa hegwe. Heni hela ndo mkulu kuleka hegwe kwa vila ndangukalisa hali chigoda cha undewa. <verse eid="GEN 41:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 41:41"/>Lelo Yusufu ndangukuwika sambi uwe mkulu wa isi yeng'ha ya Misili.” <verse eid="GEN 41:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 41:42"/>Aho Falao nakailavya pete iwele ulajilo wa heye hali chidole cha heye na kumvika Yusufu, nakamvika na ivalo lya heye lya kitani inojile na ugasi wa dhahabu kuli singo ya heye. <verse eid="GEN 41:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 41:43"/>Falao nakamkwinhiza kuli mutuka ya heye ya keli ya falasi na wamizi nawelongoza kumwando kwa Yusufu wotowa iyowe na kulonga, “Mumfugamile!” Ahi ndo Falao vyoyampele Yusufu ulongozi mkulu hali isi yeng'ha ya Misili. <verse eid="GEN 41:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 41:44"/>Kupuluta kwa aga, Falao nakamlonjela Yusufu, “Heni ndo Falao. Ndangulonga, munhu yoneche hali isi yeng'ha ya Misili yaleche kudita chinhu choneche ne kukundizwa na hegwe.” <verse eid="GEN 41:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 41:45"/>Falao nakamgalila Yusufu itagwa lya Chimisili, Safenati-paneya. Nakamhesela Asenati mhinza wa Potifela, mtambika wa muji wa Oni. Lelo Yusufu nakaluka kijendela isi yeng'ha ya Misili.<verse eid="GEN 41:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 41:46"/>Yusufu nayali na miyaka makumi gadatu loyaluche kumkolela mijito Falao, mndewa wa Misili. Nakalawa kaye kwa Falao na kuijendela isi yeng'ha ya Misili. <verse eid="GEN 41:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 41:47"/>Kuli miyaka ila saba ya kiguta, migunda ja Misili najilavya mbena nyinji lukami. <verse eid="GEN 41:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 41:48"/>Yusufu nakakungajiza chilyo cheng'ha mhela ula wa miyaka saba ya kiguta na kuwika ng'hano kuli miji ja Misili. Kuli chila muji nakawika ng'hano kulawa kuli migunda ja behi na muji awo. <verse eid="GEN 41:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 41:49"/>Yusufu nakawika nyhule mng'hano kwa winji ng'hatu naiwa nyinji kota sangalaza ya bahali, mbaka nailemwela kuwazika.<verse eid="GEN 41:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 41:50"/>Kung'hali kwaluka miyaka ja nzala, Yusufu nayali na wana walume weli kwa mchewake Asenati, mhinza wa Potifela, mtambika wa muji wa Oni. <verse eid="GEN 41:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 41:51"/>Yusufu nakamchema wana wa heye wa mwaluko Manase, yolonga, “Nguluwi nakandita ndisemwe kugaya kwa heni kweng'ha na wang'holoze mhaza wa heni.” <verse eid="GEN 41:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 41:52"/>Mwana wa heye wa keli nakamchema Efulaimu, yolonga, “Nguluwi nakangalila mwana kuli isi ya kugaya kwa heni.”<verse eid="GEN 41:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 41:53"/>Miyaka jila saba ja kiguta hala Misili najikola. <verse eid="GEN 41:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 41:54"/>Najaluka miyaka saba ja nzala kota navyoyalonjile Yusufu hala hamwande. Isi zinji zeng'ha nazali na nzala, ila isi yeng'ha ya Misili nayali na chilyo. <verse eid="GEN 41:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 41:55"/>Wanhu wa Misili lowaluche kona nzala, nawamlilila Falao yawagalile chilyo. Na heye Falao nakawalonjela Wamisili weng'ha, “Mlute kwa Yusufu, loyawalonjelani mkole mumhulichize.” <verse eid="GEN 41:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="GEN 41:56"/>Nzala nailutilila kuwa ng'hulu na kwenela isi yeng'ha. Aho Yusufu nakachumula ng'hano zeng'ha, nakawaguzila Wamisili chilyo. <verse eid="GEN 41:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="GEN 41:57"/>Wanhu kulawa chila honhu muisi nawoya Misili kwa Yusufu kugula chilyo, kwa vila nzala nayali ng'hulu kuli isi yeng'ha.<verse eid="GEN 41:57"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 41"/>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="GEN 42"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 42:1"/>Yakobo naloyahuliche kota kwali na nyhule ako Misili, nakawalonjela wanage, “Lekachoni mwangikalisa mchilola hela? <verse eid="GEN 42:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 42:2"/>Nanyhulika kota Misili kuna nyhule. Mlute ako mkagule nyhule tuleche kubagama kwa nzala.” <verse eid="GEN 42:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 42:3"/>Ahyo, wang'holoze kumi wa Yusufu nawaluta Misili kugula nyhule. <verse eid="GEN 42:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 42:4"/>Ila Yakobo nahamlechile Benjamini mng'holoze Yusufu yalute hamwe na hewo mina nakadumba kota koweza kugazigwa. <verse eid="GEN 42:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 42:5"/>Lelo wana wa Isilaeli nawafika Misili wawele na wanhu wanji walutile kugula chilyo, mina kuli isi ya Kanaani nako kwali na nzala.<verse eid="GEN 42:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 42:6"/>Mhela awo Yusufu nayali ndo chilongozi ako Misili. Heye ndo yawele na ludali lwa kuwaguzila wanhu chilyo. Wakulugwe nawoya kumwinamila mbaka hali magulu ga Yusufu kwa kufugama. <verse eid="GEN 42:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 42:7"/>Yusufu loyawawene wakulugwe nakawazela, ila heye nakawadita kota wajenzi, nakalonga nawo aku yang'hang'hale. Nakawauza, “Mlawila kohi hemwe?” Nawamwidichila, “Tulawila isi ya Kanaani, tuya kugula chilyo.” <verse eid="GEN 42:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 42:8"/>Hanga Yusufu nakawazela wakulugwe, hewo nahawamzelele. <verse eid="GEN 42:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 42:9"/>Yusufu nakakumbuchila navyoyalotile katali kwa mbuli ya wakulugwe, nakawalonjela, “Hemwe muya kutupugajiza. Muya kulola isi ya hetwe vyoiwele na kubowala” <verse eid="GEN 42:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 42:10"/>Hewo wamwidichila, “Hebu, mkulu wa hetwe. Hetwe vitumagwa wa hegwe tuya kugula chilyo. <verse eid="GEN 42:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 42:11"/>Hetwe twa lukolo, wana wa mhaza yumwe. Hetwe twa vitumagwa wa hegwe na twa wanhu tutanganiche, na hatuwele wapugajizi hebu.” <verse eid="GEN 42:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 42:12"/>Ila Yusufu nakalonga, “Hebu! Hemwe muya kulola kubowala kwa isi ya hetwe.” <verse eid="GEN 42:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 42:13"/>Nawamlonjela, “Hetwe, vitumagwa wa hegwe, twa kumi na mbili, wana wa munhu yumwe, wenyeng'haye wa isi ya Kanaani. Mdodo wa hetwe nakapona na mhaza kaye, na mng'holozetu yunji kabagama.” <verse eid="GEN 42:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 42:14"/>Ila Yusufu nakawalonjela, “Kota navyondonjile, hemwe mwa wapugajizi hela. <verse eid="GEN 42:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 42:15"/>Ahi ndo vyomjezigwa, ndangilaha kwa itagwa lya Falao, kota hamlawa aha mbaka mdodo wa hemwe hoyokuya. <verse eid="GEN 42:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 42:16"/>Mumlajize yumwe wa hemwe yakamigale ayo mng'holozenu mdodo, hanga wayenu wanji wombeteza mchinweng'ho. Aho ndo ulonzi wa hemwe wozeleka kukomya kokuli. Wone hebu, ndangilaha kwa itagwa lya Falao kota hemwe mwa wapugajizi.” <verse eid="GEN 42:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 42:17"/>Hamba nakawawika weng'ha mchinweng'ho kwa mhela wa mazuwa gadatu.<verse eid="GEN 42:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 42:18"/>Zuwa lya kadatu, Yusufu nakawalonjela, “Kwa vila heni ndangumdumba Nguluwi, mdite hino leka muwe wakomu. <verse eid="GEN 42:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 42:19"/>Wone mkomya hemwe mtanganika, yumwe wa hemwe yapone mchinweng'ho na wanji wawegalile nyhule wang'holozenu wawele na nzala. <verse eid="GEN 42:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 42:20"/>Hamba mmigale kwa heni mdodo wa hemwe. Ayi yotawiza kukomya kwa ulonzi wa hemwe, namwe hamkopoligwa.” Lelo nawakunda kudita ahyo. <verse eid="GEN 42:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 42:21"/>Hamba walongasa hewo kwa hewo, “Twangukomya hetwe tumditila vibi mng'holozetu. Hanga natumona yawele na ching'oni mnhumbula, hetwe nahatumhulichize hala nahoyatulandile. Ndo mina kugaya aku kweng'ha kutuyila.” <verse eid="GEN 42:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 42:22"/>Lubeni nakawalonjela, “Ndaze, hemwe nasiwalonjelani tuleche kumditila gehile mng'holozetu? Ila hemwe nahamnyhulichize. Lelo twangugazigwa kwa mbuli ya danda ya heye.” <verse eid="GEN 42:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 42:23"/>Hewo nahawavizelele kota Yusufu nakavizela geng'ha ago gowalonjile, mina naloyalonjile na hewo nayali kwa nzila ya munhu yavizelele ulonzi ula. <verse eid="GEN 42:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 42:24"/>Yusufu nakaluta hafungo, nakaluka kulila. Loyanyamalile, nakahiluka kulongasa na hewo. Hamba nakamibata Simeoni na kumuwopa pingu hali meho ga hewo.<verse eid="GEN 42:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wang'holoze Yusufu wanguhiluka kaye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 42:25"/>Yusufu nakalajiza mihako jawo jiwichigwe nyhule, chila yumwe yahilusilwe migwala ja heye mli mhako wa heye na wapegwe ndiya ya mnzila. Nawaditilwa mbuli azo zeng'ha. <verse eid="GEN 42:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 42:26"/>Wawadwika midogowi jawo mihako jawo ja nyhule na kuka. <verse eid="GEN 42:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 42:27"/>Naiwa lowafichile honhu ha kuwasa wajenzi ako kunzila, yumwe wa hewo nakagubula igunila lyake leka yalipe chilyo idogowi lyake, nakabubuwala kona migwala hamlomo mwa igunila. <verse eid="GEN 42:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 42:28"/>Nakawalonjela wang'holoze, “Migwala ja heni jeng'ha jihiluswa. Azino hano hamlomo mwa igunila lyangu!” Lowahuliche ago, nawagozola. Nawelola aku wokakama na kiwuza, “Ndo mbuli yachi ayi yatuditile Nguluwi?”<verse eid="GEN 42:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 42:29"/>Lowafichile isi ya Kanaani kwa mhaza wa hewo Yakobo, nawamsimila geng'ha gayawafichile nawamlonjela, <verse eid="GEN 42:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 42:30"/>“Mndewa wa isi ila nakalonga natwe kwa kung'hang'hala, na kijesa kota hetwe twangupugajiza gali mli isi ya heye. <verse eid="GEN 42:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 42:31"/>Ila hetwe natumlonjela kota hetwe twa wanhu watanganiche na hatulingupugajiza isi ya wanhu. <verse eid="GEN 42:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 42:32"/>Natumlonjela hetwe twa kumi na weli wa mhaza yumwe, na yumwe wa hetwe nakabagama na yula mdodo ka kaye kuli isi ya Kanaani hamwe na mhaza wa hetwe. <verse eid="GEN 42:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 42:33"/>Ndo chilongozi wa isi ila nakatulonjela, ‘Ahi ndo vyondiwazela kota hemwe mwangukomya kota mwa wanhu wa kukomya, mlecheni kwa heni yumwe wa hemwe, namwe mponile muhiliche chilyo kaye kwa wanhu wa hemwe wawele na nzala. <verse eid="GEN 42:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 42:34"/>Hamba mmigale kwa heni ayo mdodo wa hemwe na aho ndovizela kota hemwe hamuwele wasunjilila wa isi ya wanhu ila mwa wanhu mtanganiche. Homdita ahyo ndomlechela mng'holozenu, namwe mokundigwa muwe mguza na kugula vinhu kuli isi ayi.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 42:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 42:35"/>Lowali wojida nyhule mli migunila jawo, nawabubuwala kona chila yumwe wa hewo kahilusilwa mhako wa sendi mgati mwa igunila lya heye. Lowawene ago, weng'ha hamwe na mhaza wa hewo nawamema majesa. <verse eid="GEN 42:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 42:36"/>Mhaza wa hewo Yakobo, nakawalonjela, “Mwangumboka wana wa heni! Yusufu haduhu, Simeoni haduhu, sambi mwangugana kumhola Benjamini. Nongwa zeng'ha azo zifika heni!”<verse eid="GEN 42:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 42:37"/>Aho Lubeni nakamlonjela mhaza wa heye, “Wone ndemwele kumhilusa Benjamini, wakopole wana wa heni weli. Mleche Benjamini mmoko mwa heni, nani ndomlolela na kumhilusa kwa hegwe.” <verse eid="GEN 42:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 42:38"/>Ila mhaza wa heye nakamwidichila, “Mwana wa heni holuta na hemwe, mng'holoze mina nakabagama, na heye yeka ndo yaponile. Heni ndala ndina mbuliza hekwa, wone msongolo ayu yafichigwe na nongwa yoneche mlimajendo yomkwaluka, mweng'ha monyilika kuli isi ya wabagame mbele ng'hongoloka na mbuliza na memile masinzo.”<verse eid="GEN 42:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 42"/>
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="GEN 43"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 43:1"/>Hamba nzala nailutilila kung'hang'hala ng'hatu kuli isi ila ya Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 43:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 43:2"/>Chila chilyo nachowagulile kula Misili nalochimalile, Yakobo nakawalonjela wanage, “Mlute kahi Misili mkatugulile chilyo.” <verse eid="GEN 43:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 43:3"/>Ila Yuda nakamlonjela mhaza wa heye, “Yula munhu nakatulonjela yang'ang'ale yolonga, ‘Siwabochela wone hamuyile na mng'holozo mdodo.’ <verse eid="GEN 43:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 43:4"/>Wone kokunda Benjamini tulutase, lelo toluta kukugulila chilyo. <verse eid="GEN 43:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 43:5"/>Ila wone hulingukunda tulutase hamwe, hatuluta hebu ako, kwa vila yula munhu nakatulonjela hazelu, ‘Hammbona homkuya ne mdodowenu.’ ” <verse eid="GEN 43:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 43:6"/>Isilaeli nakalonga, “Lekachoni mnyinjize kuli magazo kwa kumlonjela ayo munhu kota mwanaye mng'holozenu yunji?” <verse eid="GEN 43:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 43:7"/>Nawamwidichila, “Yula munhu nakatuuza yakangaze ng'hatu kwa mbuli ya ivyazi lya hetwe yolonga, ‘Ndaze, mhaza wa hemwe yang'hali mkomu? Ndaze, mwanaye mng'holozenu yunji?’ Ahyo natumwidichila kota vyoyatuuzile. Hatulinguvizela kota kotulonjela, ‘Mmigale mng'holozenu.’ ” <verse eid="GEN 43:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 43:8"/>Yuda nakamlonjela, Yakobo mhaza wa heye, “Ung'hundize heni ndute na heye leka tuche himahima, tuche tukakugulile chilyo, tuleche bagama na nzala hamwe na hegwe na wana wa hetwe. <verse eid="GEN 43:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 43:9"/>Nene baha ndowa mwamizi wa heye. Hegwe kondanda heni. Wone simhiluse umone kwa meho gako, nongwa yeng'ha iwe kwa heni mazuwa gose. <verse eid="GEN 43:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 43:10"/>Wone nahatukawile, natwali tulutile na kuhiluka lwa keli.”<verse eid="GEN 43:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 43:11"/>Aho Yakobo mhaza wa hewo nakawalonjela, “Lelo, kwa yangulapigwa iwe ahyo, lelo mdite ahi, mhole gamwe ga chilyo cha isi ya hetwe mli mihako ja hemwe, mumhilichile ayo chilongozi ndolendole. Mumholele mafuta mado ga mkwaju na hanombwa nyindo na ifunyizi na manemane na kungu na ng'weme. <verse eid="GEN 43:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 43:12"/>Mhole na migwala mala ya keli na zila zilingulapigwa, kwa vila mwanguganigwa kuhilusa migwala jila jiwichigwe mmigunila ja hemwe, hanji nazihiluswa ne kuvizela. <verse eid="GEN 43:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 43:13"/>Mumhole na mng'holozenu mlutase kwa ayo munhu. <verse eid="GEN 43:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 43:14"/>Mkulu Nguluwi Yawele na Mong'ho yawonele isungu hali munhu ayo yawalechele yula mng'holozenu yunji na Benjamini wahiluche hamwe na hemwe. Heni loindapa kifiligwa na wana wa heni ena.”<verse eid="GEN 43:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 43:15"/>Aho nawahola zila ndolendole na migwala jonjezeche lwa keli, nawaluta Misili hamwe na mng'holozo Benjamini. Lowafichile nawaluta na kwima hali Yusufu. <verse eid="GEN 43:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 43:16"/>Yusufu loyamuwene Benjamini hamwe na hewo, nakamlonjela chitumagwa wa ng'handa ya heye, “Wahiliche wanhu awa hakaye hangu, ukome igongolo limwe na kugongomanya goya, mina wanhu awa wolya chilyo cha nemisi hamwe na heni.” <verse eid="GEN 43:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 43:17"/>Chitumagwa ayo nakadita kota navyoyalajizwe, nakawahilika wala wajenzi kaye kwa Yusufu. <verse eid="GEN 43:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 43:18"/>Lowawene wahilikwe kuli ng'handa ya Yusufu nawamema majesa, nawalonga hewo kwa hewo, “Tigaligwa kuno kwa mbuli ya jila migwala jotuhilusilwe mli migunila ja hetwe nalotuyile hala ha mwaluko leka yawe na cha kusinjizila kututowa na kutusukula midogowi ja hetwe na kutudita wapogozi wa heye.” <verse eid="GEN 43:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 43:19"/>Nawamhejelela yula mkola mijito wa kukundigwa wa ng'handa ya Yusufu, walongasa wawele mlwizi lwa ng'handa, <verse eid="GEN 43:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 43:20"/>nawamlonjela, “Dedede, mkulu. Hetwe natuya hano hamwaluko kugula chilyo. <verse eid="GEN 43:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 43:21"/>Lotufichile honhu ha kuwasa wajenzi ako kunzila, natudohola migunila jetu, natububuwala kufika migwala ja chila yumwe wa hetwe jali hamlomo mwa igunila lyake ne kudolizwa. Lelo tujihilusa migwala ajo. <verse eid="GEN 43:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 43:22"/>Tigala na migwala jinji kugulila chilyo. Hatuvizelele yalikohi yawichile migwala ja hetwe mmigunila ja hetwe.” <verse eid="GEN 43:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 43:23"/>Yula chitumagwa nakawedichila, “Mikale goya, na mleche kudumba. Nguluwi wa hemwe, Nguluwi wa mhaza wa hemwe, ndo yawahilusile migwala mli migunila ja hemwe. Heni nambochela migwala ja hemwe.” Hamba nakawegalila Simeoni mng'holozawo. <verse eid="GEN 43:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 43:24"/>Ayo chitumagwa nakawabochela mng'handa ya Yusufu, nakamha mazi ga kuhovuga magulu gawo, na midogowi jawo jipegwa chilyo. <verse eid="GEN 43:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 43:25"/>Nawo nawawika goya ndolendole za hewo za kumha Yusufu, kwa vila nawahulika kota wolya hamwe na heye nemisi yila.<verse eid="GEN 43:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 43:26"/>Yusufu loyoyile kaye, nawamigalila zila ndolendole nazowawele nazo, nawamfugamila mbaka hanyi kumwando kwa heye. <verse eid="GEN 43:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 43:27"/>Nakawauza mbuli za hewo, nakalonga, “Namsimila mbuli za mhaza wa hemwe. Ndaze, kalamka? Yang'hali mkomu?” <verse eid="GEN 43:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 43:28"/>Nawamwidichila, “Chitumagwa wa hegwe, mhaza wa hetwe, kagoya yang'hali mkomu.” Nawenamiza na kumfugamila. <verse eid="GEN 43:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 43:29"/>Yusufu naloyenule meho nakumona Benjamini, mng'holoze, mwana wa mayake, nakalonga, “Ayu ndo mng'holozenu mdodo namndonjele mbuli za heye? Nguluwi nayakuditile ganojile mwana wa heni!” <verse eid="GEN 43:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 43:30"/>Baho du Yusufu nakoka honhu aho, kwa vila mihozi najigana kumlawa kwa isungu lya mng'holoze, nakenjila mng'handa na kulila. <verse eid="GEN 43:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 43:31"/>Naloyehovuje kumeho, nakalawa aku yochikangaza, nakalajiza ndiya igaligwe. <verse eid="GEN 43:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 43:32"/>Yusufu nakawichilwa ndiya ya uyeka, na wang'holoze wawichilwa ha uyeka, hihyo na Wamisili wadile hamwe na heye, nawawichilwa kwa uyeka, kwa vila izudizo kwa Wamisili kulya hamwe na Waebulaniya. <verse eid="GEN 43:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 43:33"/>Wang'holoze Yusufu nawekala kumwando kwa heye kota vyoiwele ukulu wa chila yumwe, kwaluchila yapondigwe mwaluko, mbaka wa kuduma, wawa wochilola kwa kububuwala. <verse eid="GEN 43:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 43:34"/>Ndiya nayali iholigwa kulawila mchisaga cha Yusufu na kuhilikwa kwa hewo, ila Benjamini nakapegwa kahano mzidi wa chila chowapegwe wang'holoze. Nawanwa na kusangalala hamwe na heye.<verse eid="GEN 43:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 43"/>
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="GEN 44"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 44:1"/>Hamba Yusufu nakamlajiza chitumagwa wa ng'handa ya heye yolonga, “Uwiche chilyo mli migunila ja wanhu awa kota vyowohega kupika. Hamba, uwiche migwala ja chila yumwe hamlomo mwa igunila lyake. <verse eid="GEN 44:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 44:2"/>Mli igunila lya yula mdodo kusinda weng'ha, uwiche chila chizombe cha heni chauyeng'ha, hamwe na migwala ja heye.” Ayo chitumagwa nakadita kota navyoyalajizwe na Yusufu. <verse eid="GEN 44:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 44:3"/>Lokuchele nawalonjelwa kwaluka majendo hamwe na midogowi jawo. <verse eid="GEN 44:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 44:4"/>Lowalutile honhu hado kulawila kuli muji, Yusufu nakamlajiza chitumagwa wa ng'handa ya heye, “Himahima! Wawinze wala wanhu, na houwafika, uwauze, ‘Lekachoni mhilusa gehile kwa ganojile gomditilwe? <verse eid="GEN 44:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 44:5"/>Lekachoni lomhizile chizombe cha mkulu wa heni, choyanwelaga na kulagulila? Mdita wihe ng'hatu kwa kudita ahyo.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 44:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 44:6"/>Yula chitumagwa naloyawafichile nakawalonjela ulonzi awu. <verse eid="GEN 44:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 44:7"/>Ila hewo nawamuuza, “Mkulu, iwa ndaze kutulonjela ulonzi kota awo? Hetwe vitumagwa wa hegwe, hatujeza kudita mbuli kota ayo! <verse eid="GEN 44:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 44:8"/>Ukumbuchile mkulu, migwala natujifichile mmilomo mwa migunila ja hetwe natujihilusa kuli isi ya Kanaani. Yowa ndaze kahi tuhize sendi ama zahabu mli ng'handa ya mkulu wa hegwe? <verse eid="GEN 44:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 44:9"/>Lelo wone yoneche yumwe wa hetwe kana chizombe acho yakopoligwe, na hetwe tweng'ha towa wapogozi wa hegwe.”<verse eid="GEN 44:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 44:10"/>Ayo mkulu nakalonga, “Goya, iwe kota vyoulonjile. Yoneche yokoneka na chizombe acho, kowa mpogozi wa heni, ila wanji weng'ha hamuwa na nongwa.” <verse eid="GEN 44:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 44:11"/>Chila yumwe nakawika hanyi igunila lyake na kulidohola himahima. <verse eid="GEN 44:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 44:12"/>Yula chitumagwa nakapekulapekula migunila geng'ha yokwaluchila lya mkulu wawo na kumalila kwa mdodo ng'hatu. Chizombe nachoneka mli igunila lya Benjamini. <verse eid="GEN 44:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 44:13"/>Aho nawadadula nguwo za hewo kwa masinzo. Chila munhu nakawika igunila lyake mli idogowi na kuhiluka mujini.<verse eid="GEN 44:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 44:14"/>Yuda na wang'holoze nawafika kuli ng'handa ya Yusufu, nawamfika yang'hali baho haluga. Nawamfugamila chiundewa, <verse eid="GEN 44:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 44:15"/>na heye Yusufu nakawauza, “Lekachoni namdita ahyo? Ndaze hamvizelele kota heni ndina ludali lwa kulagula?” <verse eid="GEN 44:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 44:16"/>Yuda nakamwidichila, “Tukulonjele choni mkulu? Tulonje choni kulajila kota twahela wihe? Nguluwi nakawika hazelu wihe wa hetwe, hetwe wapogozi wa hegwe, hamwe na yula yoneche na chizombe cha hegwe.” <verse eid="GEN 44:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 44:17"/>Ila Yusufu nakalonga, “Hebu! Heni siweza kudita ahyo! Yula yoneche na chizombe cha heni ndo kowa chitumagwa wa heni. Hemwe wanji mhiluche goya kwa mhaza wa hemwe.”<verse eid="GEN 44:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yuda kangumgombela Benjamini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 44:18"/>Ndo baho Yuda nakamhejelela Yusufu na kumlonjela, “Mkulu, ndangukulanda ung'hundize heni chitumagwa wa hegwe, ndigombele hali hegwe kwa ulonzi udo hela, dedede ndangukulanda uleche kuzudila, kwa vila hegwe ndo kota Falao yuye. <verse eid="GEN 44:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 44:19"/>Mkulu, hegwe nakutuuza kota twanaye mhaza ama mng'holozetu, <verse eid="GEN 44:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 44:20"/>natwe natukulonjela kota twanaye mhaza, naye kalala, na twanaye mng'holozetu yunji mdodo yapondigwe mhela wa ulalilo wa mhaza wa hetwe. Mkulugwe ayo msongolo mina kabagama, na ayo mwana mdodo ndo yaponile wa mayake na mhaza wa heye kangumgana lukami msongolo ayo. <verse eid="GEN 44:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 44:21"/>Mkulu, nakutulajiza hetwe vitumagwa wa hegwe kumigala mdodo wa hetwe leka umone. <verse eid="GEN 44:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 44:22"/>Natukulonjela kota ayo msongolo hochileka na mhaza wa heye, kwa vila hoyodita ahyo, mhaza wa heye kobagama. <verse eid="GEN 44:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 44:23"/>Ila hegwe mkulu nakutulonjela wone hatuyile na mdodo wa hetwe hutubochela kahi.<verse eid="GEN 44:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 44:24"/>“Nalotuhiluche kaye kwa chitumagwa wa hegwe, mhaza wa hetwe, natumlonjela vyoutulajize mkulu. <verse eid="GEN 44:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 44:25"/>Na heye naloyatulonjele tuye kahi kuno kugula chilyo, <verse eid="GEN 44:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 44:26"/>natumlonjela, ‘Hatuluta, hanji wone mdodo wa hetwe koluta hamwe na hetwe, wone holuta hamwe na hetwe hatubocheligwa hebu na yula munhu.’ <verse eid="GEN 44:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 44:27"/>Lelo mhaza wa hetwe chitumagwa wa hegwe, nakatulonjela, ‘Mvizela kota mchewangu Laheli nakamhondela wana weli. <verse eid="GEN 44:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 44:28"/>Yumwe nakaga, nani nandonga, ndangona kota kebatigwa na kudumulangwa viundeunde na igongolo lya kisolo, mina sinamona mbaka sambi. <verse eid="GEN 44:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 44:29"/>Lomumhola ayu kahi kulawa kwa heni, wone yafichigwe na nongwa, monyhilika kuli isi ya wanhu wabagame mbele ng'hongoloka na mbuliza na memile masinzo.’ <verse eid="GEN 44:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 44:30"/>Lelo mkulu, hondihiluka kwa mhaza wa heni chitumagwa wa hegwe ne msongolo ayu, hanga ukomu wa mhaza wangitumbila ukomu wa msongolo yuno, <verse eid="GEN 44:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 44:31"/>wone hambe yamone msongolo ayu hamwe na hetwe, kobagama. Lelo hino, hetwe vitumagwa wa hegwe, tomhilika mhaza wa hetwe kuli isi ya wanhu wabagame yawele ng'hongoloka na mbuliza nayamemile masinzo. <verse eid="GEN 44:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 44:32"/>Kwa ago geng'ha, heni baha nandilavya kuwa honhu ha msongolo ayu kwa mhaza wa heni, ndilonga, ‘Wone simhiluse Benjamini kwa hegwe, nongwa yeng'ha na iwe kwa heni mazuwa gose.’ <verse eid="GEN 44:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 44:33"/>Lelo gwaa mkulu, ndangukudedeza, heni chitumagwa wa hegwe ndiwe mkomu, ndiwe chitumagwa wa hegwe honhu ha msongolo ayu. Mlechele heye yahiluche kaye hamwe na wang'holoze. <verse eid="GEN 44:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 44:34"/>Ndoweza ndaze kumhiluchila mhaza ne msongolo ayu? Sikwimilila kulola nongwa yoimfika mhaza wa heni.”<verse eid="GEN 44:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 44"/>
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="GEN 45"/>
  <para style="s">Yusufu kangizelesa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 45:1"/>Aho Yusufu nakalemwela kilemeza hali wanhu weng'ha wowawele hamwe na heye, nakalila. Hamba nakawalonjela walawe kunze. Ahyo Yusufu nayali yaliyeka loyawelengizelesa hali wang'holozake. <verse eid="GEN 45:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 45:2"/>Ila nakalila kwa lizi ng'hulu mbaka Wamisili nawamhulika, na wanhu wa kuli ng'handa ya Falao kahi nawamhulika. <verse eid="GEN 45:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 45:3"/>Yusufu nakawalonjela wang'holozake, “Heni nda Yusufu. Ndaze, mhaza wa heni yang'hali mkomu?” Ila wang'holozake nawabubuwala hali heye, mbaka nawalemwela kumwidichila. <verse eid="GEN 45:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 45:4"/>Yusufu nakawalonjela wang'holozake, “Dedede, mhejele habehi na heni.” Lowamhejelele, nakawalonjela, “Heni nda mng'holozenu Yusufu, mumguzile Misili. <verse eid="GEN 45:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 45:5"/>Ila sambi mleche kona soni ne kilonjeleza kwa kunguza heni. Nguluwi ndo yengalile heni kuno ndiwalongole, leka ndiulohole ukomu wa wanhu. <verse eid="GEN 45:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 45:6"/>Awu ndo mwaka wa keli hela wa nzala muisi, ing'hali miyaka jihano jiyage aho wanhu howeza kulima ne kubeta mbena. <verse eid="GEN 45:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 45:7"/>Nguluwi nakangala kuno ndiwalongoze leka nyamile ukomu wa hemwe mpone muwele wakomu muisi na kuwalohola kwa ulohozi ukulu. <verse eid="GEN 45:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 45:8"/>Ahyo, hemwe hamingale heni kuno, ila ndo Nguluwi. Ndo yanditile kota mhaza kwa Falao, yalingulolela ng'handa ya heye yeng'ha na chilongozi wa isi yeng'ha ya Misili. <verse eid="GEN 45:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 45:9"/>Lelo mdite himahima, mlute kwa mhaza na kumlonjela, ‘Yusufu, mwana wa hegwe, kangulonga, Nguluwi nakandita ndiwe mkulu wa isi yeng'ha ya Misili. Lelo mleche kukawa kuya kwa heni. <verse eid="GEN 45:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 45:10"/>Kochikala habehi na heni honhu ha Gosheni, hegwe na wanago na wazukulu wa hegwe na migongolo ja hegwe na lufufu lwa hegwe lweng'ha. <verse eid="GEN 45:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 45:11"/>Louwa Gosheni, heni ndokulolela hegwe na wang'holozo hamwe na migongolo ja hegwe leka mleche kubagama kwa nzala, kwa vila jing'hali miyaka jihano jinji ja nzala.’ ” <verse eid="GEN 45:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 45:12"/>Hamba Yusufu nakalonga, “Hemwe mwemwe namona kwa meho ga hemwe na mng'holozangu Benjamini kahi nakona kwa meho ga heye kota ndo heni Yusufu ndiwelengulongasa na hemwe. <verse eid="GEN 45:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 45:13"/>Ingana ndimlonjele mhaza wa heni choni chondidayila kuno Misili na geng'ha gomgawene. Lelo mdite himahima mumgale mhaza wa heni kuno.” <verse eid="GEN 45:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 45:14"/>Hamba Yusufu nakamnonela Benjamini mng'holoze, nakalila, na Benjamini na heye nakalila kuno wekumbatize. <verse eid="GEN 45:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 45:15"/>Loyawele yang'hali yolila, Yusufu nakawakumbatiza wang'holozake na kuwanonela. Aho ndo wang'holozake waluka kudawala na heye.<verse eid="GEN 45:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Falao kangumlalika Yakobo yoye Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 45:16"/>Mbuli ila loifichile hali ng'handa ya Falao, kota wang'holoze Yusufu nawoya, Falao nakasangalala lukami na vitumagwa wa heye. <verse eid="GEN 45:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 45:17"/>Ahyo, Falao nakamlonjela Yusufu, “Walonjele wang'holozo wajipiche mhomolo midogowi, wahiluche mli isi ya Kanaani, <verse eid="GEN 45:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 45:18"/>wamgale hano mhaza wa hewo na wang'holozawo weng'ha. Heni ndowagalila honhu hanojile ng'hatu ha isi ya Misili, ako wosangalala kwa chila chinhu cha isi ino namwe molya vihande vya mafuta ga isi. <verse eid="GEN 45:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 45:19"/>Walonjele kahi wahole kulawa hano mimutuka ja kukwejigwa ja kuvigala vyali vya hewo vyeng'ha na wadala wa hewo na wamgale mhazawo. <verse eid="GEN 45:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 45:20"/>Walonjele waleche kujesa lufufu lwa hewo mina honhu hanojile kusinda kweng'ha hali isi ya Misili yowa ya hewo.”<verse eid="GEN 45:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 45:21"/>Lelo wanhu wa Isilaeli nawadita kota vyowalajizwe. Yusufu nakawagalila mimutuka kota vyoyalajize Falao na chilyo cha mnzila. <verse eid="GEN 45:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 45:22"/>Nakawagalila chila yumwe wa hewo nguwo za kugalula, ila nakamgalila Benjamini migwala miya zidatu na mivalo jihano ja kugalula. <verse eid="GEN 45:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 45:23"/>Kahi nakamgalila mhaza wa heye ndolendole zino kwa chiwalo cha majendo ga heye, midogowi kumi jipichile vinhu vinojile, midogowi midala kumi mbena zinojile za Misili na mibumunda na vilyo vinji. <verse eid="GEN 45:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 45:24"/>Lelo Yusufu nawelagana na wang'holoze. Lowawele wokuka, nakawakanya yolonga, “Mleche kitwanza mzila.”<verse eid="GEN 45:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 45:25"/>Lelo nawalawa Misili na kuhiluka hakaye kwa mhaza wa hewo Yakobo, kuli isi ya Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 45:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 45:26"/>Nawamlonjela mhaza wa hewo, “Yusufu ka mkomu. Heye ndo chilongozi wa isi yeng'ha ya Misili.” Aho mhaza wa hewo nakabubuwala, nahakundile ulonzi wa hewo. <verse eid="GEN 45:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 45:27"/>Ila, lowamsimile geng'ha gowalajizwe na Yusufu na loyajiwene mimutuka jila joyagalilwe na Yusufu leka jimhole, nhumbula ya heye naimema kusangalala lukami. <verse eid="GEN 45:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 45:28"/>Isilaeli nakalonga, “Lelo nang'hunda, mwana wa heni Yusufu kamkomu. Ndoluta ndikamone londiwele nding'hali kubagama.”<verse eid="GEN 45:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 45"/>
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="GEN 46"/>
  <para style="s">Yakobo kanguka Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 46:1"/>Lelo Isilaeli nakaluka majendo ga heye hamwe na lufufu lwa heye lweng'ha. Loyafichile Beeli-sheba, nakamlavila nhambiko Nguluwi wa Isaka, mhaza wa heye. <verse eid="GEN 46:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 46:2"/>Nguluwi nakalonga na Isilaeli kuli ulotezi nechilo, nakamchema, “Yakobo! Yakobo!” Yakobo nakedichila, “Ena ndanguhulichiza.” <verse eid="GEN 46:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 46:3"/>Nguluwi nakamlonjela, “Heni ndo Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa mhaza wa hegwe. Uleche kudumba kuka Misili, louwa kuko, ndokudita uwe nhanzi ng'hulu. <verse eid="GEN 46:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 46:4"/>Na heni ndokuka hamwe na hegwe kuko Misili na kukuhilula kuno. Loubagama, moko wa Yusufu ndo wokugosa.”<verse eid="GEN 46:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 46:5"/>Lelo Yakobo nakoka Beeli-sheba. Wana wa heye nawamhola heye na vyali vya hewo hamwe na wadala wa hewo hali mimutuka jiwele Falao yajigale kumhola. <verse eid="GEN 46:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 46:6"/>Nawahola kahi migongolo ja hewo na lufufu lwa hewo lweng'ha lowapatile kuli isi ya Kanaani, nawaluta Misili. Yakobo nakahola lukolo lwa heye lweng'ha. <verse eid="GEN 46:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 46:7"/>Wana wa heye na wazukulu wa heye walume na wadala, weng'ha nakawagala Misili.<verse eid="GEN 46:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 46:8"/>Walelwa wa Isilaeli nawalutile Misili hamwe na heye nawali Lubeni, mlelwa wa heye wa mwaluko <verse eid="GEN 46:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 46:9"/>hamwe na wana wa Lubeni, Enoki na Palu na Hesiloni na Kalimi. <verse eid="GEN 46:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 46:10"/>Simeoni na wanage, Yemueli na Yamini na Ohadi na Yakini na Sohali na Shauli nayapondigwe na mdala nayawele Mkanaani. <verse eid="GEN 46:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 46:11"/>Lawi na wanage, Gelishoni na Kohati na Melali. <verse eid="GEN 46:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 46:12"/>Yuda na wanage, Eli na Onani na Shela na Pelesi na Sela, ila Eli na Onani nawabagama kuli isi ya Kanaani. Wana wa Pelesi nawali Hesiloni na Hamuli. <verse eid="GEN 46:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 46:13"/>Isakali na wanage, Tola na Puva na Yashubu na Shimuloni. <verse eid="GEN 46:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 46:14"/>Sebuluni na wanage, Seledi na Eloni na Yaleeli. <verse eid="GEN 46:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 46:15"/>Awo ndo wana Lea nayampondele Yakobo kula Padani-alamu, hamwe na Dina mhinza wa heye. Weng'ha wasongolo na wahinza wa heye nawali wanhu makumi gadatu na zidatu.<verse eid="GEN 46:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 46:16"/>Gadi na wanage, Sifioni na Hagi na Shuni na Esiboni na Eli na Alodi na Aleli. <verse eid="GEN 46:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 46:17"/>Asheli na wanage, Imuna na Ishiva na Ishivi na Belia na Sela na lumbuli yao. Belia na wanage, Hebeli na Malikieli. <verse eid="GEN 46:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 46:18"/>Awa kumi na sita ndo wana wa Yakobo na Silipa, mpogozi yawele Labani nayampele Lea mhinza wa heye.<verse eid="GEN 46:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 46:19"/>Laheli nakampondela Yakobo wana weli, Yusufu na Benjamini. <verse eid="GEN 46:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 46:20"/>Ako Misili, Asenati mhinza wa Potifela, nayawele mtambika wa muji wa Oni, nakampondela Yusufu wana weli, Manase na Efulaimu. <verse eid="GEN 46:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 46:21"/>Wana wa Benjamini nawali, Bela na Bekeli na Ashibeli na Gela na Naamani na Ehi na Loshi na Mupimu na Hupimu na Alidi. <verse eid="GEN 46:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 46:22"/>Wanhu awo kumi na wane ndo wana na wazukulu wa Yakobo na Laheli mchewake.<verse eid="GEN 46:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 46:23"/>Dani na Hushimu mwanage. <verse eid="GEN 46:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 46:24"/>Nafutali na wanage, Yaseeli na Guni na Yeseli na Shilemu. <verse eid="GEN 46:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 46:25"/>Awo saba ndo wana wa Yakobo na Biliha, mpogozi wa chidala yawele Labani nayampele mhinza wa heye Laheli.<verse eid="GEN 46:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 46:26"/>Weng'ha walelwa wa Yakobo nayalutile nawo Misili, ne kuwaza wadala wa wana wa heye, nawali makumi sita na sita. <verse eid="GEN 46:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 46:27"/>Ako kuli isi ya Misili Yusufu nayali yapatile wana weli. Ahyo, wanhu weng'ha wa lukolo lwa Yakobo nawali makumi saba.<verse eid="GEN 46:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yakobo kangufika Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 46:28"/>Yakobo nakamlongola mwanage Yuda kwa Yusufu yomlanda wewone ako Gosheni, na hewo nawafika ako Gosheni. <verse eid="GEN 46:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 46:29"/>Yusufu nakakwina mutuka wa heye wa falasi, nakaluta kumbochela Isilaeli, mhaza wa heye ako Gosheni. Loyamfichile mhaza wa heye, nakamkumbatila na kulila hado hela. <verse eid="GEN 46:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 46:30"/>Isilaeli nakamlonjela Yusufu, “Wone mbagame sambi, haiwele chinhu, kwa vila ndikona na ndivizela kota kwa mkomu.” <verse eid="GEN 46:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 46:31"/>Yusufu nakawalonjela wang'holoze na ivyazi lyeng'ha lya mhaza wa heye, “Ndanguluta kumlonjela Falao kota wang'holozangu na ivyazi lyeng'ha lya mhaza wa heni nawawele ako Kanaani, woya kwa heni. <verse eid="GEN 46:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 46:32"/>Ndomlonjela kota hemwe mwa wadimi kwa vila namwali mdima migongolo, muya hamwe na mhene na ming'holo na misenga na lufufu lwenu lweng'ha. <verse eid="GEN 46:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 46:33"/>Lelo wone Falao yowachema na kuwauza, ‘Mwangukola mijito yachi?’ <verse eid="GEN 46:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 46:34"/>Mlonje, ‘Mkulu, hetwe vitumagwa wa hegwe, hetwe twa wadimi kulawila lotuwele wana mbaka sambi, kwa vila ndo lowali wasekulu wa hetwe,’ mlonje ahyo leka mkundigwe kikala kuli honhu ha Gosheni, kwa vila kwa wanhu wa Misili, wadimi weng'ha wa ming'holo ndo izudizo.”<verse eid="GEN 46:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 46"/>
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="GEN 47"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 47:1"/>Lelo Yusufu nakaluta kwa Falao, nakamlonjela, “Mhaza wa heni na wang'holozangu hamwe na ming'holo na misenga na lufufu lwao lweng'ha woya kuli isi ya Kanaani. Lelo wafichila ako Gosheni.” <verse eid="GEN 47:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 47:2"/>Yusufu nayali yawaholile wang'holoze wahano yakamlajile Falao. <verse eid="GEN 47:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 47:3"/>Falao nakawauza, “Mwangukola choni?” Nawamwidichila, “Mkulu hetwe vitumagwa wa hegwe twa wadimi, kota navyowawele wasekulu wa hetwe.” <verse eid="GEN 47:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 47:4"/>Hamba nawamlonjela Falao, “Hetwe vitumagwa wa hegwe tuya kikala kota wajenzi kuli isi ayi, kwa vila hana nzala lukami ako Kanaani na kuduhuli honhu ha kudimila migongolo. Ahyo mkulu, hetwe twangulanda utukundize kikala ako Gosheni.” <verse eid="GEN 47:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 47:5"/>Falao nakamlonjela Yusufu, “Mhaza wa hegwe na wang'holozo wakuyila hegwe. <verse eid="GEN 47:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 47:6"/>Isi yeng'ha ya Misili ya hali ulongozi wa hegwe, wamhe mhaza na wang'holozo honhu hanojile kuli isi ayi. Wekale ako Gosheni. Na wone wamumo wanhu wawanzi wahagule wawe wololela migongolo ja heni.”<verse eid="GEN 47:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 47:7"/>Hamba Yusufu nakamigala mhaza wa heye Yakobo yamlamse Falao, na heye Yakobo nakamtambichiza Falao. <verse eid="GEN 47:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 47:8"/>Falao nakamuuza Yakobo, “Kuna miyaka jilinga?” <verse eid="GEN 47:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 47:9"/>Yakobo nakamwidichila Falao, “Miyaka joyamhele Nguluwi kota mwinula majendo ndo miyaka miya imwe na makumi gadatu. Miyaka ajo ndo mido na imemile magazo, kahi haifichile kota miyaka najowekale wasekulu wa hetwe kota wanhu wawele kwinula majendo.” <verse eid="GEN 47:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 47:10"/>Hamba Yakobo nakamtambichiza Falao na kuka. <verse eid="GEN 47:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 47:11"/>Lelo Yusufu nakawapa mhaza wa heye na wang'holoze honhu ha Lamesesi liwele na mboto ng'hatu kuli isi ya Misili hawe honhu ha kikala hewo, na hewo nawahalila kota vyoyalajize Falao. <verse eid="GEN 47:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 47:12"/>Yusufu nayali yowapa chilyo mhaza wa heye na wang'holoze na ivyazi lyeng'ha lya mhaza wa heye kota winji wa hewo vyouwele.<verse eid="GEN 47:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ulongozi wa Yusufu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 47:13"/>Hamba chilyo nachajilila ng'hatu kuli isi yeng'ha. Nzala naing'ang'ala ng'hatu mbaka iwadita wanhu weng'ha kuli isi ya Misili na Kanaani kuganda. <verse eid="GEN 47:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 47:14"/>Yusufu nakakungajiza migwala jeng'ha ja isi ya Misili na Kanaani kwa chilyo choyaguzile na kuhilika migwala ajo kwa mndewa Falao. <verse eid="GEN 47:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 47:15"/>Wanhu weng'ha wa isi ya Misili na Kanaani lowesilwe migwala jeng'ha, Wamisili weng'ha nawamuyila Yusufu na kumlonjela, “Tugalile hetwe chilyo. Lekachoni tubagame aku ulola? Ulole migwala jeng'ha jimala.” <verse eid="GEN 47:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 47:16"/>Yusufu nakamlonjela, “Wone migwala jeng'ha jimalile, lelo mungalile migongolo jenu nani ndowapa chilyo.” <verse eid="GEN 47:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 47:17"/>Ndo baho wamigalila Yusufu migongolo jawo, falasi na misenga na ming'holo na mhene na midogowi kwa kugula chilyo. Mhela awo Yusufu nayali yowapa chilyo kwa kulavya migongolo.<verse eid="GEN 47:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 47:18"/>Mhela uyage nawamuyila kahi na kumlonjela, “Mkulu, twangukomya kuta migwala ja hetwe jeng'ha jimala, na migongolo jeng'ha jiwa ja hegwe. Lelo mkulu, hetwe vitumagwa wa hegwe twahela chinhu chotuweza kukugalila, ila ng'huli za hetwe na migunda ja hetwe. <verse eid="GEN 47:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 47:19"/>Ya choni hetwe kubagama aku hali hegwe na migunda ja hetwe jiwe vibi? Utugule hetwe hamwe na migunda ja hetwe tuwe wapogozi wa Falao, leka tulye chilyo. Tugalile chilyo tuleche kubagama, tugalile na nyhadikwa kwa chiwalo cha kunyala kuli migunda ja hetwe.”<verse eid="GEN 47:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 47:20"/>Ahyo, Yusufu nakaigula isi yeng'ha ya Misili iwe ya Falao. Chila munhu yalingikala Misili, nakaganigwa kuguza mgunda wa heye kwa vila nzala navyoiwele ing'ang'ale. Ahyo, isi yeng'ha nayali ya Falao. <verse eid="GEN 47:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 47:21"/>Yusufu nakawadita wanhu wawe wapogozi, kulawila nzingo imwe mbaka nzingo iyage ya isi ya Misili. <verse eid="GEN 47:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 47:22"/>Migunda jiwele Yusufu hambe hagulile ndo jila najiwele ja watambika. Awo nawalajizwa waleche kuguza migunda jawo kwa vila hewo nawali wochikala kwa kupegwa chilyo na Falao. <verse eid="GEN 47:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 47:23"/>Hamba Yusufu nakawalonjela wanhu, “Lole, mina ndiwagula hemwe mweng'ha na migunda ja hemwe kuwa lufufu lwa Falao. Mopegwa nyhadikwa namwe monyala kuli migunda ja hemwe. <verse eid="GEN 47:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 47:24"/>Mhela wa mbena, imwe ya zihano za nyhadikwa momha Falao. Honhu hane hasigale, howa nyhadikwa na chilyo kwa ivyazi lya hemwe na wana wa hemwe.” <verse eid="GEN 47:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 47:25"/>Nawamwidichila wata, “Mkulu, kulohola ukomu wa hetwe. Kwa vila kutulajila uganililo, hetwe towa wapogozi wa Falao.” <verse eid="GEN 47:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 47:26"/>Ndo Yusufu nayawichile ilajizo limwe liwele lyabahala mbaka lehano kuli isi ya Misili kota chila munhu yalavye honhu hamwe ha kahano ya mbena ya heye kwa Falao. Migunda ja watambika jiliyeka ndo hajiguligwe na kuditikwa jiwe ja Falao.<verse eid="GEN 47:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ulonzi wa kuduma wa Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 47:27"/>Lelo wanhu wa Isilaeli nawekala ako Gosheni kuli isi ya Misili. Lowawele ako, nawawa na lufufu lwinji, kiponda na konjezeka lukami. <verse eid="GEN 47:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 47:28"/>Yakobo nakekala kuli isi ya Misili kwa miyaka kumi na saba mbaka naloyawele na miyaka miya imwe na makumi gane na saba.<verse eid="GEN 47:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 47:29"/>Mhela wa kubagama kwa heye louwele habehi, Yakobo nakamchema mwanage Yusufu nakamlonjela, “Lelo wone ukomya kuna igano lya kwimilila, uwiche moko wa hegwe mihaza jangu, na kilaha kota konditila goya na kondajila makundo, uleche kutila lukuli lwangu akuno Misili, <verse eid="GEN 47:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 47:30"/>ila ukatile lukuli lwangu kota vyoiwele kwa wasekulu wa heni. Uhole lukuli lwangu kulawa Misili na kuza kutila kuli vilaga vya hewo.” Yusufu nakamwidichila, “Ndodita kota vyoulonjile.” <verse eid="GEN 47:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 47:31"/>Yakobo nakamlonjela, “Wilahe.” Yusufu nakelaha. Hamba Isilaeli nakafugama banzi ya kumitwi mwa chinanda cha heye na kuta malumbo Nguluwi.<verse eid="GEN 47:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 47"/>
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="GEN 48"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 48:1"/>Logapulute ago, Yusufu nakalonjelwa kota mhaza wa heye kangutamika. Ahyo, nakawahola wanage weli, Manase na Efulaimu, nakaluta nawo kwa mhaza wa heye. <verse eid="GEN 48:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 48:2"/>Yakobo vyoyalonjelwe kota mwanage Yusufu koya kumlola, naketatamula kwinuka na kikalisa mchinanda. <verse eid="GEN 48:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 48:3"/>Yakobo nakamlonjela Yusufu, “Nguluwi yawele na mong'ho nakandawila nalondali kula Lusu kuli isi ya Kanaani, nakanhambichiza. <verse eid="GEN 48:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 48:4"/>Nakandonjela, ‘Ulole, ndokudita hegwe uwe na lulelo na lonjezeche, ndokudita uwe sekulu wa nhanzi nyinji ng'hulu. Isi ayi ndowapa lulelo lwa Waisilaeli weng'ha, waihalile mazuwa gose.’ ” <verse eid="GEN 48:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 48:5"/>Yakobo nakalutilila kulonga, “Wanago weli uwapondile aha Misili mhela londing'hali kuya, wowa wana wa heni. Manase na Efulaimu wowa wana wa heni kota vyowawele Lubeni na Simeoni. <verse eid="GEN 48:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 48:6"/>Ila wana wouwaponda hamba wowa wa hegwe, kwa itagwa lya ivyazi lya hewo, wowa kuli uhalizi wa wang'holozawo. <verse eid="GEN 48:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 48:7"/>Ndangwamula ahyo kwa chiwalo cha mayako, Laheli. Lombele ndihiluka, kulawila Padani heye nakabagama kuli isi ya Kanaani, lotuwele behi kufika Efulata, nakandechela masinzo. Lelo nandimtila baho du, hafungo mwa nzila ilinguluta Efulata, mina ndo Betelehemu.”<verse eid="GEN 48:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 48:8"/>Isilaeli loyawawene wana wa Yusufu, nakawauza, “Awa wanhu wachi?” <verse eid="GEN 48:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 48:9"/>Yusufu nakamwidichila mhaza wa heye, “Awa ndo wana wa heni woyamhele Nguluwi lombele aku.” Isilaeli nakalonga, “Dedede, uwegale behi ndiwatambichize.” <verse eid="GEN 48:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 48:10"/>Meho ga Isilaeli nagali hambe galole goya kwa chiwalo cha ulalilo. Lelo Yusufu nakawahejeza wanage behi nayekale mhaza wa heye, na heye nakawanonela na kuwakumbatila. <verse eid="GEN 48:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 48:11"/>Hamba Isilaeli nakamlonjela Yusufu, “Nasijesile kota ndokona kumeho kwa hegwe kahi, ila Nguluwi kamha utambichizo mbaka kuwona wana wa hegwe.” <verse eid="GEN 48:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 48:12"/>Aho Yusufu nakawosa wanage kuli mafugamilo ga mhaza wa heye, hamba nakenamiza kwa kuhulichiza. <verse eid="GEN 48:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 48:13"/>Yusufu nakawenula wanage weli, Efulaimu kuli moko wa heye wa kudilo yomhinduchiza kuli moko wa kumoso wa mhaza wa heye na Manase kuli moko wa heye wa kumoso yomhinduliza kuli moko wa kudilo kwa mhaza wa heye Isilaeli, nakawahejeza kwa mhaza wa heye. <verse eid="GEN 48:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 48:14"/>Ila Isilaeli nakaipinjiza moko kwa kuwika wa kudilo kawika kuli mutwi wa Efulaimu hanga nayali mdodo na moko wa kumoso nakawika kuli mutwi wa Manase nayawele mlelwa wa mwaluko. <verse eid="GEN 48:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 48:15"/>Hamba Isilaeli nakamtambichiza Yusufu yolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:15">“Nguluwi yawele wasekulu wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:15">Abulahamu na Isaka nawali womhulichiza kuli ukomu wa hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:15">Nguluwi ndo mdimi wa heni mbaka lehano,<verse eid="GEN 48:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 48:16"/>na mhilisi nayawele yandohole kuli wihe weng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:16">na yawatambichize wasongolo awa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:16">Wochemigwa wana wa heni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:16">kwa lulelo lwa wasekulu wa heni Abulahamu na Isaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:16">na hewo wonjezeche kwa winji muisi.”<verse eid="GEN 48:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 48:17"/>Yusufu loyawene kota mhaza wa heye kawika moko wa heye wa kudilo kuli mutwi wa Efulaimu nahanojezwe hebu. Lelo nakebata moko wa mhaza wa heye yogana kusa kuli mutwi wa Efulaimu yauwiche kuli mutwi wa Manase. <verse eid="GEN 48:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 48:18"/>Yusufu nakamlonjela mhaza wa heye, “Haiwele ahyo mhaza. Ayu ahano ndo mlelwa wa mwaluko. Dedede, uwiche moko wa hegwe wa kudilo kuli mutwi wa heye.” <verse eid="GEN 48:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 48:19"/>Ila mhaza wa heye nakalema yolonga, “Ndivizela mwanangu, ndivizela. Wana wa Manase kahi wowa nhanzi ng'hulu. Ila mng'holoze mdodo kowa mkulu kusinda heye na walelwa wa heye wowa nhanzi nyinji.” <verse eid="GEN 48:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 48:20"/>Lelo Isilaeli nakawatambichiza zuwa ahyo yolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:20">“Waisilaeli wowa wotambichiza kwa matagwa ga hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:20">wolonga, ‘Nguluwi yakuditile ganojile kota Efulaimu na Manase.’ ”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="GEN 48:20">Ndo Isilaeli navyoyamuwichile Efulaimu kumwando kwa Manase.<verse eid="GEN 48:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 48:21"/>Hamba Isilaeli nakamlonjela Yusufu, “Kota vyoulingumbona heni, ndahabehi kubagama. Ahyo, Nguluwi kowa hamwe na hemwe na kuwahiluseni kuli isi ya wasekulu wa hemwe. <verse eid="GEN 48:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 48:22"/>Mzidi wa ago, ndikupa hegwe uwele mkulu kusinda wang'holozo, honhu hakulu hachemigwe Shekemu. Hondiwasukule Waamoli kwa ipanga na upinde wa heni wa msale.”<verse eid="GEN 48:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 48"/>
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="GEN 49"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 49:1"/>Yakobo nakawachema wanage, nakalonga, “Mikungajize hamwe ndiwalonjele mbuli ziwafika hamba.<verse eid="GEN 49:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 49:2"/>“Mikungajize mhulichize hemwe wana wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:2">mnyhulichize heni Isilaeli mhaza wa hemwe.<verse eid="GEN 49:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 49:3"/>“Hegwe Lubeni ndo mlelwa wa heni wa mwaluko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:3">ludali lwangu na ifuza lya usongolo wa heni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:3">Hegwe kuna ukulu na mong'ho ng'hatu.<verse eid="GEN 49:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 49:4"/>Hegwe kwanguwifya kota mazi gamemile tendema.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:4">Ila huwa wa mwaluko kahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:4">kwa vila nakukwina mchinhanda cha heni mhaza wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:4">hegwe nakuchidita chikokomoche kwa kuwasa na mchewangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:4">ena, hegwe nakuchikwina!<verse eid="GEN 49:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 49:5"/>“Simeoni na Lawi mwa lukolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:5">wangukopola kwa migoha jawo,<verse eid="GEN 49:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 49:6"/>ila heni sikunda kihanza na nongwa za hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:6">hegwe nhumbula ya heni, uleche kihanza mli nhing'hano za hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:6">mina mli kuzudila kwa hewo, nawawakopola wanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:6">kwa ujuvi wa hewo nawakanha idanha lya isenga.<verse eid="GEN 49:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 49:7"/>“Ndangupanjila kuzudila kwa Simeoni na Lawi, mina ndo kung'ang'ala lukami,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:7">na ng'alazi ya hewo yahela isungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:7">Ndowasambalula kuli isi ya Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:7">ndoweneza kuli isi ya Isilaeli.<verse eid="GEN 49:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 49:8"/>“Hegwe Yuda, wang'holozo wokutogola.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:8">Wang'honyo wa hegwe kowadinga singo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:8">na wang'holozo wofugama kumwando kwa hegwe.<verse eid="GEN 49:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 49:9"/>Hegwe Yuda mwanangu ndo kota isimba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:9">yebatile igongolo na kukwina kuchanya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:9">Kota vila isimba lilingigolola na kuwasa hasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:9">isimba liwele na mong'ho, yalikohi yojeza kulililimla?<verse eid="GEN 49:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 49:10"/>Idela lya undewa halikuka kwa Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:10">ne ng'hweku ya ulongozi hali heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:10">mbaka hoyofika yula yawichilwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:10">yawele kohulichizwa na nhanzi zeng'ha.<verse eid="GEN 49:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 49:11"/>Kowa na zabibu nyinji, kolikoweleza idogowi lya heye hali mzabibu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:11">na idogowi lyana kuli mzabibu unojile, leka jilye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:11">Kwa vila mzabibu naulela lukami,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:11">kohovuga nguwo za heye mli divai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:11">na mivalo ja heye mli divai ndung'hu kota danda.<verse eid="GEN 49:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 49:12"/>Meho ga heye nagoneka ganoga kota divai inojile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:12">mizino ja heye mizelu kota itombo.<verse eid="GEN 49:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 49:13"/>“Sebuluni kochikala honhu hawele mwhani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:13">kumwhani kwa heye kowa honhu hakwimizila meli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:13">Isi ya heye yobakana na Sidoni.<verse eid="GEN 49:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 49:14"/>“Isakali ndo kota idogowi liwele na mong'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:14">lilinguwasa hagati ha mitunyo ja heye.<verse eid="GEN 49:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 49:15"/>“Nakona kota kambi inoga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:15">na kota isi ndo yakunojeza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:15">nakenamiza mhungo ya heye kupapa itunyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:15">nakawa mpogozi kukola mijito kwa lupichi.<verse eid="GEN 49:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 49:16"/>“Dani kowa mhanyisi wa wanhu wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:16">kota yumwe wa lukolo lwa Isilaeli.<verse eid="GEN 49:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 49:17"/>“Dani kowa kota izoka mnzila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:17">izoka liwele na dunga hafungo mwa nzila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:17">lilinguluma chisigino cha falasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:17">na heye yakwinile falasi kangugwa lung'ata.<verse eid="GEN 49:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 49:18"/>Hegwe Mkulu Nguluwi, ndangukubeteza undohole.<verse eid="GEN 49:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 49:19"/>“Gadi, kovadigwa na wabokaji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:19">ila heye kowawinza kumbele na kuwadumya.<verse eid="GEN 49:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 49:20"/>Isi ya Asheli yolavya mbena kwa winji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:20">na heye kolavya chilyo chinonile kwa mndewa.<verse eid="GEN 49:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 49:21"/>“Nafutali ndo kota ibala lilejehe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:21">lilingulela wana wanojile.<verse eid="GEN 49:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 49:22"/>“Yusufu ndo kota igodi lilingulela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:22">igodi lilingulela hafungo mwa nzasa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:22">nhagala za igodi zitanda mlukanzi.<verse eid="GEN 49:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 49:23"/>Walasa misale nawamvada vibi ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:23">wamtozela msale wogana kumgaza lukami.<verse eid="GEN 49:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 49:24"/>Ila upinde wa heye ung'hali ukakamale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:24">na moko ga heye nagapegwa uwanzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:24">kwa ludali lwa Nayawele na Mong'ho wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:24">kwa chiwalo cha Mdimi, Italawe lya Isilaeli,<verse eid="GEN 49:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 49:25"/>kwa Nguluwi wa mhaza wa hegwe yokutanza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:25">kwa Nguluwi yawele na mong'ho yokutambichiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:25">uwe na utambichizo wa nhonya kulawa kuchanya kilanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:25">utambichizo wa kuli mazi menji gawele hasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:25">utambichizo wa lulelo lwa wachimai na migongolo.<verse eid="GEN 49:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 49:26"/>Utambichizo wa mhaza wa hegwe usumye utambichizo wa vidunda vya mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:26">uwe unojile kusinda vidunda vya katali.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:26">Utambichizo awo uwe mchanya mwa mutwi wa Yusufu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:26">mli chihanga cha heye nayabaguligwe kota chilongozi kwa wang'holoze.<verse eid="GEN 49:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 49:27"/>“Benjamini ndo libwa lya kisolo ling'ang'ale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:27">lufuku lyangulya lyolibate,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:27">na matinazo kangugawa upelembi.”<verse eid="GEN 49:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 49:28"/>Azo ndo nhanzi kumi na mbili za Isilaeli na awo ndo ulonzi woyawalonjele mhaza wa hewo loyawatambichize, chila yumwe wa hewo kota vyoyaganigwe.<verse eid="GEN 49:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kubagama kwa Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 49:29"/>Hamba Isilaeli nakawalajiza wana wa heye ahi, “Heni ndahabehi kubagama na kilumba na wasekulu wa heni. Mkatile lukuli lwangu hamwe na wasekulu wa heni kuli chilaga chiwele kuli mgunda wa Efuloni Mhiti, <verse eid="GEN 49:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 49:30"/>kula Makipela, kolilawilaga isanya kwa Mamle kuli isi ya Kanaani. Abulahamu nakagula ipalika na mgunda awo kwa Efuloni Mhiti liwe lya heye kutilila wanhu wabagame. <verse eid="GEN 49:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 49:31"/>Ako ndo kowatiligwe Abulahamu na mchewake Sala, ako ndo kowatiligwe Isaka na mchewake Lebeka na ako ndo kondimtilile Lea. <verse eid="GEN 49:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 49:32"/>Ipalika alyo na mgunda wake naliguligwa kwa Wahiti.” <verse eid="GEN 49:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 49:33"/>Yakobo loyasindile kuwalajiza wanage, nakahilusa magulu ga heye mchinhanda, muhe nauleka lukuli nakelumba na wasekulu wa heye.<verse eid="GEN 49:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 49"/>
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="GEN 50"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 50:1"/>Aho Yusufu nakamkumbatila mhaza wa heye yolila na kumnonela. <verse eid="GEN 50:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 50:2"/>Hamba Yusufu nakawalajiza wateleka mikwandi wambakalize Isilaeli, mhaza wa heye mikwandi leka yaleche kola, na hewo nawadita hihyo. <verse eid="GEN 50:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 50:3"/>Kota navyoiwele, mazuwa makumi gane nagaganigwa kwa kubakaliza mikwandi. Na hewo Wamisili nawalombocheza kubagama kwa Yakobo kwa mazuwa makumi saba.<verse eid="GEN 50:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 50:4"/>Kulombocheza lokumalile, Yusufu nakawalonjela wakulu wa ng'handa ya Falao, “Wone ndiwe ng'undigwe hali hemwe, dedede, mlonje na Falao kwa chiwalo cha igano lya heni, <verse eid="GEN 50:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 50:5"/>kota mhaza wa heni navyoyanganile heni ndilahe, yolonga, ‘Heni ndahabehi kubagama. Yokugana kuza kutila lukuli lwa heni kuli chilaga nachonyongole kuli isi ya Kanaani.’ Lelo ndangumlanda yamhe mhumhu ndute ndikatile lukuli lwa mhaza wa heni, hamba ndohiluka.” <verse eid="GEN 50:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 50:6"/>Falao nakedichila, “Ulute ukatile lukuli lwa mhaza wa hegwe kota navyoyakulahile.” <verse eid="GEN 50:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 50:7"/>Lelo Yusufu nakoka kuza kumtila mhaza wa heye yelongoze na wakulu weng'ha wa Falao na wasekulu wa ng'handa ya Falao, hamwe na wasekulu wa isi yeng'ha ya Misili. <verse eid="GEN 50:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 50:8"/>Hihyo du, Yusufu yelongoze na ivyazi lya heye lyeng'ha na wang'holoze na ivyazi lyeng'ha lya mhaza wa heye Yakobo. Kula Gosheni nawapona wana wa hewo yeng'ha hamwe na ming'holo na mhene na misenga ja hewo. <verse eid="GEN 50:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 50:9"/>Kahi nawali hamwe na wakwina falasi na mutuka, nachali chilundo chikulu ng'hatu.<verse eid="GEN 50:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 50:10"/>Lowafichile kuli luga lwa kupembulila nyhule lwa Atadi, kumwambu mwa lwanda lwa Yolodani, weng'ha nawalila kwa lizi na usungu ng'hatu. Yusufu nakamditila mhaza wa heye nhanga lukolo kwa mazuwa saba. <verse eid="GEN 50:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 50:11"/>Wakanaani wenyeng'haye wa isi ayo, lowawene kulombocheza kuditilwe kuli luga lwa kupembulila nyhule lwa Atadi, nawalonga, “Kulombocheza aku ndo kwa Wamisili, kukulu ng'hatu.” Ahyo, honhu hala nahachemigwa Abeli-misili, naho ha hamwambu mwa lwanda lwa Yolodani.<verse eid="GEN 50:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 50:12"/>Wana wa Yakobo nawamditila mhaza wa hewo kota navyoyawalajize. <verse eid="GEN 50:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 50:13"/>Nawamhola mbaka isi ya Kanaani, nawamtila kuli ipalika naliwele kuli mgunda kula Makipela, nzingo ya kolilawilaga isanya ya Mamle. Ipalika hamwe na mgunda awo Abulahamu nayali yagulile kwa Efuloni Mhiti, leka hawe honhu ha kutilila wanhu wa ivyazi lya heye. <verse eid="GEN 50:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 50:14"/>Loyasindile kumtila mhaza wa heye, Yusufu nakahiluka Misili hamwe na wang'holoze na wanhu weng'ha nawelongoze na heye kuza kumtila mhaza wa heye.<verse eid="GEN 50:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yusufu kanguwosela lunhwinhwi wang'holoze</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 50:15"/>Loyabagame mhaza wa hewo, wang'holoze Yusufu nawadogola, “Hanji Yusufu kotuzudila na kilipizila gehile geng'ha gotumditile.” <verse eid="GEN 50:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 50:16"/>Ahyo, nawamuhilichila Yusufu usenga, wolonga, “Mhaza wa hegwe naloyang'hali kubagama, nakalajiza ahi, <verse eid="GEN 50:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 50:17"/>‘Umlonjele Yusufu kwa chiwalo cha heni, dedede, uwalechele wang'holozo gala gehile geng'ha gowakuditile.’ Lelo dedede utulechele wihe wotukuditile hetwe vitumagwa wa Nguluwi wa mhaza wa hegwe.” Yusufu loyahuliche usenga awu, nakalila. <verse eid="GEN 50:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 50:18"/>Hamba wang'holoze nawamuyila, wenamiza hasi hali heye, nawalonga, “Ulole, hetwe twa vitumagwa wa hegwe.” <verse eid="GEN 50:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 50:19"/>Ila Yusufu nakawalonjela, “Mleche kudumba, ndaze, heni nda honhu ha Nguluwi? <verse eid="GEN 50:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 50:20"/>Hemwe namgana kunditila vibi, ila Nguluwi nakagana ganojile, leka wanhu wenji wawe wakomu kota vyomlingona. <verse eid="GEN 50:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 50:21"/>Lelo mleche kudumba. Heni ndowapani chilyo hamwe na wana wa hemwe.” Lelo nakawahembuliza na kulongasa na hewo goya.<verse eid="GEN 50:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kubagama kwa Yusufu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 50:22"/>Yusufu nakalutilila kikala kuli isi ya Misili hamwe na ivyazi lyeng'ha lya mhaza wa heye. Nakekala kwa miyaka miya imwe na kumi. <verse eid="GEN 50:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 50:23"/>Yusufu nakawona wana na wazukulu wa mwanage Efulaimu na kahi nakawabochela kota wanage wana wa Makili mwana wa Manase.<verse eid="GEN 50:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 50:24"/>Hamba Yusufu nakawalonjela wang'holoze, “Heni lelo ndahabehi kubagama. Ila Nguluwi kowajendela na kuwatanza. Kowalavya kuli isi ayi na kuwahilika kuli isi yawelahile Abulahamu na Isaka na Yakobo.” <verse eid="GEN 50:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 50:25"/>Hamba Yusufu nakawalajiza wana wa Isilaeli yochilaha na kulonga, “Nguluwi hoyokuya kuwatanza, mhole na mizeje ja lukuli lwangu kulawila aku.”<verse eid="GEN 50:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 50:26"/>Lelo Yusufu nakabagama kula Misili, yawele na miyaka miya imwe na kumi. Na hewo nawaubakaliza lukuli lwake mikwandi luleche kola, nawauwika mitusi kula Misili.<verse eid="GEN 50:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 50"/>
</usx>
